<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Zaareththo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zaareththo Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zaareththo Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zaare</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zaareththo Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Zaareththo maxaafay Isra7eele asay bazzo biittan daro wode hemettishe Kanaane gelanaas guuth ashshidi Mo7aabe deren gam7idaappe guye Musey isttas zaari zaari yootida yo7ota oykkides. Zaareththo maxaafan xaafeti dizayti daro go7iza miishshata giddofe issi issi oosoti hayssafe kaalli dizayta, 1. Musey kase aadhdhida oyddu tammu layththatan hanida daro gita hanota yuushshi qoppidi yootees. Xoossay istta bazzo biittan wostti wostti kaaleththidaakko dereza akeekisson asay Xoossas ammanettiza as gidana malanne suureteththan izas azazettana mala qofsides. 2. Musey tammu azazota zaari zaari yootishe harappeka koyro azazoza birsheththi birshi yootidi derezi Xoossas xalla goynnana mala qofsees; hessarakka gaththidi Isra7eele asay isttas hidotan imettida dereyin dishe istti naaganaas bessiza wogata dumma dumma wogata qonccisi yootides. 3. Musey Xoossi izara caaqettida qaalay ay malakko derezas birshi yootidi derezi hessa he qaalaas ba ammaneteththaa ooraxissana mala istta qofsides. 4. Iyaasoy Musesohon gididi Xoossa deraa kaaleththana mala shuumettides. Musey Xoossaa ammaneteththa gishshas giigida ginxo yexxidaappe guye Isra7eele deraa ubbaa anjjidaappe guye Yordaanoose shaafappe arshey wulliza baggara diza Mo7aabe deren hayqqides. Ha maxaafaas ayfe yo7oy Xoossi ba dosidaytanne doorettida ba dereta izi ashshidayssanne anjjidayssa yootees. Derezikka Xoossa anjjoy izappe shaakettontta shemppora paxa daana mala Xoossi asaas ooththida ooso ubba wode akeekidi istti Xoos siiqanaasinne izas azazettanaas bessizayssa asaa qofsides. Ha maxaafas ayfe qofata oykkida xiqiseti ha maxaafan shemppo 6:4-6 gakkanaas dizayta gidishin heytikka Yesusi, «Azazota ubbatappe aadhdhiza gita azazota» giidi isttas yootida qaalata oykkidayta. Heytikka, «Neni ne GODAA kumeththa wozinappe, kumeththa shemppofe, kumeththa wolqqafe siiqa» gizayssa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Musey koyro haasayda haasaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 1:1-4:49">1:1—4:49</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Musey nam7anththo haasayda haasaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 5:1-26:19">5:1—26:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Tammu azazota <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 5:1-10:22">5:1—10:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Wogata, maaratanne seerata <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 11:1-26:19">11:1—26:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Istti Kanaane gelanaappe kase isttas imettida kaaleththo wogata <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 27:1-28:68">27:1—28:68</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Caaqo qaala ooraxiso <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 29:1-30:20">29:1—30:20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Musey wurseththan haasayda qaala <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 31:1-33:29">31:1—33:29</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muse hayqo <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 34:1-12">34:1-12</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asay Siina Zumaa Matappe Dendi Baana Mala Imettida Azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1"/>Hayssa ha maxaafan diza qaalay wurikka Yordaanoose shaafappe he pinththan arshey mokkiza baggara diza bazzon istti dishin Musey Isra7eele naytas yootida qaala. Museykka ha qaalaa yootiza wode istti Suufe geetettizaso ginara Paaraane katamaappe qasseka hara baggara Topeele, Laaba, Haxirootenne Dizahaabe geetettiza katamata giddon diza Yordaanoose shoobbaan deettes. <verse eid="DEU 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2"/>Siina zumaappe dendidi Qaadeese Barine gakkanaas Eedoome zumata bollara efiza toho ogera biikko tammanne issi gallas ekkees. <verse eid="DEU 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3"/>Gibxeppe istti kezidaappe oyddu tammanththo layththan tammanne issinththa aginay gelida koyro gallas Musey derezas erisana mala GODAY izas yootida qaala ubbaa isttas yootides. <verse eid="DEU 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4"/>Hessika haniday Haseboone katamaan kawoti haariza Amoore dere kawo Sihoonenne Astarooten, Edira7e katamaan uttidi haariza Baasaane kawo Aage xoonidaappe guyenna. <verse eid="DEU 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5"/>Asay Yordaanooseppe arshey mokkiza baggara Mo7aabe deren dishin Musey hayssafe kaalli diza GODAA woga qoncciseth doommides;<verse eid="DEU 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6"/>«Nuni Siina zumaa bolla diza wode GODAA nu Xoossay nuus, ‹Hekko intte hayssa zuma bolla daro gam7ideta; <verse eid="DEU 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7"/>hayssafe guye intte dizasoppe dendi gede gezzettiza Amooreta dere, istta heeran diza Arabe deren diza gezzenne gadha, Negebe dere, Mediteraane abbaa lanqera, Kanaane derenne Libaanoose baggara kanththidi gita haaththaa Efiraaxise shaafaa gakkanaas kanththi biite. <verse eid="DEU 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8"/>Hekko tani ha biittayo inttes immadis; intteka biidi intte aawatas Abrahaames, Yisaaqas, Yaaqoobessinne isttafe guyen yaana istta zereththatas immanaas GODAY caaqqida biittayo laattite› gides» giidi yootides.<verse eid="DEU 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musey Dere Kaaleththizayta Shuumides</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 18:13-27">Kessa 18:13-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9"/>Musey derezas, «He wode tani inttes, ‹Tani tarkka inttena kaaleththanaas dandaykke. <verse eid="DEU 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10"/>Intte GODAY intte qooda Salo xoolintte mala darssides. <verse eid="DEU 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11"/>Ha7ikka intte aawata Xoossay kase inttes immida hidota qaalaa mala shii dakko gujjidi inttena anjjo. <verse eid="DEU 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12"/>Gido attiin ha7i intte garsan diza palamaa, ooshshaanne intte metoza tani tarkka wostta birshana dandayazinaa? <verse eid="DEU 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13"/>Intte intte qommofe qommofe akeekay, aadho erateththi dizaytanne ooththi losidayta doorite; tanikka istta intte bolla shuumana› ga yootadis.<verse eid="DEU 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14"/>«Intteka, ‹Ne shiishshida qofay lo7o› gi ekkideta. <verse eid="DEU 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15"/>Hessa gishshas issi issi qommofe intte dooridayta ooso losidayta, aadho eranchchatanne akeekizayta inttefe ekkada baggayta shaalaqata, baggayta mato halaqata, baggayta hamsa halaqatanne asira halaqata, baggayta qommota kaaleththiza halaqa histta shuumadis.<verse eid="DEU 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16"/>«Ta he wode isttas, ‹Intte deraa garsan dendiza palamanne oosh ekki geellay baynda suure pirda pirdite; intte deraa giddon woykko hara dereppe yiidi intte giddon diza asaas geellay baynda suure pirda pirdite. <verse eid="DEU 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17"/>Intte gela pirda pirdofte; guuth gidiin gita gidiin maado pirda pirdofte; pirday Xoossas gidida gishshas ay asaska babofte; inttefe bolla gididayssa ubbaa taakko ehite; hessa tani pirdana› gadis. <verse eid="DEU 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18"/>Intte ooththanaas bessizayssa ta inttes he wode lo7eththa yootadis.<verse eid="DEU 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qaadeese Barineppe Dereza Yuuyi Wochchizayta Kiiteteth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Tay 13:1-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19"/>«Hessafe guye nu GODAY nuna azazida mala Siina zumaappe dendidi intte be7ida iita bazzozara kanththidi Amoore deren shaara menththora aadhdhi biidi Qaadeese Barine gakkidos. <verse eid="DEU 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20"/>Tani inttes, ‹Xoossay nuna laatissanaas qaala gelida shaara menththo gidida Amoore dere hekko gakkideta. <verse eid="DEU 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21"/>He dereyo hanno be7ite! GODAY nu aawata Xoossay beni azazida mala intte gelidi izo laattite; baboftenne hidota qanxxofte› ga yootadis.<verse eid="DEU 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22"/>«Intte ubbatikka taakko yiidi, ‹He biittayn diza katamati ay malakko qasse nuna hee gaththana ogeykka ay mala ogekko bi wochchi simmidi nuus yootana asata nu garsafe ane dooroos› giidi tana oychchideta.<verse eid="DEU 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23"/>«Hessa histtanayssi taas lo7o misati beettiin intte garsafe qommaafe qommaafe issi issi as doorada tammanne nam7u asata yeddadis. <verse eid="DEU 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24"/>Isttika shaara menththo deraara kanththi biidi Eshkoole shoobba gakkanaas yuuyi xomosi xeellida. <verse eid="DEU 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25"/>Isttika heen ba be7ida miththaa ayfeppe amardayssa ekki yiidi GODAA nu Xoossay nuus immana qoppida biittaya keeha lo7o biitta gididayssa nuus qonccisi yootida.<verse eid="DEU 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26"/>«Gido attiin GODAA intte Xoossaa azazo bolla makkallida gishshas he biittayo gelanaas koyibeekketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:23">Zaare 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 3:16">Ib 3:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27"/>Intte intte dunkaanen, ‹Xoossi nuna ixxides; izi nuna Gibxeppe kessiday hayta Amoore asatan nuna wodhisanaassinne istta kushen nuna aaththi immanaassa; <verse eid="DEU 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28"/>histtiin nu hee aazas bizonii? Nuni babboos; nuni kiittida asati heen diza asay wurikka minonne keehi adussata gididayssa qasseka istti diza katamata gimbey salo gakkidayssa nuus yootida; keehi adus gidida Enaaqe nayta be7ida› giidi zuuzumideta.<verse eid="DEU 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29"/>«Gido attiin tani inttes, ‹Hayta ha asatas baboftenne dagammofte. <verse eid="DEU 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30"/>Inttefe sinththara biza GODAA intte Xoossay kase intte ayfen be7ishin Gibxeta bolla ooththoyssa mala ha7ikka izi intte gishshas olettana. <verse eid="DEU 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31"/>Aaway ba naa al7isiza mala intte biza bazzo biitta ubbaan izi inttena kaaleththishe inttena saron hayssa wostti gaththidaakko intte beyideta.›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:18">Hawa 13:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 1:31"/><verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32-33"/>Ha ubbaa ta yootiinkka intte dunkkaanana sohoza bessanaassinne intte baana oge bessanaas omars tuussa taman, gallas tuussa mala shaaran inttena kaaleththida intte GODAAN ammanettibeekketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:19">Ib 3:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 1:32-33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Isra7eele Asaas Immida Qixaate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 14:20-45">Tay 14:20-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34"/>«Intte zuuzumida zuuzunththaa Xoossi siyidi hanqettides; <verse eid="DEU 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35"/>hessa gishshas, ‹Tani kase intte aawatas immana gaada caaqqida he lo7o biittayo ha iita yeletaappe issoyka gelenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:34-35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:18">Ib 3:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36"/>Yoofine naa Kaalebey xalla he biittayo gelana; izikka kumeththa wozinappe ammanetti beettida gishshas he izi be7ida biittayo izassinne iza zereththatas ta immana› gi caaqqides.<verse eid="DEU 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37"/>«Intte gaason GODAY tana hanqettidi, ‹Muse nenikka he dereyo gelakka. <verse eid="DEU 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38"/>Gido attiin nena maaddiza Nawe naa Iyaasoy he biittayo gelana; he biittayokka laattana mala Isra7eele nayta kaaleththanay iza gidida gishshas ne iza menththeththa› gides.<verse eid="DEU 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39"/>«Qasseka GODAY inttes, ‹Intte nu nayti di7ettana› gida iitanne kiya shaakki erontta qii nayti xalla he biittayo gelana; tani he biittayo isttas immana; isttika he biittayo laattana. <verse eid="DEU 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40"/>Intte gidikko simmidi Zo7o abbaako efiza ogezara duge bazzo biite» gides.<verse eid="DEU 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41"/>«Intteka, ‹Musee! Nuni nu GODAA qohidos; ha7i GODAY nu Xoossay nuna azazida mala nu olettana› gideta; he shaara menththo dereyo worajjoy kawushsha miish misati beettiin issoy issoy olas giigettideta» gides.<verse eid="DEU 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42"/>GODAY gidikko, «Ta inttenara ke7ontta gishshas olas kezopite; intte ixxis gi kezikko intte morkketi inttena xoonana» giidi taas yootides. <verse eid="DEU 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43"/>Tanikka GODAY taas yootoyssa inttes yootadis shin intte ixxideta. Iza bollaka makkallideta; otoro daroppe dendidayssan intte he shaara menththo biittayo olanaas bideta. <verse eid="DEU 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44"/>He zumbullata bolla diza Amoore dere asati inttenara ola oykettida; istta olanchchati maththa mala intte bolla yiidi Horma gakkanaas inttena yedeththida; zumbullati dari uttida Eedoome deren inttena xoonida. <verse eid="DEU 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45"/>Hessa gishshas intte simmi yiidi GODAA sinththan yeekkideta; gido attiin izi intte yeehozanne waasoza siyidi inttena maaddanaas koyibeenna. <verse eid="DEU 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46"/>Histtiin intte Qaadeesen daro wode gam7ideta.<verse eid="DEU 1:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Nayti Bazzo Biittan Toylattida Wodeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1"/>Hessafe guye Xoossi azazida mala gede Zo7o abbaako efiza ogezara guye simmi duge bazzo biitta bidos; nuni heen toylattishe shaara menththo Eedoome deren daro wode gam7idos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:4">Tay 21:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2"/>Hessafe guye GODAY taas hizgi yootides. <verse eid="DEU 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3"/>«Intte ha shaara menththo deretan daro wode toylattideta; ha7i pudeha bagga simmi biite. <verse eid="DEU 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4"/>Deraa, ‹Intte dabbo Eesawe zereththati diza Eedoome derera aadhdhi baana; istti inttes yayyana; gidikkoka intte keehi naagettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:8">Medhe 36:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5"/>Shaara menththon diza Eedoome biittaa ta Eesawes xinxxo histta immida gishshas istta biittafe tohoy yedhdhizasokka ta inttes immida istta bolla ola denththofte. <verse eid="DEU 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6"/>Inttes koshshiza kath gidiin haath miishshan shammi ekkite› ga azaza» gides.<verse eid="DEU 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7"/>GODAA intte Xoossay intte ooththida ubbaa inttes keehi anjjides; intte hayssa wolqqama bazzozara kanththi biza wode ishalsi oykkides; ha oyddu tammu layth kumeththaan GODAA intte Xoossay inttenara diza gishshas aykkoyka inttes paccibeenna.<verse eid="DEU 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8"/>Hessa gishshas nuni nu isha Eesawe zereththati diza Eedoome biittara kanththi bidos; qasse Eelaatepenne Eexiyoon-Gaabire katamaappe yiza ogezara Arabe ogezara Mo7aabe bazzo simmi bidos.<verse eid="DEU 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9"/>Xoossayka taas, «Looxe zereth Mo7aabe asata waayisopite; isttara olettanaas istta denththeththofte; tani Eere katama isttas duussaso histta immida gishshas istta xinxxofe aykkoka inttes immike» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:37">Medhe 19:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10"/>[Eemime geetettiza wolqqama daro derey Eeren dees; heytikka Enaaqe zereththa mala gubbaninne geesan gitata. <verse eid="DEU 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11"/>Istti Enaaqe asata mala Erafaymeta geetetti xeygetteettes; Mo7aabe asay qasse istta Eemimeta gi xeygees; hankko Mo7aabe asay qasse istti Imaameta gi xeygeettes. <verse eid="DEU 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12"/>Hoore asay kase Eedoome biittaan dees; gido attiin Isra7eele asay laattana mala GODAY isttas immida biittan istti ooththoyssaththo Eesawe zereththati Uure asaa gooddi dhayssidi istta biittan keexxi uttida.]<verse eid="DEU 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13"/>Hessafe guye GODAY nuus yootida mala Zaraade geetettiza shaafaa pinnidos. <verse eid="DEU 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14"/>Nuni Qaadeese Barineppe biidi Zaraade shaafa pinnanaas heedzdzu tammanne osppun layththi aadhdhides; he wode GODAY istta gishshas kase caaqqida mala he yeletaappe olas gakkida attuma asay ubbay wurides. <verse eid="DEU 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15"/>Istti ubbay wurana gakkanaas GODAA kushey istta bolla deexxides. <verse eid="DEU 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16"/>Olas gakkida attuma asay ubbay wuridaappe guye, <verse eid="DEU 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17"/>GODAY hizgides, <verse eid="DEU 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18"/>«Mo7aabe deres tiixa bolla diza Eere biittara intte hach kanththi baanaas bessees. <verse eid="DEU 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19"/>Hessafe kaallidi Looxe zereth gidida Amoone asata waayisopite; isttara olettanaas istta denththeththofte; tani Amoone biittaa isttas duussaso histta immida gishshas istta xinxxofe aykkoka inttes immike.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:38">Medhe 19:38</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20"/>[He biittay kase heen diza asay xeygiza sunththan Erafaymeta biitta geetettidi xeygettees; qasse Amoone asay Zamizumeta gi xeygees. <verse eid="DEU 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21"/>Isttika Enaaqe zereththa mala gubbaninne geesan gitata, wolqqamanne daro dere; gido attiin GODAY istta dhayssiin Amooneti istta biitta laattidi heen keexxi uttida. <verse eid="DEU 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22"/>GODAY Eedoomen de7iza Eesawe zereththatas ooththida mala isttaskka ooththides; hessika izi he biittan de7iza Hooreta dhayssiin Eesawe zereththati istta biittaa laattidi hach gakkanaas heen keexxi uttida. <verse eid="DEU 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23"/>Gaaza gakkanaas de7iza heeratan diza Awe dere asata Kaftoore geetettiza biittafe yida Kaftoore asati istta dhayssidi istta biittan keexxi uttida.]<verse eid="DEU 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24"/>Nuni Mo7aabe achchara aadhdhidaappe guye Xoossi nuus, «Ha7i dendidi Arnoone shaafaa pinnite; Haseboonen uttidi haariza Amooreta kawo Sihoonenne iza deraakka tani inttes aaththa immadis; intte iza olidi iza biittaa laattite. <verse eid="DEU 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25"/>Hachchafe guye awankka diza dere asay inttes babbana mala ta ooththana; oonikka intte gishshas siyidi wurikka hirgan kokkorana» gides.<verse eid="DEU 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kawo Sewoone Xooneteth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Tay 21:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26"/>Hessafe guye saroka kiita asa bolla Qidimoote bazzofe gede Haseboone kawo Sihoonekko kiittadis. <verse eid="DEU 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27"/>«Nu intte derera aadhdhi baana mala nuna diggofa; nu ogeppe kare kezontta sitti gi baana. <verse eid="DEU 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28"/>Nuni maana kaththinne haath nu miishshan shammi ekkana; nuni ne biittara kanththi bishin ne nuna diggontta mala xalla koyoos. <verse eid="DEU 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29"/>Eedoomen diza Eesawe zereththatinne Eeren diza Mo7aabe zereththati nu istta derera aadhdhana mala nuus ero gida malakka Yordaanoose shaafaa pinnidi Xoossay nuna laatissana biittayo nuni gakkanaashe gakkanaas nuni ogera xalla aadhdhi baana mala nuus ero garkkii!»<verse eid="DEU 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30"/>Kawo Sihooney qasse nuni iza derera aadhdhi baana mala koyibeenna; gaasoykka GODAA intte Xoossay hach intte be7izayssa mala iza intte kushen aaththi immanaas iza wozina muumisidi otoranchcha kessides.<verse eid="DEU 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31"/>Hessafe guye GODAY taas, «Ane xeella, tani kawo Sihoonenne iza biitta ne kushen aaththa immadis; intte iza biitta laattidi heen de7ite» gides.<verse eid="DEU 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32"/>Kawo Sihooney baas diza olanchchata ubbaa ekkidi Yahaaxe katama achchan nunara olettanaas yides. <verse eid="DEU 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33"/>Gido attiin GODAA nu Xoossay iza nu kushen aaththi immida gishshas iza, iza naytanne izas diza olanchchata ubbaa nu dippi histtidos. <verse eid="DEU 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34"/>He wode nuni iza katamata ubbaa worajji oykkidi katamata ubbaa, isttan diza attumasatara, maccassataranne naytara issife dhayssidos; aykkoka ashshontta ubbaa dippi histtidos. <verse eid="DEU 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35"/>Istta mehetanne nu worajjida katamatappe di7ida miishshata nuus ekkidos. <verse eid="DEU 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36"/>Nuni Arnoone shoobbaa gaxa baggara diza Aaro7eere katamaappenne heen zullezan diza katamaappe doommi biidi Gala7aade gakkanaas nunara eqettana dandayza issi katamaykka beettibeenna. GODAA nu Xoossay ubbaa nuus aaththi immides. <verse eid="DEU 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37"/>Gido attiin nuni Amoone dere, woykko Yaabooqe shaafaa mata, shaara menththo bolla diza katamataakkonne GODAA nu Xoossay nuni baana mala azazontta soho ubbaakko shiiqibookko.<verse eid="DEU 2:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Baasaane Kawo Aage Xooneteth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Tay 21:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1"/>Hessafe guye nuni simmidi Baasaane efiza ogezara kezidos; kawo Aagey ba olanchchata ubbaa ekkidi nunara olettanaas Edira7e katama kezides. <verse eid="DEU 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2"/>Gido attiin GODAY taas, «Kawo Aages babbofa! Tani iza, iza deraanne iza biitta ne kushen aaththa immadis; Haseboonen uttidi haariza Amooreta kawo Sihoone bolla ooththoyssa mala neni iza bollaka ooththana» gides.<verse eid="DEU 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3"/>Hessa gishshas GODAA nu Xoossay kawo Aagenne iza olanchchata ubbaa nu kushen aaththi immides; nunikka isttafe issi asikka ashshontta ubbaa dhayssidos. <verse eid="DEU 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4"/>He wode iza katamata ubbaa oykkidos; nu oykkontta attida issi katamaykka deenna; hessaththoka Baasaane kawo Aagey Argoba deren ayssiza usuppun tammu katamatakka oykkidos. <verse eid="DEU 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5"/>He katamati wuri gimben gimbettida; pengetikka kolatatan gordeteettes; istta yuushon dirsay baynda cora mandarati deettes. <verse eid="DEU 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6"/>Haseboone kawo Sihooneppe nu ekkida katamata bolla nu ooththidayssaththo ha katamatakka ubbaa dhayssidos; attuma asaa, maccassaanne naytakka ashshontta ubbaa dhayssidos. <verse eid="DEU 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7"/>Meheta ubbaa di7idos; katamatan diza miish ubbaa lim7i histtidos.<verse eid="DEU 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8"/>He wode nuni Yordaanoose shaafaappe biidi arshey mokkiza baggara, Arnoone zullefe biidi Hermoone zuma gakkanaas dizayssa oykkidos; hayta Amoore dere kawotappe woththi ekkidos. <verse eid="DEU 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9"/>[Hermoone zumaza Sidoona asay, «Siriyoone» gizayssa Amoore asay, «Sanire» gi sunththides.] <verse eid="DEU 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10"/>Nuni gezze biittan diza katamata ubbaa, Gala7aade biitta ubbaa, Baasaane biitta ubbaanne Baasaane biittan Aagey haariza Salaakanne Edira7e katamata gakkanaas dizasohota oykkidos. <verse eid="DEU 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11"/>[Erafaymeta baggafe kawo Aagey wurseththa kawo; izi ichchiza algay mino biratappe oosettides; algaas adussateththay osppun wadha gidishin gomppay oyddu wadha; he algazi Eraaba geetettiza Amooneta katamaan ha7i gakkanaas beettees.]<verse eid="DEU 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yordaanooseppe Arshey Mokkiza Baggara Diza Qommota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 32:1-42">Tay 32:1-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12"/>He biittayo nuni laattidaappe Arnoone shaafaa achchan diza Aaro7eere katamaappe doommidi pudeha baggan diza derezanne gezze biittan diza Gala7aade deraappe baggaa heen diza katamatara Oroobeele zereththatassinne Gaade zereththatas immadis. <verse eid="DEU 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13"/>Gala7aade dereppe attida biittanne Aagey haariza Baasaane biitta ubbaa, hessika Argoba kawoteththaa Minaase zereththatappe baggaytas immadis. (He Baasaane biitta ubbay Erafaymeta biitta geetetti xeygettees. <verse eid="DEU 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14"/>Minaase qommo gidida Ya7irey Argoba dere kumeththaa laattides; hessika Geeshuretanne Ma7ikate zawa gakkanaas diza Baasaane; he biittayakka iza sunththan xeygettadus; hessa gaason ha7i gakkanaas istti Ya7ire katamata geetetteetes.)<verse eid="DEU 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15"/>Qasse Gala7aade biittaaka Minaase qommo Maakire zereththatas immadis. <verse eid="DEU 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16"/>Oroobeele qommotassinne Gaade qommotas Gala7aadeppe biidi Arnoone shaafaa achchi gakkanaas diza dereza immadis; dugeha baggara istta zaway Arnoone shaafa; pudeha bagga zaway qasse Amooneta deren zawa bolla diza Yaabooqe shaafaza. <verse eid="DEU 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17"/>Arshey wulliza baggara istta zaway Araben de7iza Yordaanoose shaafa gakkees; hessika Kinereete abbaafe doommidi Pizga zuma garsan diza Maxine abba gakkanaassa.<verse eid="DEU 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18"/>He wode istta kaaleththana mala hayssafe kaalliza wogata ta inttes immadis; GODAA nu Xoossay Yordaanooseppe arshey mokkiza baggara diza biitta intte laattana mala inttes immides; hessa gishshas intte intte olanchchata gixisidi hankko Isra7eele asay bantta xinxxo laattana gakkanaas isttafe sinththati olettanaas aadhdhite. <verse eid="DEU 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19"/>Inttes daro mehey dizayssa ta erays; hessa gishshas intte machcheti, naytinne meheti xalla haan attetto; istti tani inttes immida katamatan detto. <verse eid="DEU 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20"/>Intte GODAY hayssan inttena shempisoyssaththo intte ishanttaka Yordaanooseppe arshey wulliza baggara GODAY isttas immiza biittayo gelidi saroteththan shempana gakkanaas intte istta maaddite; hessafe guye tani inttes immida biittayo haa simmanaas dandayeeta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:12-15">Iya 1:12-15</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21"/>Hayssafe guye tani Iyaaso, «GODAA intte Xoossay Sewoonenne Aage geetetti xeygettiza nam7u kawota bolla ooththoyssa intte intte ayfera be7ideta; intte istta biittaa laattiza dere ubbaa bolla hayssa mala ooso zaari ooththana. <verse eid="DEU 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22"/>Inttes olettanay GODAA intte Xoossaa gidida gishshas intte isttas babbofte» ga zoradis.<verse eid="DEU 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musey Kanaane Gelontta Mala Digeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23"/>He wode tani keeha woossashe, <verse eid="DEU 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24"/>«Ubbaafe dhoqqa GODAWU! Ne gitateththaanne ne mino qeseza taas ne ayllezas beso doommadasa; neni ooththiza gitanne wolqqama oosota ooththiza hara GODAY Salonkka Sa7ankka deenna. <verse eid="DEU 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25"/>Godoo! Tani Yordaanoose shaafa pinnada he pinththan diza lo7onne shaara menththoson diza cilila biittayonne Libaanoose zuma ta be7anayssa tana diggofarkkii!» gadis.<verse eid="DEU 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26"/>Gido attiin intte gaason GODAY ta bolla hanqettidi ta woosaa siyanayssa ixxidi, «Hi7a nees gidana! Hayssa nam7anththo denththofa! <verse eid="DEU 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27"/>Hessa aggada dendada pude Pizga zumaa bolla keza; histtada ne ayfey demmanaas dandayza keena dereyssi pudehanne dugeha bagga, arshe mokkiza bagganne wulliza bagga yuushsha xeella; gaasoykka neni Yordaanoose pinna baana mala nees piqaadey imettibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:12-14">Tay 27:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:48-52">Zaare 32:48-52</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28"/>Gido attiin neni Iyaasos azazo imma; iza xalisanne minththeththa; gaasoykka izi deraa kaaleththidi Yordaanoose shaafaa pinththana; hanno ne be7iza biittayo izi istta laatissana» gides.<verse eid="DEU 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29"/>Hessa gaason Beeti-Pe7oore katamappe sinththa baggara diza shoobban gam7idos.<verse eid="DEU 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asay Xoossas Azazettana Mala Musey Immida Azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1"/>Hessafe guye Musey asaas, «Ha7ikka Isra7eele asawu! Intte de7on daana malanne GODAA intte aawata Xoossay inttes immiza biittaa intte laattana mala tani inttena tamaarsiza wogaanne maaraa siyite! Qasseka naagite. <verse eid="DEU 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2"/>Ta inttes immiza wogaa bolla aykkoka gujjofte; aykkoka izappe pacinchchofte; GODAA intte Xoossay inttes ta baggara immida wogaas azazettizayta gidite. <verse eid="DEU 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3"/>GODAY Ba7aali-Pe7oore zuma bolla ooththoyssa ubbaaka intte intte ayfera be7ideta; izi he zumaa bolla Ba7aale geetettiza eeqa xoossaas goynnizayta ubbaa intte giddofe dhayssides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-9">Tay 25:1-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4"/>Intte gidikko GODAA intte Xoossaas ammanetti eqqidayta gidida gishshas hach gakkanaas shemppora paxa deeta.<verse eid="DEU 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5"/>«GODAA ta Xoossay ta inttes yootana mala tana azazida wogaanne maara ubbaa inttena tamaarsadis; intte gelidi laattana biittayn he azazota naagite. <verse eid="DEU 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6"/>Intte istta naagitenne polite; intte hessaththo ooththizaa gidikko intte ay keena aadho eranchchatanne akeekizayta hara dere asay inttena be7ana; istti ha azazota siyiza wode, ‹Tumukka ha gita kawoteththay aadho eranchchanne akeekanchcha dere› gaana. <verse eid="DEU 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7"/>GODAA nu Xoossay nu woossishin mata gidida mala iza GODAY izas mata gidida hara gita kawoteththi oonee? <verse eid="DEU 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8"/>Tani hach intte sinththan woththiza ha azazoza mala suurenne likke gidida wogaynne maaray diza hara ay gita kawoteththi dizee?<verse eid="DEU 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9"/>«Histtiko intte diza wode ubbaan hayssa intte intte ayfera be7idayssa ubbaa balontta malanne intte wozinappe dhayontta mala naagettite; intte naytanne intte nayta naytakka tamaarsite. <verse eid="DEU 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10"/>Siina zumaa bolla GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan intte eqqida wode izi tana, ‹Intte de7iza wode ubbaan istti taas yashshateth taamarana mala, bantta naytakka tamaarsana malanne ta qaalaa siyana mala deraa taakko shiishsha› gidayssa akeekite.<verse eid="DEU 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11"/>«Salo gakkiza tama lacoynne dhippi gida cuwaynne shaaray iza goozi oykkida zumaa garsan shiiqi eqqideta. <verse eid="DEU 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12"/>Hessaththoka GODAY tama laco giddon dishe inttes haasaydes; histtiin izi haasayza qaalaa siyideta attiin iza medha mulekka be7ibeekketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16-18">Kessa 19:16-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13"/>Intte ooththanaas bessiza ba caaqo qaalaa inttes qonccisides; hessika masettida nam7u shuchchata bolla xaafettida tammu azazota.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:18">Kessa 31:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:28">34:28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:10">Zaare 9:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14"/>Intte geli laattana biittayn dishe intte ooththanaas bessiza wogatanne maarata ta inttena tamaarsana mala GODAY tana azazides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:1">Kessa 21:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eeqa Xoossatas Goynoppe Haakkana Mala Imettida Azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15"/>«GODAY Siina zumaa bollan tama laco giddofe inttes haasayza gallas ay medhakka be7ontta gishshas keehippe naagettite. <verse eid="DEU 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16"/>Hessika adde woykko macca misatissi eeqa misle medhdhidi izan intte tunontta malassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:4">Kessa 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:1">Lewe 26:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:8">Zaare 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:15">27:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17"/>Biitta bolla de7iza mehenne do7a leemiso woykko salo gufanththon piradhdhiza kafo gidiin, <verse eid="DEU 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18"/>woykko biitta bollara tiran gooshettiza medheteththatanne mole misleta inttes ooththidi goynnofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:23">Oro 1:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19"/>Qasse salo pude xeellidi intte GODAY asa ubbaas immida arshe, agina, xoolinttenne salo medheta ubbaa be7idi intte isttas goynnidi balontta mala naagettite. <verse eid="DEU 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20"/>Intte gidikko tamay izan eexxiza birata cooce misatiza Gibxeppe inttena GODAY shoddi kessiday intte izas dumma dere gidana malassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Kessa 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">Zaare 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:18">26:18</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tito 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1Phex 2:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21"/>«GODAY ne gaason ta bolla hanqettidi Yordaanoose shaafa ta pinna bontta malanne izi inttena laatissiza he cilila biittayo ta be7ontta mala taas caaqqi yootides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:12">Tay 20:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22"/>Hessa gishshas tani Yordaanoose shaafa pinnontta hannin hayqqana days; intte gidikko pinnidi he biittayo laattana. <verse eid="DEU 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23"/>Hessa gishshas Xoossay inttenara gelida caaqo qaalaa intte balontta mala shaakki erite; GODAA intte Xoossay inttena ooththofte giidi azazida eeqa misleta ay medhankka misatissi ooththi kessofte. <verse eid="DEU 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24"/>Gaasoykka GODAA intte Xoossay xuuggiza tamanne qanaatiza Xoossa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:29">Ib 12:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25"/>«Intte he biittayn naytanne nayta nayta yelidi ufayssan de7iza layth ubbaan inttenateththaa tunisidi ay medhan gidikkoka misle misatissi medhdhidi GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan hessa mala iitaa ooththidi iza hanqeththofte. <verse eid="DEU 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26"/>Intte hessa ooththiko Yordaanoose shaafa pinnidi laattana biittayn daro layth gam7onttayssanne intte mulera dhayanayssa tani hach intte bolla salonne sa7a markka woththa yootays. <verse eid="DEU 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27"/>GODAY inttena hara kawoteththata giddon laallana; intte bi laalettidason inttefe amardayti xalla attana. <verse eid="DEU 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28"/>Heen intte miththafenne shuchchafe asa kushen oosettidi xeellontta, siyontta, monttanne singontta eeqa xoossatas goynnana. <verse eid="DEU 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29"/>Gido attiin intte heen dishe GODAA intte Xoossaa kumeththa wozinappenne kumeththa shemppofe koykko intte iza demmana. <verse eid="DEU 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30"/>Ha ubbaa metoy inttena gakkiin intte metotishe wurseththan GODAA intte Xoossaako simmidi qasseka izas azazettana. <verse eid="DEU 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31"/>GODAA intte Xoossay maariza Xoossa gidida gishshas inttena mulera aggenna; inttena ubbaaka dhayssenna; kase intte aawatara gelida caaqo qaalaa mulekka balenna.<verse eid="DEU 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32"/>«Xoossay ase biitta bolla medhdhoosofe doommidi intte yelettanaappe kase aadhdhida wodeta xomosite; biitta gaxappe gaxa gakkanaas pilggi xeellite; hayssafe kase hayssa mala gita miishshi mulekka hani erizee? Woykko siyetti erizee? <verse eid="DEU 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33"/>Tama laco giddora Xoossay haasayiin siyidi intte dhayontta shemppora paxa de7on diza mala Xoossay haasayiin siyidi shemppora paxa de7on diza hara asi dizee? <verse eid="DEU 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34"/>Woykko GODAA intte Xoossay intte xeellishin Gibxe biittan inttes ooththizayssaththo paacen, malaatan, malalisiza miishshan, olan, mino qeseninne micettida kushen, qasse yashissiza ba wolqqan hara kawoteththata giddo gelidi issi kawoteth baas ekkanaas baaxetida hara xoossi dizee? <verse eid="DEU 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35"/>GODAY iza xalla gididayssa intte erana mala hayssa izi inttena bessides; izappe attiin hara Xoossi deenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:32">Mar 12:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36"/>Izi inttena tamaarsanaas koyida gishshas ba cenggurssaa saloppe sissides; qasseka sa7a bolla yashshiza gita tamaa inttena bessides; he tamaza giddofe iza cenggurssaa siyideta. <verse eid="DEU 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37"/>Izi hessaththo ooththiday intte aawata dosida gishshassinne istta zereththata doorida gishshas ba gita wolqqaan inttena Gibxeppe kessides. <verse eid="DEU 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38"/>Hach intte be7iza mala inttena gelththanaassinne istta biittaa xinxxo ooththi inttes immanaas inttefe darizaytanne wolqqatiza kawoteththata intte sinththafe gooddi kessides.<verse eid="DEU 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39"/>«Hessa gishshas salonkka sa7ankka GODAY izi xalla Xoos gididayssanne izappe hara Xoossi bayndayssa erite; intte wozinan woththite. <verse eid="DEU 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40"/>Inttessinne inttefe guyen yaana intte zereththaas lo7o gidana mala qasse GODAA intte Xoossay mernaas inttes immiza xinxxoyn intte layththi aduqqana mala tani hach inttena azaziza wogaanne maaraa naagite» gides.<verse eid="DEU 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shempo Wodhidayti Baqati Attanaas Imettida Katamata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41"/>Hessafe guye Musey Yordaanoose shaafappe he pinththan arshey mokkiza baggara heedzdzu katamata shaakki woththides. <verse eid="DEU 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42"/>Izi hessaththo ooththiday kase morkketeththi baynda erontta dishe as wodhida ay asikka he katamatappe issineyn baqati biidi ba shemppo ashshana malassa. <verse eid="DEU 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43"/>Hessa gishshas Oroobeele qommotas zumbullati uttida bazzon diza Baxira, Gaade qommotas Gala7aaden diza Eramootenne Minaase qommotas Baasaanen diza Golaane katamata shaakki shaakki woththides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:41-43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 20:8-9">Iya 20:8-9</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Woga Gishshas Imettida Timirte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44"/>Musey Isra7eele deraas immida GODAA wogay hayssa. <verse eid="DEU 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45"/>Gibxeppe kezida wode Musey deraas yootida azazoy, wogaynne maaray hayssa bollan xaafettidayssa. <verse eid="DEU 4:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46"/>Heytantta izi awajjiday Yordaanoose shaafappe arshey mokkiza baggara Beeti-Pe7oore zulles sinththa baggara diza Amooreta kawoy diza Haseboone deren, Museynne Isra7eeleti Gibxeppe ke7i olettidi xoonida Sihoone derenna. <verse eid="DEU 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47"/>He wode istti iza biittanne hessaththoka Yordaanooseppe arshey mokkiza baggara diza Baasaane dere haariza Amoore kawo Aage biitta laattida. <verse eid="DEU 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48"/>He biittay Arnoone Shaafa doonan diza Aaro7eere katamaappe biidi Siriyoone zumaa gakkees; Siriyoone geetettiza zumazi Hermoone zuma. <verse eid="DEU 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49"/>He biittayka Yordaanoose shaafappe arshey mokkiza baggara diza Arabe dere ubbaa ekkidi Pizga zumaa garsan diza hayqo abba gakkees.<verse eid="DEU 4:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Tammu Azazota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">Kessa 20:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1"/>Museykka Isra7eele asaa ubbaa issi bolla xeygidi, «Isra7eele asawu! Tani hach inttes immiza wogaanne maaraa ane wozinan woththi siyite; istta lo7eththi tamaartenne minththi naagite. <verse eid="DEU 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2"/>GODAA nu Xoossay Siina zumaa bolla nunara caaqo qaala gelides. <verse eid="DEU 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3"/>Izi caaqqidaykka nu aawatara xalla gidontta ha7i shemppora paxa diza nunarakka caaqettides. <verse eid="DEU 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4"/>Heen he zumaa bolla eexxiza tama giddon dishe GODAY inttena qonccera haasayssides. <verse eid="DEU 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5"/>Intte tamazas babbidi pude zumaa bolla kezanaas yayyida gishshas tanikka he wode GODAY gizayssa ubbaa inttes yootanaas inttessinne GODAAS giddon eqqadis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:5">«Izikka taas, <verse eid="DEU 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6"/>‹Neni kase aylleteththan haaretta diza Gibxe dereppe nena wozza ekkiday tana GODAA ne Xoossaa.<verse eid="DEU 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7"/>« ‹Taappe attiin hara Xoossi nees dooppo.<verse eid="DEU 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8"/>« ‹Salon gidiin sa7an, woykko biitta garsan diza haaththa giddon dizaytappe awoyssaka nees misle medhdhada Xoossa mala goynnofa. <verse eid="DEU 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9"/>Tani GODAA ne Xoossay keeha qanaatiza Xoossa; hessa gishshas masetti oosettida ay eeqa xoossataska goynnofanne ziggofa; tani tana ixxizayta wursa qaxxayays; istta zereththatakka heedzdzanththonne oydanththo yeleta gakkanaas tani qaxxayana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:1">Lewe 26:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:15-18">Zaare 4:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:15">27:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10"/>Tana dosizaytassinne ta azazota naagizaytas gidikko shii yeleta gakkanaas ta kiyateththaanne ta siiqo ta istta bessana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6-7">Kessa 34:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Tay 14:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:9-10">Zaare 7:9-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11"/>« ‹Tana ne GODAA sunththaa hadan xeygoppa; ta sunththaa hadan xeygizayta ta qaxxayontta aggike.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lewe 19:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12"/>« ‹Tani GODAY ne Xoossay nena azazida mala sambata gallassa dummasada bonchcha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:23-30">Kessa 16:23-30</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:12-14">31:12-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13"/>Neni ooththiza ooso ubbaa usuppun gallassatan ooththa. <verse eid="DEU 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14"/>Laappunththo gallassay gidikko taas ne GODAAS dumma shemppo gallassa; he gallas ay oosokka ooththofa; nena gidiin woykko ne nayta gidiin nees ooththizaytikka, ne meheykka, ne deren bete asata gidikkoka he gallas aykkoka ooththofte; ne shempizayssaththo isttika shempetto.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13-14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:12">Kessa 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:15">31:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:21">34:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 35:2">35:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:3">Lewe 23:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15"/>Neni Gibxe biittan de7iza wode aylle gidada de7idayssa akeeka; qasseka GODAA ne Xoossay ba mino qeseninne ba micettida kushen nena heeppe kessidayssa dogoppa; sambata gallassa ne bonchchana mala GODAA ne Xoossay azaziday hessassa.<verse eid="DEU 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16"/>« ‹Tani GODAA ne Xoossay nena azazida mala ne aawaanne ne aayo bonchcha; ne hessaththo ooththiko GODAA ne Xoossay nees immiza biittayn ne layththi aduqqananne nees injjetana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:16">Zaare 27:16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:4">Mato 15:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:19">19:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:10">Mar 7:10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luqa 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:2-3">Efe 6:2-3</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17"/>« ‹As wodhoppa;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:6">Medhe 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:17">Lewe 24:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:21">Mato 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luqa 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Oro 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:11">Yaaqo 2:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18"/>« ‹Laymatoppa;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lewe 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:27">Mato 5:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luqa 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Oro 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:11">Yaaqo 2:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19"/>« ‹Kaysotoppa;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:11">Lewe 19:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">Mato 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luqa 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Oro 13:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20"/>« ‹Oona bollaka wordo markkattofa;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:1">Kessa 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">Mato 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luqa 18:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21"/>« ‹Asa machcho, asa keeth, asa xinxxo, asa oosanchchata, asa mehe, asa hare gidiin hara ay aqotakka ubbaa amottofa› gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:7">Oro 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">13:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22"/>«Intte issi bolla shiiqidason GODAY zumaa bolla dishe inttes ubbaas immida azazoti hayta; taman, girdi gida dhumaninne shaara giddon dishe gita cenggurssan izi inttes yootida azazoti hayta xalla; izi heytakka nam7u shuchchata bolla wooci xaafidi taas immides.<verse eid="DEU 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dereza Yash</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">Kessa 20:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23"/>«Zumazi taman xuugettiza wodenne dhuma giddofe cenggurssa intte siyida wode inttena kaaleththizaytinne intte korapinneti taakko yiidi, <verse eid="DEU 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24"/>‹GODAA nuni Xoossa cenggurssaa tama giddofe siyida wode GODAA nu Xoossay ba gitateththinne ba bonchcho nuna qonccen bessides; Xoossi asara haasaydaappe guyen asi hayqqontta shemppora paxa de7ana dandayzayssa nu hach beydos. <verse eid="DEU 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25"/>Hayssafe guye GODAA nu Xoossaa cenggurssaa nu siyizaa gidikko nu hayqqana; he wolqqama tamay nuna dhayssana dandayees; histtiin nuni ays hayqqizonii? <verse eid="DEU 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26"/>De7o Xoossay tama giddon dishe yootiin nu siyida mala iza cenggurssa siyidi hayqqontta shemppora paxa attida asi daanee? <verse eid="DEU 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27"/>Hessa gishshas neni izakko shiiqada GODAA nu Xoossay gizayssa ubbaa siya; hessafe guye ne siyidayssa ubbaa nuus yaada yoota; nunikka iza siyidi azazettana› gideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:18-19">Ib 12:18-19</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28"/>«Xoossayka intte hessa gishin siyidi taas, ‹Ha asati nees yootidayssa ubbaa tani siyadis; istti gidayssi ubbay likke. <verse eid="DEU 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29"/>Isttassinne istta zereththatas mernaas ubbaa miishshi lo7o gidana mala istti taas yayyanaassinne ta azazota ubba wode naaganaas hayssa mala wozinay dizaakko ay mala lo7ooshaa! <verse eid="DEU 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30"/>Ha7ikka neni baada istti ba dunkaanen dunkaanen simmana mala isttas yoota. <verse eid="DEU 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31"/>Neni gidikko haan ta achchan eqqa; tani ta wogata, azazotanne maarata ubbaa nees immana; tani isttas immiza dereyin istti ha azazota, wogatanne maarata naagana mala dereza tamaarsa› gides.<verse eid="DEU 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32"/>«Isra7eele asawu! GODAA intte Xoossay inttena azazidayssa ubbaa polanaas giigettite; isttafe issinoyokka menththofte. <verse eid="DEU 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33"/>Ubba miishshi inttes lo7o gidana malanne intte laattana biittayn inttes layththay aduqqana mala Xoossi inttena azazidayssa ubbaa polite» gides.<verse eid="DEU 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Gita Azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1"/>Intte pinni biidi laattanaas biza biittaan intte ooththana malanne tani inttena tamaarsana mala GODAA intte Xoossay tana azazida azazoti, wogatinne maarati hayta. <verse eid="DEU 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2"/>Intte he biittayn adussa layth daana mala intte, intte naytinne intte nayta nayti bantti diza wode ubbaan Xoossas yayyanaassinne ta immida azazota, maaratanne wogata ubbaa naaganaas bessees. <verse eid="DEU 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3"/>Intteno Isra7eele asawu! Ubba miishshi inttes lo7o gidana mala, GODAA intte aawata Xoossay inttes gidayssaththo maaththinne eessi goggiza biittaan intte keehi corattana mala ha azazota siyitenne minni ooththite.<verse eid="DEU 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4"/>Isra7eele asatoo! Intte hayssa akeekite! GODAA nu Xoossay izi xalla Xoossa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:29">Mar 12:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5"/>GODAA ne Xoossaa ne kumeththa wozinappe, ne kumeththa shemppofenne ne kumeththa wolqqafe siiqa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:37">Mato 22:37</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:30">Mar 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:27">Luqa 10:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6"/>Hach ta nena azazida azazota wozinan woththa. <verse eid="DEU 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7"/>Hayta azazota ne nayta tamaarsa; neni neson uttiza wode gidiin oge bashekka, ichchiza wode gidiin beeggiza wode ubbaan haytantta akeekashe yuushsha qoppa. <verse eid="DEU 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8"/>Nees malata gidana mala ne kushe bolla qachcha qasseka ne piidhe bolla woththa. <verse eid="DEU 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9"/>Ne keeththa qosilaththa bollanne gibbe penge bolla xaafa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:18-20">Zaare 11:18-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Azazettana Mala Wondi Yootida azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10"/>GODAA intte Xoossay kase intte aawatas Abrahaames, Yisaaqassinne Yaaqoobeska caaqqida qaalaa mala inttena izi he biittayo gelththiza wode kase intte keexxontta gitanne lo7iza katamati diza biittayo laatissana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Medhe 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:13">28:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11"/>Intte laattanay intte keexxontta lo7o miishshan kumida keeththata, intte bookkontta haaththa ollata, intte tokkontta woyne miththatanne wogara miththata; heytantta izi inttes immiza wode, <verse eid="DEU 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12"/>kase intte aylleteththan deyida Gibxe dereppe inttena wozzi kessida GODAA intte balontta mala naagettite. <verse eid="DEU 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13"/>Intte GODA Xoossaas yayyite; izas xalla goynnitenne iza sunththan xalla caaqqite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:10">Mato 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:8">Luqa 4:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14"/>Intte yuushon diza hara dere asay goynniza eeqa xoossatas goynnofte; <verse eid="DEU 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15"/>Gaasoykka intte giddon de7iza GODAA intte Xoossay qanaatiza Xoossa; hessa gishshas iza hanqoy intte bollan tama mala eexxi kezana; izikka inttena biitta bollafekka mulera dippi histti dhayssana.<verse eid="DEU 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16"/>Kase intte Maasan ooththidayssaththo GODAA intte Xoossaa paaccofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Kessa 17:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:7">Mato 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:12">Luqa 4:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17"/>Izi inttena azazida azazota, wogatanne maarata ubbaa lo7eththi naagite. <verse eid="DEU 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18"/>Inttes ubba miishshi lo7o gidana mala GODAA sinththan intte suurenne lo7o ooththite; histtiko inttes immanaas GODAY intte aawatas qaala gelida he lo7o biittayo intte laattana. <verse eid="DEU 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19"/>Izi inttes hidota qaala gelida mala intte intte morkketa gooddi dhayssana.<verse eid="DEU 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20"/>Guyeppe yaana wodetan intte nayti, «GODAA nu Xoossay hayta azazota, wogatanne maarata birsheththay aazee?» gi oychchana. <verse eid="DEU 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21"/>He wode intte qasse isttas, «Kase nuni Gibxe kawos aylletidos shin Xoossay nuna ba gita wolqqaan wozzi kessides. <verse eid="DEU 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22"/>Gibxe asaa, istta kawozanne istta shuumeta keehi qohiza gita malaatata izi ooththizayssa nuni nu ayfera be7idos. <verse eid="DEU 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23"/>Kase nu aawata laatissanaas immida hidota qaalaa mala nuna ha biittayo laatissanaas Gibxeppe wozzi kessidi haa ehides. <verse eid="DEU 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24"/>Hessafe guye hach hanidayssaththo nuus ubba wodekka lo7o gidana malanne nuni shemppora paxa de7ana mala, nuni azazota, wogatanne maarata naagana malanne GODAA nu Xoossaas yayyana mala azazides. <verse eid="DEU 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25"/>GODAA nu Xoossay nuna azazida mala iza azazota ubbaa nu naagikko hessi nuus xilloteth gidana» giite.<verse eid="DEU 6:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossan Doorettida Dere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Kessa 34:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1"/>GODAA intte Xoossay intte laattanaas biza biittayo inttena gelththiza wode qasseka inttefe wolqqamizanne minniza laappun kawoteththata heytikka Hiiteta, Gergeseta, Amooreta, Kanaaneta, Paarizeta, Hiiwetanne Yaabuseta intte sinththafe dhoqalli dhayssana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:19">Hawa 13:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2"/>GODAA intte Xoossay he dereta intte kushen aaththi immiin intte istta xooniza wode istta kumeth suppu histti dhayssite attiin isttara ay qaalakka gelopitenne isttas qadhettofte. <verse eid="DEU 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3"/>Isttara ekettoftenne gelettofte; intte macca nayta istta attuma naytas immofte; istta macca naytakka intte attuma naytas ekkofte. <verse eid="DEU 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4"/>Gaasoykka intte hessaththo ooththontta aggiko istti intte nayta GODAA kaallizasoppe betissidi eeqa xoossata kaallana mala ooththana; he wode GODAA hanqoy eexxi kezananne izi inttena heerakka eeson dhayssana. <verse eid="DEU 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5"/>Hessa gishshas intte istti yarsho yarshizasoza laallite; istti goynniza tuussa malata shuchchata kinchchereththi yeggite; Asheero geetettiza eeqa xoossay misleza tinchchereththi yeggite; masetti giigida eeqa xoossata misletakka taman xuuggite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:3">Zaare 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6"/>Gaasoykka GODAA intte Xoossay inttena baas gidana mala doorida dumma dere; biitta bolla diza dere ubbaafe intte izas dumma dere gidana mala doorettideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Kessa 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Zaare 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:18">26:18</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tito 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1Phex 2:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7"/>GODAY inttena siiqidaynne dooriday intte hara asaappe qoodan dariza gishshas gidenna; intte hara deraappe qoodan keehi guuththata. <verse eid="DEU 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8"/>Gido attiin GODAY inttena siiqida gishshassinne kase intte aawatas gelida hidota qaala naaganaas koyida gishshas izi inttena Gibxe kawos aylleteththan diza Gibxe biittafe ba gita wolqqan wozzidi kessides. <verse eid="DEU 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9"/>Hessa gishshas GODAA intte Xoossay mulera ammanettida Xoossaa gididayssa intte yuushshi qopite; izi ba caaqqida qaalaa naagees; iza dosizaytassinne iza azazo polizaytas ubbaas shii yeleta gakkanaas izi ba mernaa siiqo bessana. <verse eid="DEU 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10"/>Gido attiin bana ixxizayta ba halo kessana; istta bolla ba halo kessanaas gam7enna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5-6">Kessa 20:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:6-7">34:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Tay 14:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:9-10">Zaare 5:9-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11"/>Hessa gishshas ta hach inttena azaziza azazota, wogatanne maarata lo7eththi naagite.<verse eid="DEU 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Azazeteththan Beettiza Anjjo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">Zaare 28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12"/>Intte ha azazota, wogatanne maarata siyidi lo7eththi naagikko GODAA intte Xoossay kase intte aawatas gelida caaqo qaalanne ba mernaa siiqo intteska minththana. <verse eid="DEU 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13"/>Izi inttena siiqana; anjjananne qoodan darsana; qasseka izi intte aawatas caaqqida biittayn intte yelota, intte biittay immiza ayfeta, kaththaa, woynenne wogara zayte, intte mehetanne dorsa wudeta ubbaa darssidi anjjana. <verse eid="DEU 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14"/>Intte mala anjjettida derey alame bolla mulekka deenna; intte giddofe macca gidiin woykko attumas gidiin hessaththoka intte meheta giddon maynney beettenna. <verse eid="DEU 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15"/>GODAY harge ubbaafe inttena naagana; intte kase Gibxen dishe be7ida iita hargetappe awoyssaka intte bolla ehenna; gido attiin izi bana ixxizayta bolla he hargeta ehana. <verse eid="DEU 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16"/>GODAA intte Xoossay intte kushen aaththi immida dereta ubbaasikka qadhettontta dhayssite; inttes woximade gidontta mala istta eeqa xoossatas goynnofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:13-17">Zaare 11:13-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17"/>Intte intte wozinan, «Ha kawoteththati nuuppe minneettes; histtiin nu istta wostti dhayssanee?» giidi qoppontta aggeketa. <verse eid="DEU 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18"/>Gido attiin intte isttas yayyofte; GODAA intte Xoossay Gibxe kawo bollanne he dere asaa ubbaa bolla ooththidayssa yuushshi qopite. <verse eid="DEU 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttena Gibxeppe kessiza wode ooththida gita boshata, malaatata, malalisiza miishshata, iza mino qesetanne micettida kusheta intte intte ayfen be7ideta; ha7i intte yayyiza asa ubbaa bollankka GODAA intte Xoossay hessaththo ooththana. <verse eid="DEU 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20"/>GODAA intte Xoossay istta giddon shiro denththana;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shiro denththana gizayssa bosha yeddana woykko saxxiza udunxxe yeddana gaana dandayettees.</char></note> inttefe baqatidi qotettidaytikka heera dhayana. <verse eid="DEU 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21"/>Hessa gishshas he deretas babofte; GODAA intte Xoossay inttenara dees; izi gitanne yashissiza Xoossa. <verse eid="DEU 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22"/>GODAA intte Xoossay hayta kawoteththata guuththara guuththara shoddi kessana; intte istta ubbaa issito dhayssofte; intte issito dhayssiko biitta bolla do7ay daridi inttena waayisana. <verse eid="DEU 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23"/>GODAA intte Xoossay intte morkketa intte kushen aaththi immana; istti ubbay wurana gakkanaas izi istta garsan shiro denththana. <verse eid="DEU 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24"/>Qasseka istta kawota izi intte kushen aaththi immana; intte istta sunththaa mulera biittafe dhayssana; intte istta dhayssana gakkanaas inttenara eqetti dandayana ay asikka deenna. <verse eid="DEU 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25"/>Istta eeqa xoossata ubbaa taman xuuggite; he eeqa xoossata bolla diza worqqanne bira amottidi inttes ekkofte; GODAA intte Xoossay eeqa xoossatas goyno ixxiza gishshas intte ekkiko izi inttes woximade gidana. <verse eid="DEU 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26"/>Ha tunida eeqa xoossata intteso gelththofte; intte intteso gelththiko istti dhayzayssaththo intteka dhayana; istti dhayanaas bessiza gishshas intte istta ixxitenne harasettite.<verse eid="DEU 7:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Ufayssa Biittayo Wostti Laattanaakko Imettida Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1"/>Intte shemppora paxa daana mala, intte qooday darana malanne GODAY kase intte aawatas immanaas caaqqida biittayo laattanaas intte dandayana mala hach ta inttes immiza azazoyo ammanettidi naagite. <verse eid="DEU 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immida azazota intte naagizaakkonne naagonttaakko intte wozinan diza qofa eranaas, inttena paaccanaassinne inttena ashkesanaas oyddu tammu layth kumeth meto giddora aaththidi izi inttena wostti wostti kaaleththidaakko ane yuushshi qopite. <verse eid="DEU 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3"/>Asi Xoossa doonappe keziza qaalan attiin kaththan xalla shemppora paxa daanaas dandayonttayssa tamaarsanaas inttena gafisides; intteninne intte aawati erontta manna mizides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:4">Mato 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:4">Luqa 4:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4"/>He oyddu tammu layththata garsan intte may7ida may7oy wuribeenna; hemeththa daron intte tohoy kixxibeenna. <verse eid="DEU 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5"/>Aaway ba naa seerizayssaththo GODAA intte Xoossay inttena seerizayssa yuushshi qopite. <verse eid="DEU 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6"/>Iza kaallishenne izas yayyishe GODAA intte Xoossaa azazota naagite. <verse eid="DEU 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7"/>Gaasoykka GODAA intte Xoossay inttena shoobbafenne zumbullatappe pultti goggiza qeeri shaafatinne pulttiza pulttoti diza lo7o biittaa gelththanaas ehides. <verse eid="DEU 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8"/>He biittaya gistteynne banggay, woyneynne balasey, oroomaaneynne wogara ayfey, qasseka eessi kumida biitta. <verse eid="DEU 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9"/>He biittayakka intte pacey baynda kath miza biittanne inttes aykkoyka paccontta biitta; he biittayn diza shuchchatappe biratay, zumbullafe xarqimalay beettees. <verse eid="DEU 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10"/>Intte miidi kallana; histtidi izi inttes immida lo7o biittay gishshas GODAA intte Xoossaa intte galatana.<verse eid="DEU 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Dogizaytas Imettida Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11"/>Intte GODAA intte Xoossaa dogidi tani hach inttes immiza azazota, wogatanne maarata moorontta mala naagettite. <verse eid="DEU 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12"/>Intte miidi kalliza wodenne lo7o keeth keexxi uttiza wode, <verse eid="DEU 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13"/>miizinne dorsay, biraynne worqqay qasseka hara aqotati inttes dariza wode, <verse eid="DEU 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14"/>intte wozinay otorettontta malanne intte Gibxeppe aylleteththa biittafe inttena wozzi kessida GODAA intte Xoossaa balontta mala naagettite. <verse eid="DEU 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15"/>Marze shooshshaynne masimasoy kumida keehi hirgisiza bazzora inttena kaaleththides; izi inttes mela bazzon mino zaallafe haaththe pulttisides. <verse eid="DEU 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16"/>Inttena ashkesanaasinne paaccanaas wurseththankka lo7o gidana mala kase intte aawati mi erontta manna bazzo biittan inttes immides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:5-6">Hose 13:5-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17"/>Hessa gishshas, «Nuni nu wolqqaninne nu minoteththan duretidos» gi qoppofte. <verse eid="DEU 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18"/>Intte durettana mala inttes wolqqanne minoteth immiday GODAA intte Xoossaa gididayssa yuushshi qopite; izi hessaththo ooththiday kase intte aawatas gelida caaqo qaala minththanaassa. <verse eid="DEU 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19"/>GODAA intte Xoossaa intte dogidi eeqa xoossatas goynniko, isttas haggazanaas intte sinth intte isttako zaarikko, addaka intte dhayanayssa hach ta inttena haara erisays. <verse eid="DEU 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20"/>GODAA intte Xoossaas intte azazettontta ixxiko intte gede sinththe sinththe bishin intte sinththan diza kawoteththata dhayssizayssa mala inttenakka dhoqalli dhayssana.<verse eid="DEU 8:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Makkallateththa Gaason Yiza Meto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1"/>Intteno Isra7eele dere asawu! Siyite; intte inttefe gitatizanne wolqqamiza kawoteththata qasse isttas dirsa gimbey salo gakkida gita katamatakka laattanaas hach Yordaanoose pinneeta. <verse eid="DEU 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2"/>He biittaan diza asay geesanne gubba gitatanne keehi minota; isttas, «Ooninne Enaaqe zereththatara eqettanaas dandayenna» gishin intte siyideta. <verse eid="DEU 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3"/>Gido attiin tama mala xuuggiza GODAA intte Xoossay izi inttefe sinththara bishin intte hach be7ana; intte gede sinththe sinththe gujjishin izi istta xooni xooni baana; hessa gishshas izi inttes immida hidota qaalaa mala intte istta dhoqallidi eeson gooddi dhayssana.<verse eid="DEU 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4"/>GODAA intte Xoossay istta intte sinththafe gooddidaappe guye intte, «GODAY nuna ha biittaa ehiday nuni lo7o ooso ooththida gishshassa» giidi qoppofte; GODAY istta intte sinththafe gooddi kessizay istta iitateththaa gishshassa. <verse eid="DEU 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5"/>Intte istta biittaa laattana mala GODAA intte Xoossay isttas aaththi immizay intte xillonne suure ooththida gishshas gidenna; istti iitata gidida gishshassinne Xoossay kase intte aawatas Abrahaames, Yisaaqassinne Yaaqoobes immida hidota qaalaa naaganaas koyida gishshas istta shoddi gooddana. <verse eid="DEU 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6"/>GODAA intte Xoossay ha lo7o biittaa inttena laatissizay intte xilloteththaa gishshas gidenna; gaasoykka intte wozinay muume.<verse eid="DEU 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7"/>GODAA intte Xoossaa bazzon intte wostti hanqeththidaakko balopite; intte Gibxeppe kezida gallassafe doommidi hanno gakkanaas intte GODAA intte Xoossaa bolla makkallideta. <verse eid="DEU 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8"/>Siina bazzon izi inttena dhayssanaas dendana gakkanaas GODAA keehi hanqeththideta. <verse eid="DEU 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9"/>GODAY inttenara caaqettida qaalay istta bolla xaafettida shuchchata ekkanaas tani pude zumaa bolla kezada heen aykkoka monttanne uyontta oyddu tammu gallassinne oyddu tammu qamma gama7adis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:18">Kessa 24:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10"/>Hessafe guye intte he zumaa garsan shiiqiin GODAY tama giddofe haasayshin intte siyida qaala izi ba kushera istta bolla xaafida nam7u lochcha shuchchata taas immides. <verse eid="DEU 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11"/>Oyddu tammu gallassafenne oyddu tammu omarsafe guye GODAA caaqo qaalay istta bolla xaafettida nam7u lochcha shuchchata taas immides.<verse eid="DEU 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12"/>Hessafe guye GODAY taas, «Ne eeson zumaa bollafe duge wodhdha; neni Gibxeppe kaaleththa kessida asay iita miish ooththidi tunides; ta isttas immida azazotappe eeson kare kezidi banttas goynnanaas eeqa xoossata medhdhida» gides.<verse eid="DEU 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13"/>Qasseka GODAY taas, «Hayssi derezi wozina muumenne makkalla gididayssa ta erays. <verse eid="DEU 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14"/>Tani istta dhayssanayssanne istta sunththaaka biitta bollafe qucca dhayssanayssa tana diggofa; nena isttafe minnizayssanne corattiza kawoteth kessana» gides.<verse eid="DEU 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15"/>Hessa gishshas caaqo qaalazi xaafettida nam7u lochcha shuchchata nam7u kushen oykkida mala zumaa bollafe simmada duge wodhdhadis; he wode tama lacoy zumaa bolla lacees. <verse eid="DEU 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16"/>Intteka GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immida azazota menththidi kare kezideta; worqqafe seerisidi medhdhida mara misleza inttes eeqa xoos ooththideta; hessan intte intte GODAA bolla makkallidayssa ta be7adis. <verse eid="DEU 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17"/>Hessa gaason azazoti istta bolla xaafettida lochcha shuchchata ta intte sinththan bollafe yeggada menththereththadis. <verse eid="DEU 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18"/>Hessafe guye intte keehi iita nagara ooththidi GODAA hanqeththida gaason tani oyddu tammu gallassinne oyddu tammu qamma gakkanaas aykkoka monttanne uyontta GODAA sinththan gufannada gam7adis.<verse eid="DEU 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19"/>Izi inttena keehi hanqettidi dhayssanaas dendida gishshas GODAY hanqiza gita hanqozi tana babisides; gidikkoka GODAY zaaridi ta woosa siyides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:21">Ib 12:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20"/>GODAY Aaroonekka dhayssanaas iza bolla keehi hanqettides; hessa gishshas izaskka woossadis. <verse eid="DEU 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21"/>Tani intte medhdhida he nagaran kumida mara misleza ekkada taman xuuggadis; izakka kinchchereththa gudulla mala liiqisada zumaa bollafe duge goggiza haaththan yeggadis.<verse eid="DEU 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22"/>Intte qasseka Tabeeren, Maasaninne Kibroote-Hatta7aaben intte GODAA hanqeththideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:3">Tay 11:3</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 11:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 17:7">Kessa 17:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23"/>GODAY inttena, «Biite! Ta inttes immida hidota biittayo laattite» giidi inttena Qaadeese Barineppe kiittida wode intte iza bolla makkallideta attiin izan ammanettibeekketa; iza qaalaska azazettibeekketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:25-14:38">Tay 13:25—14:38</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:21">Zaare 1:21</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 3:16">Ib 3:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24"/>Ta inttena eroosofe hanno gakkanaas intte GODAA bolla makkallida mala deeta.<verse eid="DEU 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25"/>GODAY, «Tani istta dhayssana» giidi yootida gishshas tani he oyddu tammu gallassatanne oyddu tammu qammata GODAA sinththan gufannada gam7adis. <verse eid="DEU 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26"/>Tani woossashe, «Ubbaafe dhoqqa GODAWU! Neni ne gita wolqqaninne ne mino qesen wozzada Gibxeppe kessida ne dereza dhayssofarkkii! <verse eid="DEU 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27"/>Kase ne oosanchchata Abrahaame, Yisaaqanne Yaaqoobe qoparkkii; hayssa deraa wozina muumeteththaa, iitateththaanne; nagaraa ubbaa qoodoparkkii!» ga woossadis. <verse eid="DEU 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28"/>Ne histtontta aggiko nuna he dere asay, «GODAY istta gelththana giidi hidota immida biittayo gelththanaas dandayontta gishshassinne izi istta ixxida gishshas bazzo biittan istta wodhanaas kessides» giidi miiccana. <verse eid="DEU 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29"/>Gido attiin ha asay neni ne gita wolqqaninne ne mino qesen nees gidana mala ne doora kessida dere.<verse eid="DEU 9:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Musey Nam7anththo Ekkida Tammu Azazota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:1-10">Kessa 34:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1"/>Hessafe guye GODAY tana, «Hayssafe kase meqqida lochcha shuchchata mala hara nam7u shuch massa giigsa; istta woththanaas Taabotaa miththafe medhdha; histtada pude ha zuma hu7e keza. <verse eid="DEU 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2"/>Ne kase menththida lochcha shuchchata bolla xaafettida azazota qasseka tani izara xaafana; nenikka istta Taabotaza giddon woththa» gides.<verse eid="DEU 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3"/>Hessa gishshas tani odoro miththafe Taabota giigsadis; kaseyta misatiza nam7u lochcha shuchchata massa ekkada pude zumaa bolla kezadis. <verse eid="DEU 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4"/>Intte zumaa garsan shiiqi dishin GODAY tama giddon dishe inttes qonccisida tammu azazota kaseyssaththoka ha7i lochcha shuchchata bolla xaafidi taas immides. <verse eid="DEU 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5"/>Hessafe guye tani zumaa bollafe duge wodhdhada GODAY tana azazida mala he masettida lochcha shuchchata ta giigsida Taabotaa giddon woththadis; he gallassafe hanno gakkanaas heen iza giddon deettes. <verse eid="DEU 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6"/>[Isra7eele asay Bi7erooti-Beeni-Yaqine asatas haaththa ollay dizasoppe Moseere bida; Aarooneykka hayqqidi heen moogettides; izasohon iza naa El7ezeerey qeese gidides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:28">Tay 20:28</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 33:38">33:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7"/>Asay hessafe dendidi gede Gudigoda bides; heeppeka Yoxbaate geetettiza goggiza haaththi dizaso bides. <verse eid="DEU 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8"/>He wode Lewe qommoti Caaqo Qaala Taabotaa tookkana mala, GODAA sinththan eqqidi izas ooththana malanne asaakka GODAA sunththan anjjana mala shuumides; hach gakkanaas Lewe qommota oosoy hessa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:5-8">Tay 3:5-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9"/>Hessa gaason Lewe qommoti hankko qommotara gishettanaas xinxxoy imettonttayssi hessassa; intte GODAY isttas yootida malakka istta xinxxoy GODAA intte Xoossaa.]<verse eid="DEU 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10"/>Tani kaseyssaththo woossashe oyddu tammu gallassinne oyddu tammu qamma gakkanaas gam7adis; GODAY ha7ikka ta woosaa siyidi inttena dhayssontta shemppora paxa woththides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:28">Kessa 34:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11"/>Hessafe guye izi tana, «Ha7i ne ba! Tani kase istta aawatas immida hidota qaalaa mala istti he biittayo laattana mala deraa kaaleththa» gides.<verse eid="DEU 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossas Bessiza Yashshateth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12"/>Isra7eele asawu! GODAY inttefe koyzay hayssafe kaallizayssa; GODAA intte Xoossaa yayyite; iza oge kaallite; iza siiqite; kumeththa wozinappenne kumeththa shemppofe izas ooththite. <verse eid="DEU 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13"/>Inttes lo7ana mala tani hach inttes immiza GODAA azazotanne wogata naagite.<verse eid="DEU 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14"/>Saloynne saloppe bollan diza saloti, biittaynne biitta bolla diza ubbay GODAASSA. <verse eid="DEU 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15"/>GODAY kase intte aawata keehi siiqida gaason inttena ayzaabeta giddofe doorides; intteka hach gakkanaas izas doorettida dere gidideta. <verse eid="DEU 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16"/>Hessa gishshas ane hayssafe guye intte wozina muumisopitenne intte wozina iitateththaa diggidi GODAAS azazettite. <verse eid="DEU 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17"/>GODAA intte Xoossay xoossa geetettiza ubbaafe bolla; godatas Godaa; izi gita, minonne yashshiza Xoossa; izi maaddi pirdontta Xoossanne maganxo ekkontta Xoossa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:15">1Xim 6:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:14">Ajju 17:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:16">19:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:34">Hawa 10:34</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:11">Oro 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:6">Gala 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18"/>Izi yi7otassinne am7etas pirdees; izi deraa giddon diza bete asata dosiza gishshas kaththinne may7o isttas immees. <verse eid="DEU 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19"/>Hessaththoka intte kase Gibxe biittan bete as gidida gishshas intteka intte giddon diza bete asata siiqite. <verse eid="DEU 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20"/>GODAA intte Xoossaas yayyite; izas xalla goynnite; izan ammanettidi iza sunththan caaqqite. <verse eid="DEU 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21"/>Intte Xoossay iza; izi inttes ooththida gitanne malalisiza miishshata ubbaa intte intte ayfen be7ida gishshas ubba wode iza galatite. <verse eid="DEU 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22"/>Beni intte aawati duge Gibxe wodhdhiza wode isttas qooday laappun tammu xalla; ha7i gidikko GODAA intte Xoossay intte qooda salo xoolintte mala darssides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Medhe 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 46:27">46:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Azazeteththafe Beettiza Go7a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1"/>Hessa gishshas GODAA intte Xoossaa siiqite; izi inttefe koyza iza wogaa, maaraanne azazota ubba wode polite. <verse eid="DEU 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2"/>GODAA intte Xoossaa seeraza hessika iza gitateththaa, iza wolqqaanne izas diza maataa be7idaynne erizay intte nayta gidontta inttena gididayssa yuushshi qopite. <verse eid="DEU 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3"/>Malaatatanne izi Gibxe kawo bollanne kumeththa deraa bolla ooththida gita oosota intte intte ayfera be7ideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:8-12">Kessa 7:8-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4"/>Qasse istti inttena kaallidi yedeththida wode GODAY Gibxe biitta olanchchata, istta paratanne para-gaareta Zo7o abbaan mitissidi hach gakkanaas istta mulera dhayssidayssa be7ideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:28">Kessa 14:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5"/>Intte bazzofe dendidi haa hayssa gakkanaas GODAY inttes ay ooththidaakko intte ereeta. <verse eid="DEU 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6"/>Oroobeele qommotappe Elyaabe naa Daataanenne Abraame bolla izi ooththoyssa yuushshi qopite; Isra7eele nayti beyishin biittaya doyettada istta, isttaso asaa, istta dunkaanenne istta haaro ubbaa mittadus.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:31-32">Tay 16:31-32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7"/>GODAY ooththida ha gita oosota ubbaa intte intte ayfera be7ideta.<verse eid="DEU 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8"/>Histtiko intte pinnidi laattana biittayo oykkanaas intte wolqqa demmana mala tani hach inttes immiza azazota ubbaa naagite. <verse eid="DEU 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9"/>Intte iza azazota naagikko GODAY kase intte aawatassinne istta zereththatas immanaas caaqqida eessinne maaththi kumida he lo7o biittayn intte daro layth daana. <verse eid="DEU 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10"/>Intte laattanaas gelana biittaya intte kezidi yida Gibxe biittaa mala gidukku; Gibxen intte kath zeridaappe guye haaththi kaththa giddo baana mala zaraza intte tohon yedhdhi yedhdhi besseeta. <verse eid="DEU 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11"/>Gido attiin intte Yordaanoose shaafaa pinnidi laattana biittaya izin zumatinne shoobbati diza gishshas iza ira haath uyiza biitta. <verse eid="DEU 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12"/>Hanno ha biittayo lo7eththi oykkizaynne layth kumeth naagizay GODAA intte Xoossa.<verse eid="DEU 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13"/>Hessa gishshas GODAA intte Xoossaa siiqite; kumeththa wozinappenne kumeththa shemppofe izas ooththite; tani hach inttes immiza azazota polite. <verse eid="DEU 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14"/>Intte hessaththo ooththiko intte kaththaa, woynenne zayte pacey baynda shiishshana mala GODAY inttes badhdhesa iranne balgo ira woden woden bukisana. <verse eid="DEU 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15"/>GODAY intte mehetas maata darsana; inttes koshshiza kath immiin intte kallana. <verse eid="DEU 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16"/>Intte GODAAPPE haakkidi eeqa xoossatas ooththanaassinne goynnanaas guye simmontta mala naagettite.<verse eid="DEU 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17"/>Intte naagettontta aggiko GODAA hanqoy intte bolla eexxi kezana; iray bukkontta malanne biittay kath immontta mala izi salo gordana; intteka GODAY inttes immida lo7o biittayfe eeson dhayana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:3-5">Lewe 26:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-16">Zaare 7:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">28:1-14</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18"/>Intte ha azazota ubba wode intte wozinaninne intte qofan woththite; inttes malata gidana mala istta intte qesen qachchite; qasseka inttes liiphe bollaka oyththite. <verse eid="DEU 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19"/>Intte nayta tamaarsite; intteson uttishe woykko ogen hemettishekka woykko shempizason gidiinkka woykko ooso ubbaan istta gishshas haasayettite. <verse eid="DEU 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20"/>Intte keeththa penge qosilaththa bollanne intte gibbe penge bolla xaafi woththite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:6-9">Zaare 6:6-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21"/>Intte hessaththo ooththiko intte GODAY kase intte aawatas immanaas caaqqida biittay bolla intte layththaynne intte nayta layththay sa7appe biidi salo gakkana keena aduqqana.<verse eid="DEU 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22"/>GODAA intte Xoossaa siiqanaas, iza oge ubbaa kaallanaassinne izan ammanettanaas tani hach inttes immiza azazota minththidi naagite. <verse eid="DEU 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23"/>Intte hessaththo ooththiko GODAY hayta intte sinththan diza kawoteththata ubbaa kessi gooddana; inttenikka corateththaninne wolqqan inttefe mino gidida dereta biittaa laattana. <verse eid="DEU 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24"/>Intte tohon intte yedhdhida biittay wurikka inttes gidana; intte zaway dugeha baggara diza bazzaafe biidi pudeha baggara diza Libaanoose zumaa gakkana; qasseka arshey mokkiza baggara Efiraaxise shaafappe biidi arshey wulliza baggara diza Mediteraane abba gakkana. <verse eid="DEU 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25"/>Inttenara ay asikka eqettanaas dandayenna; GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immida hidota qaalaa mala intte bizaso ubbaan asay inttena be7idi dagammana malanne yayyana mala ooththana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:3-5">Iya 1:3-5</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26"/>Hekko! Tani hach anjjofenne qanggeththafe issaa intte doorana mala intte sinththan woththadis. <verse eid="DEU 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27"/>Ta hach inttes immiza GODAA intte Xoossaa azazota naagikko intte anjjettana. <verse eid="DEU 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28"/>Gido attiin tani inttena hach azaziza GODAA intte Xoossa azazota naagontta ixxidi intte erontta hara eeqa xoossata goynnanaas iza ogeppe kare ke7izaa gidikko intte qanggettana. <verse eid="DEU 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29"/>GODAA intte Xoossay intte laattana biza biittayo laatissida wode anjjoza Garizaane zumaa bolla qasseka qanggeththa Eebaale zumaa bolla awajja.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:11-14">Zaare 27:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 8:33-35">Iya 8:33-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30"/>He zumati Yordaanoose shaafappe arshey wulliza baggara Araben diza Kanaane biittan Gelgela katamappe sinththa baggara diza Moore miththa achchan deettes. <verse eid="DEU 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31"/>Intte heen daana mala GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immida biittayo laattanaas intte Yordaanoose shaafaa pinnidi laattiza wode, <verse eid="DEU 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32"/>ta inttes hach immiza wogaanne maaraa ubbaa lo7eththi naagite.<verse eid="DEU 11:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Goynnanaas Imettida Pexi Issi Soho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1"/>GODAA intte aawata Xoossay inttes immiza biittaa bolla diza wode intte naagana wogatinne maarati haytantta; <verse eid="DEU 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2"/>intte laattana biittayn diza kawoteththay zumata bolla, zumbullata bollanne daashsha miththata garsan bantta eeqa xoossatas goynnizasota mulera dhayssite. <verse eid="DEU 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3"/>Istti yarsho yarshizasohota laalli dhayssite; shuchchafe oosettidi tuussa mala eqqida eeqa xoossata ubbaa liiqisite; Asheero geetetta xeygettiza eeqa xoossay misleta ubbaa taman xuuggite; masetti giigida istta eeqa xoossata ubbaa menththereththi yeggite; istta sunththaaka biittafe dhayssite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:5">Zaare 7:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4"/>Intte GODAA intte Xoossaas ayzaabeti bantta eeqa xoossatas goynnizayssaththo goynnofte. <verse eid="DEU 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5"/>GODAA intte Xoossay daanaassinne iza sunththay heen xeygettana mala ubba qommota giddon izi dooridasoza koyidi hee biite. <verse eid="DEU 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6"/>Xuugettiza yarshota, hara yarshota, intte asraata, intte muxuwaata, intte adinettida adinata, intte dosidi immiza imotatanne intte mehaappe bayrata hee ehite. <verse eid="DEU 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7"/>Heen GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan intte maana; qasse intte intte wolqqan ooththi kessida ubbaaninne GODAA intte Xoossay inttena anjjida ubbaan intte intteso asaara ufayettana.<verse eid="DEU 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8"/>Intte hanno gakkanaas intte shene mala ooththishe gam7ideta; he wode hessaththo ooththeketa. <verse eid="DEU 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiin intte shempidi daana biittayo buro gelibeekketa. <verse eid="DEU 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immana biittayn daanaas intte Yordaanoose shaafaa pinnana; intte yuushon dooddi uttida morkketappe inttena izi shempisana; intteka heen woppu gi daana. <verse eid="DEU 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11"/>He wode GODAA intte Xoossay ba sunththay xeygettana mala dooridaso tani inttena azaziza ubbaa, xuugettiza yarshota, hara yarshota, intte asraata, intte muxuwaata, intte adinettida adina ubbaa ehandeta. <verse eid="DEU 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12"/>Intte macca naytaranne intte attuma naytara, inttes ooththiza maccassataranne attumasatara, inttenara xinxxo gishetti ekkontta bantta bantta kataman katamaan diza Lewe qommotara GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan intte ufayettana. <verse eid="DEU 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13"/>Intte Xoossas xuuggi yarshiza yarsho beettooson coo yarshontta mala naagettite. <verse eid="DEU 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14"/>Intte intte zereththati dizaso ubbaafe issaan GODAY dooridason xalla xuugettiza yarsho yarshite; tani inttena azaziza miish ubbaaka heen ooththite.<verse eid="DEU 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15"/>Gidikkoka GODAA intte Xoossay inttena anjjida keena intte katamatappe awayssankka intte meheppe, woykko gaarappe woykko genessafe shukkidi intte koyida keena maana dandayeeta; ha ashozappe wogay giza mala geeyida asi gidiin woykko geeyontta asi ubbay maana dandayees. <verse eid="DEU 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16"/>Gido attiin istta suuth moopite; suuththaza haaththa mala duge gaden gussite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Medhe 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lewe 7:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">Zaare 15:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17"/>Intte intte kaththaafe, woyne ushshaafenne wogara zayteppe immiza asraata, intte miizatappe, dorsatappe, deyshatappe bayra, GODAAS intte immanaas adinettida adina ubbaanne intte intte dosan miish ubbaaka intte dizaso awanka moopite. <verse eid="DEU 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18"/>GODAA intte Xoossay dooridason intte macca naytaranne attuma naytara, intte macca aylletaranne attuma aylletara, hessaththoka intte katamatan diza Lewe qommotara issife GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan miite; intte daaburdi shiishshida miish ubbaan GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan heen ufayettana. <verse eid="DEU 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19"/>Intte intte biittan diza wode ubbaan Lewe qommota yeggi aggontta mala naagettite.<verse eid="DEU 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttes caaqqida qaala mala intte zawa aassiza wode inttena asho amosiko intte koyida keena maana dandayeeta. <verse eid="DEU 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21"/>GODAA intte Xoossay ba sunththay xeygettana mala dooridasoy inttefe haakon diikko inttena izi azazida mala miizatappe, dorsatappe shukkidi intte diza katamatan intte koyida keena ashoza maana dandayeeta. <verse eid="DEU 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22"/>Wogay giza mala geeshsha as gidiin woykko geeyontta as gidiin oonikka gaara asho woykko genessa asho miza mala he ashoza maanaas dandayees. <verse eid="DEU 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23"/>Gido attiin shemppoy suuththan diza gishshas suuththara diza asho montta mala naagettite; hessa gishshas shemppo suuththara gaththi moopite. <verse eid="DEU 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24"/>Suuththaa mela gaden gussite attiin moopite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23-24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">Lewe 17:10-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25"/>Inttessinne intte naytas lo7o gidana mala suuth moopite; intte hessaththo ooththiko Xoossi ufayettana.<verse eid="DEU 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26"/>Hessa gishshas intte GODAA intte Xoossaas immanaas dummasidayssanne adinettidayssa ekkidi doorettidaso efte. <verse eid="DEU 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27"/>Xuugettiza yarshoza, ashaanne suuththaa ubbaa GODAA intte Xoossaas yarsho yarshizasoza bolla shiishshite; suuththaza GODAA intte Xoossas yarsho yarshizasohota bolla gussite; ashoza gidikko intte miite. <verse eid="DEU 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28"/>Inttessinne intte naytas mernaas lo7o gidana mala izi inttena azaziza azazota lo7eththi naagite; intte hessaththo ooththiko GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan lo7onne suure gidida ooso ooththeeta.<verse eid="DEU 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eeqa Xoossata Misles Goynnontta Mala Imettida Azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29"/>Intte laattanaas biza kawoteththata GODAA intte Xoossay intte sinththafe dhayssiza wodenne intteka istta biittaa laattidi de7iza wode, <verse eid="DEU 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30"/>istti intte sinththafe dhaydaappe guye, «Hayti ha kawoteththati bantta eeqa xoossatas wostti goynnizoo? Nunikka isttayssaththo ooththana» giidi woximaden oykettontta mala naagettite. <verse eid="DEU 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31"/>Intte GODAA intte Xoossaas goynniza goynoy ayzaabeti goynniza goyno mala gidanaas bessenna; istti ba eeqa xoossatas goynnishe ooththiza oosoti ubbay keehi shaattizaazinne GODAA matan ixettidaaza; gaasoykka istti ba yelida naytakka bantta eeqa xoossatas yarsho ooththidi taman xuuggeettes.<verse eid="DEU 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32"/>Hessa gishshas ta inttena azazida azazo ubbaa ooththite; istta bolla aykkoka gujjofte; qasseka isttafe issinokka pacisopite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:2">Zaare 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:18-19">Ajju 22:18-19</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 12:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1"/>Intte giddofe kaayiza asi woykko agumo agumettiza asi, «Tani gita malaata woykko malalisiza miish ooththana» giikko, <verse eid="DEU 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2"/>izi yootida gita malataynne malalisiza miish ubbay tumukka polettiin izi inttena, «Ane intte erontta hara xoossatas goynnoos» giikko, <verse eid="DEU 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3"/>GODAA intte Xoossay intte iza kumeththa wozinappenne kumeththa shemppofe dosizaakko eranaas koyidi he kaayizayssa yeddida gishshas izi gizayssa mulekka siyopite. <verse eid="DEU 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4"/>GODAA intte Xoossaa kaallite; izas xalla yayyite; iza azazota naagite; iza qaala siyite; izas xalla goynnite; inttes izara diza issifeteththi mino gido. <verse eid="DEU 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5"/>Kase intte aylleteththan diza Gibxeppe inttena wozzi kessidi ashshida GODAA intte Xoossaa bolla intte makkallana mala agumo yootizaade woykko ta nabe giza ubbaa wodhite; hessa mala asati GODAA intte Xoossay inttena minni eqqana mala azazida ogeppe kare kessanaas qoppeettes; hessa gishshas hayta iitata intte giddofe diggite.<verse eid="DEU 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6"/>Intte aayi naa ishay, intte attuma naytinne intte macca nayti, intte siiqiza intte machcheti, intte siiqiza intte laggeti inttena, «Kase intteninne intte aawati goynni erontta xoossas ane goynnoos» giikko, <verse eid="DEU 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7"/>biittas ha gaxappe he gaxa gakkanaas diza intte yuusho ubbaan mataninne haakon diza ubbaa asay goynniza xoossatas, «Biidi ane isttas goynnoos» giidi baleththiko, <verse eid="DEU 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8"/>intte hessa mala asatas eeno goopite; istti gizayssaka siyopite; hessa mala asatas qadhettidi istta ashshanaas dafettofte. <verse eid="DEU 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9"/>Sidhontta istta wodhite; hessa mala as koyrottidi intte caddite; harati inttefe kaallidi shuchchara caddetto. <verse eid="DEU 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10"/>Intte kase Gibxe biittan aylleteththan dizasoppe inttena wozzi kessida GODAA intte Xoossaafe inttena haassanaas koyida gishshas hessaadey hayqqana gakkanaas shuchchan kurakkite. <verse eid="DEU 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11"/>Hessafe guye Isra7eele asay ubbay hessa siyidi babbana; hessa gishshas hessa mala iita ooso nam7anththo oonikka ooththenna.<verse eid="DEU 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12"/>GODAA intte Xoossay intte daana mala inttes immiza katamatappe issaan intte diza wode, <verse eid="DEU 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13"/>intte asaa giddofe iitati dendidi asaa, «Ane biidi intte erontta xoossatas goynnoos» giidi baleththishin siyikko, <verse eid="DEU 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14"/>intte hessa he yo7oza oychchite; minththika qorite; hayssi iita hanoy intte giddon oosettidayssi tumu gidikko, <verse eid="DEU 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15"/>he katamayn diza asaa ubbaa mashshan siifi dhayssite; he katamayonne izin diza mehaa kumeth ashshontta dhayssite. <verse eid="DEU 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16"/>He katamayn diza asaa aqota ubbaa ekkidi he katamay giddon diza dubbushan shiishshi doorite; histtidi GODAA intte Xoossaas yarsho ooththidi taman xuuggite; he katamaya nam7anththo simma eqqontta mala mernaas laaletta attu. <verse eid="DEU 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17"/>Piila miishshafe aykkoyka intte kushen beettofo; histtiko GODAY ba wolqqama hanqofe simmidi inttena maarana; izi inttes qadhettana; kase intte aawatas gelida qaala mala intte qooda darsana. <verse eid="DEU 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18"/>Gaasoykka tani hach inttena azaziza azazo ubbaa intte naagidi GODAA intte Xoossaas azazettiko, qasse GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththankka suure ooso ooththiko he izi gelida hidota qaalay inttes tumu polettana.<verse eid="DEU 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Digettida Yeeho Wogata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1"/>Intte GODAA intte Xoossa nayta; hessa gishshas hayqqida asas mishettidi intte bolla qaaci madunththofte; intte hu7e binanakka buucofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:28">Lewe 19:28</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 21:5">21:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2"/>Gaasoykka intte, GODAA intte Xoossaas dumma dere; GODAY biitta bolla diza dere ubbaafe intte izas dumma dere gidana mala izi inttena baas doorides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">Kessa 19:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Zaare 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:18">26:18</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tito 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1Phex 2:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Meetettizanne Meetettontta Medosata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">Lewe 11:1-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3"/>Tuna gididaaz ay miishsheka moopite. <verse eid="DEU 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4"/>Hessa gishshas maana mala inttes imettida medosati hekko hayssafe kaalli dizayta; kacera dizaytappe miiz, dorsinne deysh, <verse eid="DEU 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5"/>genessa, doge, wusha, wora deysh, cofosho, gaara, cagonne bihore miite. <verse eid="DEU 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6"/>Qinccifilley phalqettidaytanne banchikizayta ubbaa miite. <verse eid="DEU 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7"/>Gido attiin qinccafilley phalqettonttaytanne banchikonttayta moopite; heytikka gaamella, harbaynonne guppale moopite; heytantta mala medosati banchikizaa gidikkoka istta qinccifilley muume gidida gishshas tuna gidi qoodetteettes. <verse eid="DEU 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8"/>Gudunththa qinccifilley phalqeth gidikkoka banchikontta gishshas izi hankko tunatara issife qoodettees; haytantta mala medosata moopitenne isttas ahakka bochchofte.<verse eid="DEU 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9"/>Haaththa giddon diza medheteththa ubbaafe qefera dizaytanne poqoy dizayta ubbaa miite. <verse eid="DEU 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10"/>Gido attiin haaththa giddon medheteththa ubbaafe qefeynne poqoy bayndayta moopite; heyti inttes tuna gidetto.<verse eid="DEU 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11"/>Kafotappe geeshshata miite. <verse eid="DEU 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12"/>Meetettanaas bessonttayti golle, qoollo, ankko, <verse eid="DEU 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13"/>dumma dumma xilotanne woleta, <verse eid="DEU 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14"/>dumma dumma quurota, <verse eid="DEU 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15"/>yanchcha, cancce gutto, haaththa kafo, gace zare ubbaa, <verse eid="DEU 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16"/>gutto, hazo, woyino <verse eid="DEU 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17"/>bazzo gutto, ankko, biya, <verse eid="DEU 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18"/>zigile, saabissa geetettiza haaththa kafo zare ubbaa, jinjilaate geetettiza kafonne wurkawurkko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12-18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Haytanti ubbay hara kafota miza kafota.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19"/>Qefera diza qeeri medheteththati ubbay inttes tuna gidida gishshas istta moopite. <verse eid="DEU 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20"/>Gido attiin istta giddofe geeshshata miite. <verse eid="DEU 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21"/>GODAA intte Xoossaas intte dummatida dere gidida gishshas bawuti hayqqida mehe asho moopite; hara dereppe yiidi intte giddon dizayti maana giikko diggofte; woykko hara dere asas bayzana dandayeeta. Deyshsha laaqqa iza aayey maaththan doyssofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:19">Kessa 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:26">34:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asraata Keso Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22"/>Intte layththan layththan goyidi demmiza kaththafe tammaafe issi kushe dumma shaakki woththite. <verse eid="DEU 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23"/>Intte ubba wode GODAA intte Xoossaa bonchcho taamarana mala izi ba sunththi xeygettana mala dooridason intte kaththaa, woyne ushshaanne zayte asraata, intte dorsatappenne mehetappe koyro yelettidayta GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan miite. <verse eid="DEU 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24"/>GODAA intte Xoossay ba sunththi xeygettana mala dooridasozi intte dizasoppe keehi haaho gidikko GODAA Xoossay inttena anjjana mala intte intte asraataa he tookki ekkidi baanaas dandayontta ixxiko, <verse eid="DEU 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25"/>he intte kessida asraata bayzidi miishsheza GODAY dooridasoza miishshe ekkidi biite. <verse eid="DEU 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26"/>Histtidi heen he asraataa miishshaara intte koyida miish, miiz gidiin woykko dors, woyne ushshu gidiin woykko lo7o mino ushshu intte koyida mala shammidi intteso asa ubbaara mishe GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan ufayettite.<verse eid="DEU 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27"/>Hessa intte ooththiza wode intte katamaan diza Lewe qommota gishan gakkida xinxxoy baynda gishshas intte istta yeggi aggofte. <verse eid="DEU 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28"/>Heedzdzanththo layththan layththan ubba wode intte kaththafe kessiza dumma asraata intte diza katamatan shiishshite. <verse eid="DEU 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29"/>Hessaka intte katamatan diza xinxxoy baynda Leweti, beteti, aaway baynda naytinne am7eti yiidi meto; intte hessaththo ooththizaa gidikko GODAA intte Xoossay intte ooso ubbaan inttena anjjana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30-33">Lewe 27:30-33</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:21">Tay 18:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 14:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Aco Qanxxoy Attiza Layth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Lewe 25:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1"/>Laappunththa laappunththa layththa wurseththan inttefe tal7idaytas acoza isttas aggaagite. <verse eid="DEU 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2"/>Aggishe histti aggite; ba bagga Isra7eele asaas miishshe tal7idaadey wuri ba tal7idayssa izaades maaro; GODAY acoy maarettiza layththa giidi awajjida gishshas ba tal7ida miishshaa zaari ekkanaas koyoppo. <verse eid="DEU 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3"/>Hara kare dere asas intte tal7ida miishshey diikko inttes zaarana mala oychchana dandayeeta; inttes isha Isra7eele asatappe inttefe miishshe tal7iday diikko isttas aggaagite.<verse eid="DEU 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4-5"/>Hach ta inttena azaziza azazota ubbaan GODAA intte Xoossaas intte azazettizayta gidikko GODAA intte Xoossi inttena keehi anjjana gishshas izi inttes xinxxo histti immiza biittayn intte garsan manqoy deenna. <verse eid="DEU 15:4-5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttes hidota qaalaa mala inttena anjjana; intte daro deretas tal7anashin isttafe oonappeka tal7e haa ekkeeta; qasseka intte kawoteththata haarana attiin oonikka inttena haarenna.<verse eid="DEU 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza biittaan intte diza katamata ubbaan Isra7eele asaappe issaadey metotishin be7ikko izi intte bagga gidida gishshas izas meqeth iitopite; qasse iza maaddanaappe intte kushe guye ekkofte. <verse eid="DEU 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8"/>Intte kushe miccidi izas koshshizaaz ubbaa modhettontta tal7ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:35">Lewe 25:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9"/>«Aco qanxxofe maariza laappunththa layththay gakkides» giidi metotanchcha intte ishata tal7e diggofte; hessa mala iita qofay intte wozinan geloppo; manqo gidida intte ishatas intte tal7ontta ixxiko istti pude Xoossaako waassiin inttes gome gidontta mala naagettite. <verse eid="DEU 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10"/>Intte izas coo kiyateth immite; intte izas immishe intte wozinan modhettontta immite; histtiko intte ooso ubbaaninne intte kushey bochchida miish ubbaan GODAA intte Xoossay inttena anjjana. <verse eid="DEU 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11"/>Ay wode gidiinkka biitta bolla metotanchchaynne manqoy diza gishshas intte deren diza manqotassinne metotanchchatas intte kiyateth ooththana mala ta azazays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:11">Mato 26:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:7">Mar 14:7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:8">Yoha 12:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aylleta Ayso Woga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 21:1-11">Kessa 21:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12"/>Adde gidiin macca gidiin ne bagga gidida Isra7eele asaappe issi asi ayllettanaas bana nees bayzikko izi nees usuppun layth ooththidaappe guye laappunththa layththan iza aylleteththafe kessa yedda. <verse eid="DEU 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13"/>Neni aylleteththafe iza kessa yeddiza wode mela kushe yeddofa. <verse eid="DEU 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14"/>GODAA ne Xoossay nees immida anjjofe, dorsatappe, kaththafenne woyne ayfeppe izas kiyateththan immada yedda. <verse eid="DEU 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15"/>Intteka kase Gibxe biittan aylle gididayssanne GODAA intte Xoossay inttena heeppe wozzidayssa dogopte; tani inttena hach azazizay hessassa.<verse eid="DEU 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16"/>Gido attiin he ayllezi nenanne neso asaa dosida gishshassinne nenara duussi izas lo7o gidida gishshas, «Ta neeppe shaakettana koykke» giikko, <verse eid="DEU 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17"/>neni iza neso penge efada iza hayththaa ne penge sanqqa bolla woththada wosfera lukka; Hessafe guye izi ba de7o layth ubbaan nees aylle gido; qasseka aylle gidiza maccassaska hessaththo ooththa. <verse eid="DEU 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18"/>Ne iza aylleteththafe kessa yeddiza wode, «Hayssi taas qoho» gaada qoppofa; gaasoykka izi ha usuppun layththaan miishshas ooththiza asi ooththiza oosoppe dakko darssidi nees ooththides; hessa gishshas ne hessaththo ooththiko GODAA ne Xoossay ne ooththiza ooso ubbaan nena anjjana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:39-46">Lewe 25:39-46</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mehe Bayra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19"/>Neni ne mehaappenne ne dorsa wudaappe bayra yelettida adde ubbaa GODAA ne Xoossaas dummasa; istta aykkoska go7ettofa; hessaththoka dorsa wudaappe bayra yelettidayta iskeka qanxxofa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:12">Kessa 13:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20"/>Neninne neso asay GODAA ne Xoossay dooridasohon GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan layththan layththan heyta miite. <verse eid="DEU 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21"/>Gido attiin ne yarshiza meheta bolla wosoy beettiko, hessika toho sila woykko qooqe, qasseka hara iita borizaazi istta bolla diikko hessantta GODAA ne Xoossaas yarsho shiishshofa. <verse eid="DEU 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22"/>Heytantta mala meheta heen intteson maanaas dandayeeta; wogay giza mala geeshsha as gidiin woykko tuna as gidiin genessa ashonne gaara asho miza mala maana dandayeeta. <verse eid="DEU 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23"/>Gido attiin istta suuththaa haaththa mala wora gussite attiin moopite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Medhe 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lewe 7:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 15:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Paaziga Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Kessa 12:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttena Abibe aginan omarsara Gibxeppe kessides; hessa gishshas Abibe aginan GODAA intte Xoossaa Paaziga ba7aale bonchchite. <verse eid="DEU 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2"/>GODAA intte Xoossay ba sunththi xeygettana mala dooridason intte iza bonchchana mala intte meheppe, woykko dorsafe issaa Paaziga ba7aalen yarsho shiishshite. <verse eid="DEU 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3"/>He yarsho kaththaa intte miza wode irshoy izan gelida kath moopite; hessaththoka kase intte eeson Gibxeppe keziza wode ooththoyssa mala laappun gallas gakkanaas irshoy izan gelontta waaye uketh miite; hessika intte daro meto be7idi Gibxe biittafe kezida gallassaa inttena qofsana. <verse eid="DEU 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4"/>Laappun gallas gakkanaas intte deren ay asa keeththankka irshoy dooppo; intte koyro gallassa omars yarshos shukkida asho ubbay he gallas meetetti wurana bessees.<verse eid="DEU 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5"/>Intte Paaziga yarsho GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza ay katamatankka coo shukkofte. <verse eid="DEU 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6"/>Gido attiin GODAA intte Xoossay ba sunththay xeygettana mala dooridason xalla shukkite; shukkishe arshey wulliza wode intte kase Gibxeppe kezida gallassayonne saateyo naagidi shukkite. <verse eid="DEU 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7"/>He shukkida ashoza GODAA intte Xoossay dooridason xiixi miite; wonteththa gallas gede intte dunkaanen dunkaanen simmite. <verse eid="DEU 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8"/>Usuppun gallas irshoy izan gelontta uketh miite; Laappunththo gallas GODAA intte Xoossaas goynnanaas issiso shiiqite; he gallas ay oosokka ooththofte.<verse eid="DEU 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaththa Shiisho Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:22">Kessa 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lewe 23:15-21</ref>)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:5-8">Lewe 23:5-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Tay 28:16-25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9"/>Intte kath shiishshanaas koyro doommida gallassafe biidi laappun saamintta kumeth qoodite. <verse eid="DEU 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10"/>Hessafe guye GODAA intte Xoossay inttena anjjida keena intte intte dosan imota ehidi GODAA intte Xoossaas kaththa shiisho ba7aale bonchchite. <verse eid="DEU 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11"/>Hessan intte intte attuma naytaranne intte macca naytara, intte attuma aylletaranne macca aylletara, intte katamaan diza Lewetaranne bete asatara, intte giddon diza yi7otaranne am7etara ubbay GODAA intte Xoossi ba sunththi xeygettana mala dooridason ufayettite. <verse eid="DEU 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12"/>Kase intte Gibxen aylle gididayssa yuushshi qoppidi hayta wogata lo7eththi naagite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:26-31">Tay 28:26-31</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daase Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Lewe 23:33-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13"/>Intte kath baleppe gelththidaappe guye qasseka woyne gum7izasohoppe ekkidaappe guye laappun gallas gakkanaas daase ba7aale bonchchite. <verse eid="DEU 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14"/>Hessan intte, intte attuma naytaranne intte macca naytara, intte attuma aylletanne macca aylletara, intte katamaan diza Lewetaranne bete asatara, intte giddon diza yi7otaranne am7etara ubbay ufayettite. <verse eid="DEU 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15"/>GODAA intte Xoossay dooridason laappun gallas gakkanaas izas ba7aale bonchchite; GODAA intte Xoossay intte kaththaanne intte ooththiza ooso ubbaan inttena anjjana; izan intte ufayettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 29:12-38">Tay 29:12-38</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16"/>Intte biittan diza attuma as gidida ubbay layththan heedzdzuto Paaziga ba7aale wode, kaththa shiisho ba7aale wodenne daase ba7aale wode GODAA intte Xoossay izi dooridaso iza sinth shiiqo; ba7aaleza bonchchana yishe oonikka coo mela kushe GODAA sinth yooppo. <verse eid="DEU 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17"/>Issi issi asi ekki yaana imotay GODAA intte Xoossay izaade anjjida keena gido.<verse eid="DEU 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xillo Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18"/>Intte zareti ubbay GODAA intte Xoossay immiza katamatan ubbaan intte daannatanne halaqata sunththite; isttika asaas xillo pirda pirdetto. <verse eid="DEU 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19"/>Pirda geellasoppa; asa ayfeso beyada maadda pirdofa; baleththofa; maganxo mooppa; gaasoykka maganxoy aadho eranchchata ayfe qooqisees; xillota qaalakka bokkisees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:6-8">Kessa 23:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:15">Lewe 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20"/>Intte shemppora paxa daana malanne GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza biitta intte laattana mala xillonne suure pirda pirdite.<verse eid="DEU 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eeqa Xoossatas Goynnontta Mala Imettida Wogata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21"/>GODAA intte Xoossaas intte yarshizaso achchan miththafe oosettida Asheeri misle essofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:13">Kessa 34:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22"/>Qasseka GODAA intte Xoossay ixxiza goyno shuch essofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:1">Lewe 26:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1"/>Intte intte mehe garsafe wosoy woykko pacey dizaaz boora gidiin woykko dorsa GODAA intte Xoossaas yarsho shiishshofte; hessi GODAA achchan ixettida miishsha. <verse eid="DEU 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2"/>Intte GODAY inttes immiza katamatappe issineyn diza macca gidiin adde gidiin caaqo qaalaa menththidi GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan iita miish ooththi beettiko, <verse eid="DEU 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3"/>qasseka ta azazo yedhdhi aadhdhidi hara xoossatas goynniko woykko arshes, aginassinne xoolinttetas goynniko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:20">Kessa 22:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4"/>heytantta mala hanota intte siyikko he yo7oza pilggi qorite; hessa mala iita yo7oti Isra7eele asaa giddon oosettidayssi tumu gidikko, <verse eid="DEU 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5"/>he iita ooththidaade woykko ooththidaaro katama giddofe gede haraso efidi shuchchan kurakki wodhite. <verse eid="DEU 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6"/>Hessika nam7u markkay woykko heedzdzu markkay izaade bolla markkattidaappe guye gido; gido attiin issi asi xalla markkattida markkan ay asikka hayqqofo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:30">Tay 35:30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">Zaare 19:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mato 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 13:1">2Qoro 13:1</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:19">1Xim 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:28">Ib 10:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7"/>Markkati koyrottidi shuchchan caddetto; hessafe guye hankko dere ubbay caddo; hessaththo ooththidi intte giddofe iita ubbaa diggite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:13">1Qoro 5:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Deexo Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8"/>Intte intte katamatan pirdanaas keehi deexxiza shemppo gishshas shiiqiza mooto, shochcha mooto, qasse, «Taas bessees» giza aqota mooto gidiinkka dendiko he wode GODAA intte Xoossay dooridaso eeson ehite. <verse eid="DEU 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9"/>Lewe qommotappe qeese gididaytassinne he wode daanna gididi pirdizayssas yo7oza shiishshite; he yo7oza istti pirdetto. <verse eid="DEU 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10"/>GODAY dooridason gididi istti inttes pirdiza pirda mala ooththite; intte polana mala istti immiza azazota naagetti polite. <verse eid="DEU 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11"/>Istti inttena tamaarsida wogaanne pirda mala ooththite; istti pirdida pirdafe hadirsinne ushach goopite. <verse eid="DEU 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12"/>GODAA intte Xoossaas ooththiza daannaas woykko qeeses azazettontta ixxidi otorettiza asi diikko hessaadey hayqqo; hessaththo ooththidi heytantta misatiza iita miishshata ubbaa Isra7eele deraa giddofe diggite. <verse eid="DEU 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13"/>Hessafe guye asi wuri hessa siyidi babbana; nam7anththo hessa mala iita ooso ooththanaas xalana asi deenna.<verse eid="DEU 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kawo Kawoththana Imettida Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza biittayo geli laattidi heen duus doommiza wode, «Nuna yuuyi aadhdhida kawoteththatas kawoy dizayssaththo nunikka nuus kawo kawoththana» giikko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">1Same 8:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15"/>intte kawoththanay GODAA intte Xoossay inttes dooridaade gididayssa erite; hessi intte asaa giddofe doorettidayssa giddofe attiin hara biitta as intte bolla kawosopite. <verse eid="DEU 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16"/>He kawozi daro para baas shiishshanaas bessenna; GODAY asay Gibxe simmontta mala azazida gishshas heeppe para shammanaas asaa yeddofo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:28">1Kawo 10:28</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:16">2Taari 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:28">9:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17"/>Iza wozina baleththontta mala kawoy cora machcho ekkofo; worqqanne biraakka darssi shiishshofo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:14-22">1Kawo 10:14-22</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 10:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:1-8">11:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:15">2Taari 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:27">9:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18"/>Izi ba kawoteththa algan uttiza wode Xoossa woga maxaafa Lewe qommo gidida qeeseta matappe baas duuqqi ekko. <verse eid="DEU 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19"/>He maxaafaza ba matan woththidi ba de7o layth ubbaan nababo; izi histtiko GODAA ba Xoossaa bonchchonne he maxaafan xaafettida wogatanne maarata keehi naagettidinne ammanettidi polo taamarana. <verse eid="DEU 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20"/>Histtiko izi ba wozinan, «Tani ta laggetappe aadhdhays» giidi Isra7eele asaa bolla otorettenna; GODAA ba Xoossaa wogappe hadirsinne ushach geenna; izi daro layth kawotana; iza naytikka Isra7eele biittan daro layth kawotana.<verse eid="DEU 17:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Qeesetanne Leweta Gakkiza Gisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1"/>Lewetappe qeesetinne qasseka kumeththa Lewe qommoti hankko attida Isra7eele asaara biitta gishettiza wogay isttas baynda gishshas istti GODAAS yarshanaas shiishshiza yarshofe miidi detto. <verse eid="DEU 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2"/>Istta ishata Isra7eele asaa garsan isttas xinxxo gadey dooppo; izi isttas immida hidota qaala mala GODAY isttas xinxxo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:20">Tay 18:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3"/>Wofano gidiin woykko dorsa yarshos shiishshiza wode qeeseti missata, banqilatanne ganjjeta ekketto. <verse eid="DEU 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4"/>Intte kaththafe xeera, woyne ushshafenne wogara zayteppe xeera, dorsa iskefe koyro qanxxettidayssa isttas immite. <verse eid="DEU 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5"/>Mernaas qeeseteththan ooththana mala hara qommota giddofe GODAA intte Xoossay Lewe qommota baas doorides.<verse eid="DEU 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6"/>Lewe qommotappe issi asi kase ba diza Isra7eele katamappe GODAY dooridaso baanaas daro amoy izas diikko, <verse eid="DEU 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7"/>biidi heen kase haggaziza Lewe qommoti ooththizayssaththo izikka GODAA sinththan ooththo. <verse eid="DEU 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8"/>Qasse ba aawa aqo bayziin bana gakkidayssa ekkidaa gidikkoka qeeseti go7ettizayssa ubbaa isttara gina gishetti ekko.<verse eid="DEU 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayzaabeta Wogappe Naagettana Mala Imettida Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza biittaa intte geliza wode he biittan diza kawoteththay ooththiza tuna ooso ooththofte. <verse eid="DEU 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10"/>Ba attuma naa woykko macca naa yarshos giidi taman xuuggiza ay asikka intte giddon dooppo; bitizay, marace xeellizay, muurennizaynne maroy intte giddon dooppo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:26">Lewe 19:26</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 22:18">Kessa 22:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11"/>Qasseka daggamizaadey (gojizay), woykko moytille xeygizaadey woykko iita ayanatara haasayzaadey, woykko hayqqida asata ayanara haasayzaadey intte giddon dooppo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:31">Lewe 19:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12"/>Hessantta mala ooththiza ay asikka GODAA matan ixettidaade; istti hessa mala tuna ooththida gishshas GODAA intte Xoossay he kawoteththata intte sinththafe dhoqalli dhayssana. <verse eid="DEU 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13"/>GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan mulera intte ammanettizayta gidanaas bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:48">Mato 5:48</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muse Mala Sinththafe Dendana Nabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14"/>Ha intte laattanaas biza biittaan diza kawoteththati muurennizaytinne marace xeellizayti yootizayssa siyizayta. Intte gidikko hessaththo ooththontta mala GODAA intte Xoossay inttena diggides. <verse eid="DEU 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15"/>GODAA intte Xoossay intte zareppe ta mala nabe denththana; intte izi inttes yootizayssa siyidi azazettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:22">Hawa 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:37">7:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16"/>Intte Siina zuma bolla shiiqida wode GODAA intte Xoossaa, «Nuni hayqqontta mala GODAA nu Xoossaa cenggurssaa zaari siyokko; qasseka ha wolqqama tamaakka nam7anththo be7okko» giidi oychchideta.<verse eid="DEU 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17"/>Hessa gishshas GODAY taas, «Istti oychchiza oyshay likke» gides. <verse eid="DEU 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18"/>Tani istta zareta giddofe isttas ne mala nabe denththana; izi haasayana qaala ta izas immana; ta azazizayssa ubbaa izi inttes yootana. <verse eid="DEU 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19"/>Ta sunththan yootiza he nabeza qaala siyontta as ta qaxxayana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:23">Hawa 3:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20"/>Gido attiin ta iza azazontta xalateththan ta sunththan yootiza nabey woykko eeqa xoossata sunththan yootiza nabey hayqqo.<verse eid="DEU 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21"/>Intte, «Nabey yootiza tinbite qaalay GODAAPPE gidonttayssa ta aazan shaakka eranee?» gi oychchana dandayeeta. <verse eid="DEU 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22"/>He nabezi yootiday GODAA sunththan yootiin izi yootida qaalay polettontta aggiko hessi GODAY yootonttayssa gididayssa ereeta; he nabezi wordo haasayda gishshas izas yayyofte.<verse eid="DEU 18:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Asi Baqati Attiza Katamata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 35:9-28">Tay 35:9-28</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Iya 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza biittan diza kawoteththata dhayssidi intte istta katamataninne keeththatan de7o doommiza wode, <verse eid="DEU 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttes xinxxo ooththidi immiza biittan diza katamatappe heedzdzu katamata inttes shaakkite. <verse eid="DEU 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttes xinxxo ooththidi immiza biittaa heedzdzu kessi shaakkite; histtidi ase wodhida asi oonikka he katamatappe issaan baqati attana mala hee efi gaththiza oge giigsite. <verse eid="DEU 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4"/>Issi asi kase izara morkketeththi bayndaade wodhana gi qoppontta dingate as wodhikko hessaadey katamatappe issineyn bi gelidi ba shemppo ashsho. <verse eid="DEU 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5"/>Leemisos nam7u asati mith qanxxana bidason istti mith qanxxishin miththaa qanxxiza beyixezi woykko kalttazi tuutezappe qoppontta koletti biidi izara dizaadeza wodhikko, he beyixey iza kusheppe koletti bi wodhidaadezi he heedzdzu katamatappe issi katamayo bi geli ba shemppo ashsho. <verse eid="DEU 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6"/>Qotetti attiza katamay eeson gakettontta haakoson dizaa gidikko ogey aduqqida gaason suuth azarizaadey keehi hanqettidi gooddi gakkidi hayqqanaas bessonttayssa wodhanaas dandayees; gaasoykka izi ba shooro wodhiday morkketeththi diza gishshas gidenna. <verse eid="DEU 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7"/>Intte heedzdzu katamata dumma shaakkana mala ta inttena azazizay hessa gishshassa. <verse eid="DEU 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8"/>GODAA intte Xoossay kase intte aawatas gelida hidota qaalaa mala izi intte zawa aassiko, <verse eid="DEU 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9"/>hach ta inttena azazidayssa ubbaa intte polikko, GODAA intte Xoossaka siiqikko qasse iza ogen biikko izi inttes hanno biittayo immiza gishshas asi isttan baqati biidi attana mala hara heedzdzu katamata gujji giigsite. <verse eid="DEU 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10"/>Intte hessaththo ooththiza gaasoykka intte izin daana mala GODAA intte Xoossay inttes xinxxo histti immiza biittayn xillo suuththi gukkontta malanne intteka suuththa acon oyshettontta malassa.<verse eid="DEU 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11"/>Gidikkoka issi asi morkketeththan dendidi geeman zamadi uttidi qadhetay baynda as wodhidaappe guye ba shemppo ashshanaas he katamatappe issineyn baqati biikko, <verse eid="DEU 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12"/>izi diza katamaa cimati izi baqati bida katamaappe as kiitti ehisidi hayqqidayssa suuth azarizaades aaththi immetto. <verse eid="DEU 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13"/>Izas aykkoka qadhettofte; inttes ubba miishshi lo7o gidana mala shemppo wodhizayta Isra7eele giddofe dhayssite.<verse eid="DEU 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhas Shoddanaas Bessenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza xinxxon beni asati inttessinne intte shooros giddon essida zawa shoddofte.<verse eid="DEU 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Markkateththas Imettida Azazo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 27:17">Zaare 27:17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15"/>Asi moorida mooro shaakki eranaas issi markkay xalla gidenna; nam7u woykko heedzdzu markkay markkattana bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:30">Tay 35:30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:6">Zaare 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mato 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:31">Yoha 19:31</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 13:1">2Qoro 13:1</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:19">1Xim 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:28">Ib 10:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16"/>Issi iita asi hara as wordora mootikko, <verse eid="DEU 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17"/>nam7atikka he wode GODAA sinththan ooththiza qeeseta sinththaninne pirdiza daannata sinththan eqqetto. <verse eid="DEU 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18"/>He pirdizaytikka he yo7oza lo7eththi pilggi xeelletto; he markkattizaadezi ba ishaza bolla wordora markkattidayssi tumu gidikko, <verse eid="DEU 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19"/>izi he mootoza ba ishaa qaxxayssanaas qoppida qixaatezan ba hu7es qaxxayetto; histtidi hessa mala iita ooththizayssa intte giddofe diggite. <verse eid="DEU 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20"/>Histtiko hara asay hessa siyidi babbana; hessa mala iita oosoy intte giddon oosettenna. <verse eid="DEU 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21"/>Hessa mala iita ooththizaytas mulekka qadhettofte; shemppo wodhidaade wodhite; ayfe toyssidaades ayfe toyssite; ach menththidaades ach menththite; kushe menththidaades kushe menththite; toho menththidaades toho menththite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:23-25">Kessa 21:23-25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:19-20">Lewe 24:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:38">Mato 5:38</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Ola Asatas Imettida Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1"/>Intte intte morkketa olana bishin para-gaaretinne toga asati inttefe daro gidikko hessa be7idi dagammofte; gaasoykka inttena Gibxeppe kessida GODAA intte Xoossay inttenara diza gishshas babbofte. <verse eid="DEU 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2"/>Intte ola doommanaappe sinththatidi qeesezi ola asaakko shiiqidi, <verse eid="DEU 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3"/>«Isra7eele asawu! Haa ezgite! Intte hach intte morkketara olettanaas beeta; intte wozinay dagammofonne babbofo; istta sinththan kokkoropitenne shirotopite. <verse eid="DEU 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4"/>GODAA intte Xoossay intte morkketa olanaas inttenara biza gishshas izi inttena xoonisana» go.<verse eid="DEU 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5"/>Hessafe kaallidi ola asaa kaaleththizayti olanchchatas, «Ooraththa keeth keexxidi gelontta asi intte garsan diikko izi olaso bi hayqqiin hara asi iza keeththan gelontta mala baso guye simmo. <verse eid="DEU 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6"/>Woykko woyne tokkidi iza ayfe shiishshontta asi diikko izi olan hayqqiin hara asi iza woyne ayfe baas shiishshidi ufayettontta mala izi baso simmo. <verse eid="DEU 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7"/>Machcho ekkana giigsi woththida asi olan hayqqiin hara asi izo ekkontta mala izi baso simmo» getto.<verse eid="DEU 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8"/>Ola asaa kaaleththizayti, «Wozinay babbiza asi intte garsan diikko hankko ola asaa wozina hirgisontta mala izi baso simmo» getto. <verse eid="DEU 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9"/>Ola asaa kaaleththizayti hessa yooti wursidaappe guye ola asaa butten butten shaakkidi issi issi buttes kaaleththizayta dooretto.<verse eid="DEU 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10"/>Issi katama olanaas biidi intte isttako matiza wode koyrottidi saron istti kushe immana mala oychchite. <verse eid="DEU 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11"/>Istti inttena saron mokki ekkidi bantta gimbe penge doydi inttena gelththiko he katamaan diza asay ubbay inttes haggazonne deexo ooso ooththo. <verse eid="DEU 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12"/>Gido attiin he katamaa asay inttes saron ba kushe immontta ixxidi inttenara olettana koykko istta katamaa dooddite. <verse eid="DEU 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13"/>GODAA intte Xoossay he katamayo intte kushen aaththi immiza wode he katamayn diza attumasaa ubbaa wodhite. <verse eid="DEU 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14"/>Gido attiin maccassatanne guuththa nayta, mehenne he katamayn diza aqota ubbaa inttes di7i ekkite; qasse GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza intte morkketa aqota inttes go7ettite. <verse eid="DEU 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15"/>Qasseka intte dizasoppe haakki diza katamatakka intte oykkiza wode hayssafe kaallizayssa ooththite.<verse eid="DEU 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttes aaththi immida biitta bolla asaa intte oli oykkizaa gidikko asa ubbaa wodhite. <verse eid="DEU 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17"/>GODAY intte Xoossay inttena azazida mala Hiiteta, Amooreta, Kanaaneta, Paarizeta, Hiiwetanne Yaabuseta ubbaa wodhite. <verse eid="DEU 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18"/>Intte histtontta aggiko istti bantta eeqa xoossatas goynniza tuna ooso intte ooththana mala inttena tamaarsana; hessan GODAA intte Xoossaa bolla nagara ooththana.<verse eid="DEU 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19"/>Intte katamaa oykkanaas dooddi daro gallas olettishe gam7iza wode izan diza ayfe immiza miththata ayfe intte maana dandayza gishshas istta qanxxofte; istti ayfe ayfiza miththafe attiin asara olettiza as gidettenna; he demban diza miththata qanxxofte. <verse eid="DEU 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20"/>Hankko ayfe ayfontta miththata gidikko istta qanxxereththi yeggidi he katamaya kundana gakkanaas giddoththi naagana dandayeeta.<verse eid="DEU 20:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21"/>
  <para style="s1">As Wodhidi Erettontta Geemmidaade Daafa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1"/>Intte laattana mala GODAA intte Xoossi inttes immiza biittayn ooni wodhidaakko erettontta asa ahay coo demban kundi beettiko, <verse eid="DEU 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2"/>intte daannatinne intte cimati biidi ahazi dizasoppe doommidi he heeran diza katamata gakkanaas diza haahoteththaa wadhdhetto. <verse eid="DEU 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3"/>Hessafe guye ahazi dizasos matiza katamayn diza kaaleththizayti oosos gakkontta buro qambaray izi morge bolla wodhdhontta issi ussu dooretto. <verse eid="DEU 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4"/>He ussiyo mulekka goyetti eronttaso, ay atakiltey toketti eronttasonne goggiza haaththi diza shoobba efidi heen ussay morge mirqqi menththetto. <verse eid="DEU 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5"/>Histtidi GODAA intte Xoossay ba sinththan ooththana mala, ba sunththan anjjana mala, mootonne shemppo daafa gelidi shaakki pirdana mala GODAA intte Xoossay Lewe naytappe doorida qeeseti ahazi dizaso mata betto. <verse eid="DEU 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6"/>Hessafe guye ahazi dizaso matan diza katamayo kaaleththiza cimati morge mirqqi menththida ussay bolla bantta kushe meecettetto. <verse eid="DEU 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7"/>Histtidi, «Hayssa nu wodhibeekko; ooni wodhidaakkoka nu beyibeekko. <verse eid="DEU 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8"/>GODAWU! Neni Gibxeppe wozzada kessida ne dere Isra7eele nagaraa wursa; nunakka maara; hayssa gukkida xillo suuththaa gishshas nuna oychchofa» getto. <verse eid="DEU 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9"/>Intte GODAA sinththan suure miish ooththidi xillo suuththi gukkida nagaraa intte giddofe diggite.<verse eid="DEU 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Di7etti Yida Maccassatappe Machcho Eko Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10"/>Ne morkketara ne olettanaas keziin GODAA ne Xoossi istta ne kushen aaththi immiin ne istta di7ida wode, <verse eid="DEU 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11"/>he di7ettidayta giddon mala lo7o maccas demmada izo nees machcho ekkanaas koykko, <verse eid="DEU 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12"/>izo neni neso ehikko iza ba hu7e meedettu; qasse ba xugunth iiru. <verse eid="DEU 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13"/>Kase iza di7etta yashe may7ida may7o laammu; issi agina gakkanaas neson uttada olan hayqqida ba aayssinne ba aawaas yeekku; hessafe guye izo nees machcho ekka. <verse eid="DEU 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14"/>Guyeppe neni izin ufayettontta aggiko izo anjja yeddanaas dandayaasa; kase izo wolqqara ekkiday nena gidida gishshas zaarada bayzanaassinne aylle mala qoodanaas bessenna.<verse eid="DEU 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayra Naas Imettida Laattana Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15"/>Issi asi nam7u machcho ekkidi isttafe issineyo dosidi issineyo ixxiko he nam7atikka izas attuma nayta yelikko he yelettida naytappe bayrazi izi ixxizaari naa gidikko, <verse eid="DEU 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16"/>izi ba haaro ba naytas gishiza wode izi ixxizaarippe yelettida bayra naaza bayrateththaa kadhidi ba dosizaarippe yelettida naazas maaddidi aaththi immanaas bessenna. <verse eid="DEU 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17"/>Bayra naazi izi siiqontta machcheyfe yelettikokka izi izas koyro yelo gidida gishshas hankko naytappe aaththidi nam7u kushe aaththi immidi izi bayra gididayssa eriso.<verse eid="DEU 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Azazettontta Naytas Imettida Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18"/>Aawassinne aayis azazettontta ixxidi istti muriinkka simmontta ixxida makkallanchchanne wozina muume nay isttas diikko, <verse eid="DEU 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19"/>aayanne aaway bantti diza katamata garsan cimati pirdizaso ekki betto. <verse eid="DEU 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20"/>«Hayssi nu naazi wozina muume; makkallanchcha; nuus azazettenna; maththotteessinne miish coo dhayssees» gi cimatas yootetto. <verse eid="DEU 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21"/>He katamayn diza attuma asay ubbay iza shuchchan caddi wodhetto; intte hessaththo histtiko intte garsafe iita miishshi dhayana; Isra7eele deren dizay wuri hessa siyidi yayyana.<verse eid="DEU 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dumma Dumma Wogata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22"/>Issi asi ba ooththida gita mooro gaason miththa bolla kaqetti hayqqana mala pirdettiko, <verse eid="DEU 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23"/>miththa bolla kaqetti hayqqida asi Xoossi qanggidaade gidida gishshas iza ahay miththa bolla kaqetti aqopo; GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza biitta tunisontta mala hayqqida ahaza he gallas moogite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:13">Gala 3:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 21:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1"/>Isra7eele asaa booray woykko dorsi dhaydi wora bishin intte demmiko co7u gi aadhdhofte; iza godaas laagga efa imma. <verse eid="DEU 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2"/>Gido attiin mehaaddey dizasoy haaho gidikko woykko he mehaaddey oonakko ne erontta aggiko meheza neso ekkada ba; mehaaddey koyishe yiikko izayssa izas zaara. <verse eid="DEU 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3"/>May7o gidiin woykko hare gidiin woykko hara ay miishshika ne bagga Isra7eele asaappe dhayiin ne demmidaa gidikko zaarada izaades imma.<verse eid="DEU 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4"/>Ne bagga Isra7eele asaas harey woykko booray ogen kundiin ne be7idaa gidikko maaddada denththa attiin be7ashe yegga aadhdhofa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:4-5">Kessa 23:4-5</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5"/>GODAA intte Xoossay hessaththo ooththizayta ixxiza gishshas maccati attumasata may7o, attumasati maccassata may7o may7ofetto.<verse eid="DEU 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6"/>Ne oge bishin kafoy ba keeththan miththa bolla woykko biitta bolla yelida ciyeta woykko phuuphphulle haphpha diza kafo ne demmidaa kafoyo ciyetara gaththa neso efoppa. <verse eid="DEU 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7"/>Ciyeta neso ekka baanaas dandayaasa; aayeyo gidikko iza piradhdha baana mala yedda; neni hessaththo ooththiko nees lo7o gidananne ne daro layth daana.<verse eid="DEU 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8"/>Ne ooraththa keeth keexxashe he keeththaa kaarappe asi kundidi suuththa acon nena oyshisontta mala keeththaa kaara bolla teqe woththa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keeththaa kaara bolla teqe woththa gizayssi Isra7eele biittan keeth keexxishe keeththaa kaaray bollan demba gidida gishshas asi bollafe kundontta mala gaxara teqe woththeettes.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9"/>Neni woyne mith tokkashe iza giddon hara zereth zeroppa; ne hara zerikko woyne miththaa ayfeppe gidiin woykko hara ne zeroo kaththaafe go7ettanaas dandayakka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:19">Lewe 19:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10"/>Booranne hare issife issi qambaran waaxa goyoppa.<verse eid="DEU 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11"/>Suufeppenne puuttofe walaketti dadettida may7o may7ofa.<verse eid="DEU 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12"/>Ne may7ana may7os oyddu baggarakka macara medhdha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:37-41">Tay 15:37-41</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Geela7oteththas Imettida Woga Naago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13"/>Issi asi machcho ekkida mala izira aqi simmidi izo ixxiko, <verse eid="DEU 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14"/>«Hanno maccassayo ekkadis shin izis geela7oteththa wogay baawa» giidi wordora izi sunththu moorikko, <verse eid="DEU 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15"/>he nayo yelidayti naya geela7o gididayssas markka ehidi he katamaan diza cimata bessetto. <verse eid="DEU 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16"/>Nay aaway isttas, «Tani ta nayo hayssa addezas immadis shin ha7i izi izo ixxidayssa qonccisides. <verse eid="DEU 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17"/>‹Ne nays geela7oteththi baawa› giidi ta nay sunththu moorides; ta nays geela7oteththi dizayssas hayssi markka» giidi he dere kaaleththizayta sinththan izi izo ekkishin may7o bolla gukkida suuththara diza malata carqqaza besso. <verse eid="DEU 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18"/>He katamayo kaaleththizayti addeza shoci qaxxayetto. <verse eid="DEU 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19"/>Qasseka izi Isra7eele naytappe geela7oteththara diza issiney sunththu moorida gishshas issi xeetu saqile bira nay aawaas magaco qanxxo; hessafe guye nayakka izas machcho gidu; izi shemppora paxa diza layth ubbaan izo anjji yeddanaas dandayenna.<verse eid="DEU 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20"/>Gido attiin izi gidayssi tumu gidi beettiko qasse iza geela7o gididayssa qonccisiza malatay baynda aggiko, <verse eid="DEU 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21"/>iza ba aawa soon dashe laymatada Isra7eele asaa yeellachchiza ooso ooththida gishshas izo izi aawa keeththa kare efetto; he katamaan diza asay izo shuchchara caddi wodho; hessaththo histtidi intte giddofe iita miish diggite.<verse eid="DEU 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22"/>Issi asi hara asa machchira zin7i beettiko nam7ayka hayqqetto; hessaththo histtidi intte giddofe iita miish diggite.<verse eid="DEU 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23"/>Ay asikka katama giddon azina gelana giiga uttida geela7oyra zin7idi beettiko, <verse eid="DEU 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24"/>nam7atakka he katamayppe kare kessidi shuchchan caddi wodhite; geela7oya katama giddon dashe, «Tana ashshite» gaada waassontta gishshas hayqqanaas bessees; qasse addezi hara asara giiga dizaarira zin7idi woga menththida gishshas hayqqanaas bessees; hessaththo histtidi intte giddofe iita miish diggite.<verse eid="DEU 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25"/>Issi asi hara asas giiga uttida geela7oyo iza diza katamappe harason demmi wolqqaththidi izi geela7oteththaa ekkidaa gidikko hessaadey xalla hayqqo. <verse eid="DEU 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26"/>Naya hayqos gaththiza nagara ooththontta gishshas izo bochchofte; hayssa mala oosoy issi asi genera ba laggeza shemppo wodhizayssara issi gina. <verse eid="DEU 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27"/>Hessika he addezi hara asas giigetta uttida geela7oya ba diza katamappe karen dishin demmidi izo oykkida gishshassinne iza waassidaakkoka izo ashshana asi baynda gishshassa.<verse eid="DEU 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28"/>Ay asikka hara asara giigettontta geela7oyra zin7ishe oykettiko, <verse eid="DEU 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29"/>nay aawaas ichchash tammu saqile bira qanxxidi izo baas machcho histto; wolqqan izira zin7ida gishshas hayqqana gakkanaaska izo anjji yeddanaas dandayenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:28-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:16-17">Kessa 22:16-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30"/>Oonikka ba aawa machcho ekkidi woykko izira zin7idi ba aawa yeellasoppo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:8">Lewe 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:11">20:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:20">Zaare 27:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Asaara Diza Issifeteththafe Shaakkiza Hanota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1"/>Sangettida asi woykko qaaratettida asi GODAA dere duulatan beettofo.<verse eid="DEU 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2"/>Laggeththon yelettidaynne iza zereththi biidi tammanththo gakkanaas GODAA asa shiiqon geloppo.<verse eid="DEU 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3"/>Amoonenne Mo7aabe zereththati wurikka tammanththa yeleta gakkanaas GODAA asaa duulatan geloppetto. <verse eid="DEU 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4"/>Gaasoykka intte Gibxeppe kezidi yishin istti inttena kaththinne haath diggida; qasse Mesphexoomiya biittan Patoore katamaan diza Bi7oore naa Balaamey inttena qanggana mala miishshan shammida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-6">Tay 22:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5"/>Gido attiin GODAA intte Xoossay inttena siiqiza gishshas Balaamey qanggiza qanggeththaa siyibeenna; izi qanggida qanggeththaa anjjon laammides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:1-2">Nahi 13:1-2</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:7-24:9">Tay 23:7—24:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6"/>He dere asati duretidi saron daana mala istta maaddofte.<verse eid="DEU 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7"/>Istti inttes dabbo gidida gishshas Eedoome asaa kadhidi ixxofte; qasse intte Gibxe biittan kase bete gididi de7ida gishshas Gibxe asatakka ixxofte. <verse eid="DEU 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8"/>Istta zereththi heedzdzanththo yeletappe doommidi GODAA asaa shiiqon walakettana dandayees.<verse eid="DEU 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ola Asay Dunkaani Uttidaso Geeshshateththan Naago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9"/>Intte olas kezidi dunkaani uttidasohon inttena tunisiza miishshafe naagettite. <verse eid="DEU 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10"/>Issi asi omars agumora maallay iza bolla gukkiko asi diza heeraappe haraso biidi heen takko. <verse eid="DEU 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11"/>Omarsa wode ba bolla meecettidi arshey wullishin kase ba dizaso simmo.<verse eid="DEU 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12"/>Sheesh uttizaso intte dizaso heerappe karen giigsite. <verse eid="DEU 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13"/>Intte sheesh uttanaaso bookkanaassinne biitta zaari kammanaas go7iza miish intte ola massarara gaththi issife oykkite. <verse eid="DEU 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14"/>Gaasoykka GODAA intte Xoossay inttena naaganaassinne intte morkketa intte kushen aaththi immanaas intte guta giddon hemetettiza gishshas iza shaattiza miish be7idi guye simmontta mala intte diza heeray geesh gidana bessees.<verse eid="DEU 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dumma Dumma Wogata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15"/>Ba godaappe baqatidi neekko yida aylle zaarada iza godaas immofa. <verse eid="DEU 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16"/>Izi intte katamatappe ba koyidason inttenara de7o; iza un7eththofte.<verse eid="DEU 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17"/>Isra7eele asaappe ooninne attuma gidiin woykko macca gidiin eeqa xoossatas goynnizayti ooththizayssa mala laymatopite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:29">Lewe 19:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18"/>GODAA intte Xoossay layma ixxiza gishshas adde gidiin woykko maccassi laymateththan demmida miish adina gaso giidi GODAA intte Xoossa keeth ehopetto.<verse eid="DEU 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19"/>Ne zare gidida Isra7eele asaas miishshe, kath woykko hara miish tal7ada zaarashe dich ekkofa. <verse eid="DEU 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20"/>Hara biitta asaappe dichcha ekkanaas dandayaasa; gido attiin ne bagga gidida Isra7eele asaas dichchas tal7ofa; histtiko ne baada laattana biittayn GODAA ne Xoossay nena ubba baggarakka anjjana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:19-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:25">Kessa 22:25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:36-37">Lewe 25:36-37</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:7-11">Zaare 15:7-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21"/>GODAA ne Xoossaas ne immana gaada adinettida miish gaththanaas gam7ofa; ne gida qaalaa ne polana mala GODAA ne Xoossi koyees; ne adinettida qaala gaththontta ixxiko hessi nees nagara gidees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 30:1-16">Tay 30:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:33">Mato 5:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22"/>GODAA ne Xoossaas ne immana gaada adinettontta aggiko hessi nees nagara gidenna. <verse eid="DEU 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23"/>Gido attiin GODAA ne Xoossas ne dosan immana gaada ne gelida mala ne inxarsafe kezidayssa pola.<verse eid="DEU 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24"/>Asi tokkida woyne miththa giddora kanththa bashe ne koyida keena izappe maanaas dandayaasa; gido attiin ay miishshankka yeggada neso efoppa. <verse eid="DEU 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25"/>Asa kaththa giddora aadhdha bashe tiyappe xupha maana dandayaasa; gido attiin maxa ekkada neso booppa.<verse eid="DEU 23:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Machcho Anjji Yeddidi Hara Eko Gishshas Imettida Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1"/>Issi asi machcho ekki simmidaappe guye izi bolla issi iita miish demmidi izo ixxiko izo anjji yeddishe izis waraqata xaafi immidi yeddo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mato 5:31</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:7">19:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:4">Mar 10:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2"/>Izasoppe kezada hara azina gelikko, <verse eid="DEU 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3"/>he nam7anththo azinaykka izo dosontta ixxidi izis waraqata xaafi immidi ba sooppe izo kessi yeddiko, woykko izo ekkida he nam7anththo azinazi hayqqiko; <verse eid="DEU 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4"/>iza tunida gishshas koyro anjji yeddida azinazi nam7anththo izo zaaridi ekkofo; hessi GODAA matan ixettidayssa; qasse intteka GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immida biittan hayssa mala nagara ooththofte.<verse eid="DEU 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dumma Dumma Wogata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5"/>Mata wode machcho ekkida asi olas booppo; hara deexo oosokka iza oosisopite. Issi layththi aadhdhana gakkanaas bason gam7idi bananne ba ekkida machchiyo ufaysso.<verse eid="DEU 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6"/>Neni issaades miishshe tal7e tal7ashe kath gaacciza woxa woykko woxa mayde izappe oyththo ekkofa. Hessaththo oosoy asa shemppo oysora gina.<verse eid="DEU 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7"/>Ba isha gidida Isra7eele asaa garsafe dhanka barsi efidi baas aylle ooththizay woykko hara asas aylleteththas aaththi bayzizaadey oonikka hayqo. Hessaththo histtidi iita ooso intte giddofe diggite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:16">Kessa 21:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8"/>Issaafe issaan aadhdhiza galba hargefe keehi naagettite; tani istta azazida mala Lewe qommo gidida qeeseti inttes immiza wogata lo7eththi naagite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 13:1-14">Lewe 13:1-14</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 13:54">54</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9"/>Intte Gibxeppe kezi yishin GODAA intte Xoossi Maarami bolla ooththidayssa yuushshi qopite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:10">Tay 12:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10"/>Neni issaades issi miishshe tal7e immashe izi nena oyththiza miish ekkanaas izaade soo geloppa. <verse eid="DEU 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11"/>Neni karen dishin izaadey ba kushera nees oyso eho. <verse eid="DEU 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12"/>Izaadey manqo gidikko ne oyso ekkada iza afala ne soon ayssofa. <verse eid="DEU 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13"/>Izi may7i aqana mala arshey wullontta dishin izas zaara; izikka nena galatana; hessi nees GODAA ne Xoossaa achchan xilloteththan qoodettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:10-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:26-27">Kessa 22:26-27</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14"/>Ne bagga gidida Isra7eele asaappe gidiin woykko hara dereppe bete yiidi metotida manqo asi nees ooththiko, izaade wolqqa coo mela nees go7ettofa. <verse eid="DEU 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15"/>Izi hach ooththidayssa hach ekkanaas minththi koyza gishshas arshey wullontta dishin qanxxa; histtontta aggiko metotanchchay neeppe dendoyssan GODAAS waassiko nees nagara gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lewe 19:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16"/>Nayti moorida mooron yelidayti, qasse yelidayti moorida mooron istta nayti hayqon qaxxayettanaas bessenna; issoy issoy ba moorida mooroza gishshas hayqon qaxxayetto.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:6">2Kawo 14:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 25:4">2Taari 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:20">Hizi 18:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17"/>Hara biitta asatassinne yi7o naytas pirda geellasoppa; am7ey may7o iza tal7e ekkida miishsha gishshas gaada oyso ekkofa.<verse eid="DEU 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18"/>Kase intte Gibxe biittan aylleteththan de7idayssanne intte GODAA Xoossay inttena wozzi kessidayssa yuushshi qopite; tanikka hayta ha azazota inttes immizay hessassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:9">Kessa 23:9</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:33-34">Lewe 19:33-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:19">Zaare 27:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19"/>Neni maxida kaththaa shiishshiin baletti guye attida mirqqey diikko iza ekkanaas guye simmofa; hessa hara biittafe yida bete asatas, yi7otassinne am7etas heen aggaaga. Ne hessaththo ooththiko ne ooththiza ooso ubbaan GODAA ne Xoossay nena anjjana. <verse eid="DEU 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20"/>Neni wogara miththa ayfe issito maxidaappe guye geedon attidayssa ekkanaas nam7anththo guye simmofa. Hessa hara biittafe bete yidaytas, yi7o naytassinne am7etas aggaaga. <verse eid="DEU 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21"/>Neni woyne miththa ayfe issito maxidaappe guye geedon attidayssa ekkanaas nam7anththo guye simmofa; hessa hara biittafe bete yidaytas, yi7o naytassinne am7etas aggaaga.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:19-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:9-10">Lewe 19:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:22">23:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22"/>Nekka kase Gibxe biittan aylle gididayssa baloppa; tanikka hayta ha azazota inttes immizay hessassa.<verse eid="DEU 24:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1"/>Nam7u asati ba garsan palamettidi pirdaso biikko qohettidayssa ne xillo; qohidayssa, «Ne wordo» giidi pirdizayti pirdetto. <verse eid="DEU 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2"/>Qohidayssi garafetti qaxxayettanaas bessizaa gidikko pirdizayti izi zaqullidi garafettana mala azazetto; hessafe guye mooranchchay pirdizayta sinththan ba mooro keena garafetto. <verse eid="DEU 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3"/>Izi oyddu tammuto shocetto attiin hessafe aadho shocettanaas bessenna; hessafe bollara garafettiko ne ishazi ne sinththan kawuyana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:24">2Qoro 11:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4"/>Kath booran bukkashe bukkiza boora doona qachchofa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:9">1Qoro 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Xim 5:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Naa Yelontta Hayqqida Ishaas Ooththana Bessiza Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5"/>Issife de7iza ishanttafe issoy naa yelontta hayqqiko iza machcha kare baada allaga as geluppu; izi azinaa ishay izo laattidi izis koshshiza ubbaa kunththo. <verse eid="DEU 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6"/>Qasseka isttafe yelettida koyro nay Isra7eele biittan hayqqidaade sunththay dhayontta mala kase hayqqida ishaas naa gido.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:5-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:24">Mato 22:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:19">Mar 12:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:28">Luqa 20:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7"/>Gido attiin izi ba ishaa machcheyo ayssanaas koyontta aggiko iza katama pengen uttida cimataakko baada, «Ta azinaa ishay ba ishaa sunththi Isra7eelen de7ana mala koyibeenna; tana ekkike giidi taas koshshiza miish kunththontta ixxides» gaada magannu. <verse eid="DEU 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8"/>Hessafe guye he katamayo kaaleththiza cimati addeza baakko xeygidi iza oychchetto. Izi ha7ikka maccassayo ekkontta ixxiko, <verse eid="DEU 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9"/>he hayqqidayssa machcheya he katamayo kaaleththiza cimata sinththi shiiqada he addeza tohoppe issi caamma shoddada iza ayfeson cuch cuttada, «Ba ishaas zereththi de7ana mala koyontta asa bolla hayssa mala kawushshateththi gakkanaas bessees» gu.<verse eid="DEU 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10"/>He addeza zarey Isra7eele asaa giddon, «Iza tohoppe caammay shodettidaade soo asata» geetetti kawushshan xeygettishe de7ana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:7-8">Uru 4:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hara Azazota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11"/>Nam7u asati wadhettishin isttafe issaa machcheya yaada ba azina ashshanaas ba kushe yeddada hankkoyssa attumateththa oykkiko, <verse eid="DEU 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12"/>he maccassay kushey maaroy baynda qanxxetto.<verse eid="DEU 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13"/>As baleththanaas gitanne guth gidida nam7u qommo geeddara miishshi ne matan dooppo. <verse eid="DEU 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14"/>As baleththanaas adussenne qaanth gidida nam7u qommo wadha miishshi ne soon dooppo. <verse eid="DEU 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15"/>GODAA ne Xoossay nees immana biittayn neni adussa wode de7ana mala ammanththizanne likke gidida geeddara miishshinne wadha miishshi nees do. <verse eid="DEU 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16"/>Geeddara miishshaninne wadha miishshan wordora as baleththiza asata ubbaa GODAA ne Xoossay ixxees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:13-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:35-36">Lewe 19:35-36</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amaaleeqeta Wodhanaas Imettida Azazota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17"/>Intte Gibxe biittafe kezi bishin Amaaleeqe asay intte bolla gaththida qohoza balopite. <verse eid="DEU 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18"/>Istti Xoossas yayyontta asa; intte ogen inttenara eqettida; intte hemettishin daaburdi guye attida asaa ubbaa wodhida. <verse eid="DEU 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19"/>Hessa gishshas GODAA intte Xoossay he biittayo inttena laatissidi inttena yuuyi aadhdhida intte morkketa ubbaafe shempisiza wode asi istta biitta bolla zaari qoppontta mala Amaaleeqe asaa wursa dhayssa; hessa mulekka baloppa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:17-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:8-14">Kessa 17:8-14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:2-9">1Same 15:2-9</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 25:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Asraatanne Xeera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1"/>GODAA ne Xoossay nena laatissana biittayo ne gela uttiza wode, <verse eid="DEU 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2"/>GODAA ne Xoossay nees immiza biittan mokkida kath ubbaafe xeera keeshera GODAA ne Xoossay ba sunththi hessan xeygettana mala dooridaso ekka ba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:19">Kessa 23:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3"/>Histtada he woden aawateththan ooththiza qeesezakko baada, «GODAA ne Xoossay nuus immana giidi kase nu aawatas caaqqida biittayo ta gelidayssa ne GODAA sinththan hach markkattays» ga.<verse eid="DEU 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4"/>Qeesezikka kaththara diza keesheza ekkidi GODAA ne Xoossas yarsho shiishshizasozas sinththa baggan woththo. <verse eid="DEU 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5"/>Hessafe guye neni GODAA ne Xoossaa sinththan, «Ta aaway kase coo yuuyi yuuyi diza Aaraame dere asa; izi qoodan guuththa asatara Gibxe wodhdhidi de7ishe heen gita wolqqamanne qoodan cora kawoteth gidides. <verse eid="DEU 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6"/>Gibxe asay gidikko nuus meqeth iitidi nuna un7eththidanne deexo ooso nu bolla caanida. <verse eid="DEU 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7"/>Histtiin nuni GODAA nu aawata Xoossako waassidos; izikka nu waasoza siyidi nu waayeza, nu daaburazanne nuni qohettidayssa be7ides. <verse eid="DEU 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8"/>Histtidi GODAY ba wolqqama qeseninne ba micettida kushen, gita dagaman, malataninne malalisiza ooraththa miish ooththidi Gibxe biittafe nuna kessides. <verse eid="DEU 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9"/>Nuna haa hayssa ehidi hanno maaththinne eessi izin kumida modhdho biittayo laatissides. <verse eid="DEU 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10"/>Hessa gishshas hekko tanikka izi taas immida gaden kaxxida kaththaafe xeera izas ekka yadis» gaada keesheza woththada GODAA ne Xoossaa sinththan hokka goynna. <verse eid="DEU 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11"/>Neessinne ne soo asaas GODAA ne Xoossay immida lo7o miishshaan ufayettidi GODAA galatite; Lewetinne intte giddon de7iza bete asati ubbayka inttenara ufayetetto.<verse eid="DEU 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12"/>Asraata kessiza heedzdzanththo layththan layththan mokkida kath ubbaafe asraata kessa wursidaappe guye ne katamaan de7iza Lewetas, bete asatas, yi7otassinne am7etas ne katamaan istti kalli maana mala imma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 14:28-29">Zaare 14:28-29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13"/>Hessafe guye GODAA ne Xoossaa sinththan, «Ne azazida mala tani tasoppe nees dummatidayssa Lewe qommotas, bete asatas, yi7otassinne am7etas immadis; tani ne azazotappe issinokka menththabeekke; qasse issinokka doga aggabeekke. <verse eid="DEU 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14"/>Asi hayqqiin kayottashe izappe mabeekke; tani geeyontta dashe izappe aykkoka mabeekke; hayqqida asa gishshas shiiqiza yarshoska izappe aykkoka shiishshabeekke. Tani GODAA ta Xoossaas azazettadis; qasse neni tana azazida ubbaa poladis. <verse eid="DEU 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15"/>Neni salon de7iza geeshsha sohoppe haa duge xeella; ne dere Isra7eelenne kase nu aawatas ne immana gaada caaqqida mala nuus immida ha maaththinne eessi goggiza biittayo anjja» ga.<verse eid="DEU 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossas Dummatida Dere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16"/>GODAA ne Xoossaa wogatanne maarata ne naagana mala hekko hach nena azazides; hessa gishshas neni kumeththa shemppofenne kumeththa wozinappe naaga. <verse eid="DEU 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17"/>GODAY nees Xoossaa gididayssa ne iza ogen baanayssa, iza wogaa, iza azazotanne iza maaraa neni polanayssa hach erisadasa. <verse eid="DEU 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18"/>Qasse GODAYKKA ba gelida qaalaa mala neni izas dumma as gididayssa, izas xinxxo gididayssanne neni iza azazo ubbaa naaganayssa erisides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Kessa 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Zaare 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tito 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:9">2Phex 2:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19"/>Neni hessa ooththiko izi medhdhida asa ubbaafe bollara galatan, sunththaninne bonchchon gita kawoteth ooththana; izi gelida caaqo qaalaa mala izas dumma dere ooththanayssa nees erisides.<verse eid="DEU 26:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Lochcha Shuchchata Bolla Xaafettida Xoossa Wogata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1"/>Hessafe guye Musey Isra7eele asaa kaaleththizaytara derezas, «Tani inttes hach immiza azazota ubbaa naagite. <verse eid="DEU 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2"/>Intte Yordaanoose shaafaa pinnidi GODAA intte Xoossay inttes immiza biittayo geliza wode amarda gita shuchchata essidi istta noora tiyite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:30-32">Iya 8:30-32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3"/>Kase GODAA intte aawata Xoossay eessinne maaththi kumida biittayo inttes immanaas caaqqida qaalaa mala he biittayo oykkanaas intte pinnida wode ha woga qaalata lochcha shuchchata bolla xaafte. <verse eid="DEU 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4"/>Intte Yordaanoose shaafaa pinnidi ta inttena hach azazida mala he shuchchata Eebaale zumaa bolla essidi istta bolla noora tiyite. <verse eid="DEU 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5"/>Heen GODAA intte Xoossaas biratay bochchontta shuchchata ekkidi yarsho yarshizaso giigsite. <verse eid="DEU 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6"/>GODAA intte Xoossaas yarsho yarshizaso masettontta shuchchafe ooththidi iza bollan GODAA intte Xoossaas xuugetti shiiqiza yarsho shiishshite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:5-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:25">Kessa 20:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7"/>Issifeteththa yarsho shiishshidi heen GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan ufayettishe miite. <verse eid="DEU 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8"/>He shuchchata bolla Xoossa wogata ubbaa nababettana mala qonccisi xaafte» gi azazides.<verse eid="DEU 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9"/>Museykka Lewe qommotappe qeesetara gididi Isra7eele asaa ubbaas, «Isra7eele asawu tani gizayssa wozinan woththa siya; hekko hach neni GODAA ne Xoossaa dere gidadasa. <verse eid="DEU 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10"/>Hessa gishshas tani nees hach immiza azazotanne wogata ne wursa naagada GODAA ne Xoossaa qaalas azazetta» gides.<verse eid="DEU 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Azazeteth Ixoy Ehiza Qanggeth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11"/>He gallas Musey Isra7eele deraa hizgi azazides, <verse eid="DEU 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12"/>«Intte Yordaanoose pinnidaappe guye dereza anjjanaas Garizaane zumaa bolla eqqanaas bessizayti Simoona, Lewe, Yuhuda, Yisakoore, Yooseefe qommotanne Biniyaame qommota.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:29">Zaare 11:29</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 8:33-35">Iya 8:33-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13"/>Dereza qangganaas Eebaale zumaa bolla eqqanaas bessizayti Oroobeele, Gaade, Aaseere, Zaabiloone, Daane qommotanne Niftaaleme qommota.»<verse eid="DEU 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14"/>Lewe qommoti ba qaala dhoqqu histtidi hayssafe kaalliza qaalaa Isra7eele asa ubbaas getto.<verse eid="DEU 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15"/>«GODAY eeqa xoossatas goyno ixxiza gishshas, miththafe massidi shuchchafe qoxxidinne birata seerisidi eeqa xoos giigsidi geeman goynnizaadey oonikka qanggettidaade gido!»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:4">Kessa 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:17">34:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:4">Lewe 19:4</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 19:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:15-18">Zaare 4:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:8">5:8</ref></char></note>Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.<verse eid="DEU 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16"/>«Ba aawa woykko ba aayo kawushshizaadey qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kessa 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Zaare 5:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17"/>«Dhas shoddizaadey wuri qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:14">Zaare 19:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18"/>«Qooqe as hadirsa oge kaaleththiza ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:14">Lewe 19:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19"/>«Bete asata, yi7o naytanne am7eta pirda geellasi pirdiza ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:21">Kessa 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:9">23:9</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:33-34">Lewe 19:33-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:17-18">Zaare 24:17-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20"/>«Ba aawa machchira zin7idi ba aawa bonchcho kawushshiza ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:8">Lewe 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:11">20:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:30">Zaare 22:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21"/>«Ay meherakka parattizaadey qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.<verse eid="DEU 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22"/>«Ba michcheyra woykko ba aayi nayra woykko ba aawa nayra zin7iza ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin» go.<verse eid="DEU 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23"/>«Ba bolloteyra zin7iza ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin» go.<verse eid="DEU 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24"/>«Geemason zamadi uttidi ase wodhiza ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.<verse eid="DEU 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25"/>«Miishshan shamettidi xillo shemppo wodhiza ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.<verse eid="DEU 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26"/>«Hayta ha woga qaalata naagontta ubbay qanggettidaade gido!» Derezi wurikka, «Amiin!» go.<verse eid="DEU 27:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Azazeteththan Beettiza Anjjo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">Lewe 26:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Zaare 7:12-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1"/>Neni GODAA ne Xoossaas azazettiko hach ta nees immiza azazota ne ubbaa ammanettada naagikko izi nena biitta bolla diza kawoteththata ubbaafe bollara dhoqqu dhoqqu histtana. <verse eid="DEU 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2"/>Neni GODAA ne Xoossaas azazettiko hayssafe kaalliza anjjoti wurikka neyta gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3"/>Neni katamaninne gaxaren anjjettida as gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4"/>Ne nayti, ne biittan diza kaththa ayfey, ne miizati, dorsatinne deyshati ubbay anjjettana.<verse eid="DEU 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5"/>Ne kaththa gootaraynne maadday anjjettana.<verse eid="DEU 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6"/>Neni geladakka kezadakka anjjettana.<verse eid="DEU 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7"/>Ne morkketi ne bolla meto gaththiza wode GODAY istta ne sinththan kundisana; istti ne bolla issi baggara yaana; gido attiin laappun ogera neeppe baqatana.<verse eid="DEU 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8"/>GODAY ne kushey oykkida ubbaanne ne gootara ubbaa anjjana; qasse izi nees immida biittankka nena anjjana.<verse eid="DEU 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9"/>Neni GODAA ne Xoossaas azazettikonne ne iza azazota ubbaa polikko izi nees caaqqida qaalaa mala izi nena baas dumma shaakettida dere histtana. <verse eid="DEU 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10"/>Hessafe guye biitta bolla diza derey wurikka GODAA sunththi nenan xeygettizayssa be7idi nees yayyana. <verse eid="DEU 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11"/>GODAY nees immanaas kase ne aawatas caaqqida biittaa bolla nees daro nayta, daro mehenne keehi daro kath immana.<verse eid="DEU 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12"/>Ne kushe ooso ubbaa anjjanaassinne GODAY ne biittaas ira wodera bukisanaas ba minjja keeththaa, salo penge nees doyana; qasse neni daro kawoteththatas tal7anaappe attiin ooppeka haa tal7e ekkaka. <verse eid="DEU 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13"/>GODAY nena hu7e histtanappe attiin goyna histtenna; hach tani nees immiza ne GODAA azazo siyada hessa neni minththada kaalliko neni ubbaafe bolla gidanaappe attiin garse gidakka. <verse eid="DEU 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14"/>Tani nees hach immida ha azazotappe kare kezada eeqa xoossatas goynnanaassinne isttas ooththanaas bessenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:1-14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:13-17">Zaare 11:13-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Azazettontta Ixoy Ehiza Qanggeth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:14-46">Lewe 26:14-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15"/>Qasse neni GODAA ne Xoossaas azazettontta ixxiko, tani nees immiza wogatanne azazota ne ammanettada naagontta ixxiko hayssafe kaalliza qanggeththati ne bolla gakkananne nena ekki baana.<verse eid="DEU 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16"/>Neni katamaninne gaxaren qanggettidaade gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17"/>Ne kaththa gootaraynne maadday qanggettidaazi gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18"/>Ne nayti, ne biittan diza kaththa ayfey, ne miizati, dorsatinne deyshati ubbay qanggettidaaz gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19"/>Neni geladakka kezadakka qanggettidaade gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20"/>Neni iita ooson GODAA aggida gishshas ne ooththiza ooson ubbaan ne mulera dhayana gakkanaas qanggeth, hirganne kawushshateth GODAY ne bolla ehana. <verse eid="DEU 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21"/>Neni laattanaas gelana biittayfe nena mulera dhayssana gakkanaas neeppe kichchontta iita harge GODAY ne bolla yeddana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:19">Kessa 22:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:15">20:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22"/>GODAY nena gilqateththan, mishoninne qoxon, madunththan, xuuggiza awaninne koshan nena dhayssana; ne kaththaa dhayssanaas kutul7enne lobe ne bolla yeddana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:9">Lewe 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:17">20:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23"/>Neeppe bollara ne ginan de7iza saloy xarqimala gidana; ne biittayka birata mala gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:17">Lewe 18:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:14">20:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24"/>GODAY ne biittan bukkiza iraa buuhenne gudulla kessana; neni biittafe dhayana gakkanaas gudullay saloppe duge bukkana.<verse eid="DEU 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25"/>GODAY ne morkketa sinththan neni xoonettana mala ooththana; neni istta bolla issi ogera baanashin isttafe attanaas laappunasora baqatana; biitta bolla diza kawoteththati ubbay ne bolla gakkizayssa be7idi hirgan kokkorana. <verse eid="DEU 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26"/>Ne ahay salo kafotassinne bazzo do7atas quma gidana; istta gooddana asikka deenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:10">Gala 3:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27"/>GODAY nena paxontta Gibxe dere hargen, kixan, giiyiza madunththaninne puuso hargen shocanna. <verse eid="DEU 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28"/>GODAY nena gooshshan, qooqeteththaninne dagaman yeggana. <verse eid="DEU 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29"/>Gallassa seetan neni qooqey tattafettiza mala tattafettana; ne ooththiza ubbay nees giigontta ixxana; neni ne de7o ubbaan un7etashenne bonqqettashe daana; nena maaddiza asekka demmaka.<verse eid="DEU 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30"/>Neni machcho ekkanaas geela7o giigsana; gido attiin hara asi izo dafi ekkana; ne keeth keexxanashin izan daakka; neni woyne mith tokkanashin iza ayfe go7ettaka. <verse eid="DEU 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31"/>Ne ayfey xeellishin ne mehe hara asi shukkana; gido attiin he ashozappe aykkoka maakka; ne harey neeppe bonqqetti ekettana; gido attiin nees guye simmenna; ne dorsati ne morkkes imettana; hessafe ashshanaas nena maaddanay deenna. <verse eid="DEU 28:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32"/>Ne ayfe sinththan ne attuma naytinne macca nayti hara kawoteththas imettana; istti simmiin be7ana gaada ne xeellishin ne ayfey doljumana; hessa digganaas nees ay wolqqayka deenna. <verse eid="DEU 28:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33"/>Ne biittaa kaththa ayfenne ne daabura kessida ubbaa hara dere asi maana; neni ne de7o ubbaan un7ettidaadenne qohettidaade gidana. <verse eid="DEU 28:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34"/>Neni ayfen be7iza ubbay nena gooshshana. <verse eid="DEU 28:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35"/>GODAY nees toho xugunththafe biidi hu7e binana gakkanaas miza paxontta iita madunththaninne kixan ne suulenne ne wodira shocanna.<verse eid="DEU 28:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36"/>GODAY nenanne neni ne bolla kawosana kawoza ha biittafe denththidi kase neninne ne aawati erontta hara kawoteth efana; intte heen miththafenne shuchchafe oosettida eeqa xoossatas goynnana. <verse eid="DEU 28:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37"/>GODAY neni laaletta biza kawoteththata ubbaa giddon nena qilccas, miichchassinne kadhes kessana.<verse eid="DEU 28:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38"/>Ne gaden ne daro kath zerana shin booley mishin attida guuththa kath shiishshana. <verse eid="DEU 28:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39"/>Neni woyne mith tokkanashin iza ayfeza go7ettaka; gaasoykka guxuney iza maana. <verse eid="DEU 28:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40"/>Ne deren awanka wogara miththi mokkanashin wodey gakkontta dishin ayfe qoqofana; hessa gishshas wogara zaytey nees deenna. <verse eid="DEU 28:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41"/>Neni macca naytanne attuma nayta yelanashin istti olan di7etti biikko ne mela attana. <verse eid="DEU 28:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42"/>Ne gaden diza miththaanne kaththaa ubbaa booley maana.<verse eid="DEU 28:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43"/>Ne wolqqay daaburi daaburi bishin ne deren diza bete asaa wolqqay minni minni baana. <verse eid="DEU 28:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44"/>Ne deren diza bete asay nees tal7e immana attiin ne isttas tal7aka; istti nees hu7e gidana; neni gidikko isttas goyna gidana.<verse eid="DEU 28:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45"/>Neni GODAA ne Xoossas azazettontta ixxida gishshassinne izi nees immida wogatanne azazota neni naagontta ixxida gishshas neni mulera dhayana gakkanaas hayti ha qanggeththati ubbay ne bolla gakkana. <verse eid="DEU 28:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46"/>Ha qanggeththati ubbay Xoossi ne bollanne ne zereththata bolla qixaates yeggida mernaas malaatanne malalisizaaz gidana. <verse eid="DEU 28:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47"/>GODAA ne Xoossay nena daro baggara anjjides; gido attiin ne galatashe ufayssan izas ooththabeekka. <verse eid="DEU 28:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48"/>Hessa gishshas neni gafan, saamon, kalloteththaninne meto ubbaan GODAY ne bolla yeddiza ne morkketas ne haarettana; GODAY nena dhayssana gakkanaas ne morgen birata qambara waaxana.<verse eid="DEU 28:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49"/>GODAY ne istta qaala erontta kawoteth haako dereppe ne bolla ehana; isttika golle kafo mala ne bolla wodhdhana. <verse eid="DEU 28:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50"/>Istti menxe iitata, cimmida asaa bonchchonttaytanne guuththa naytas mishettonttayta gidana. <verse eid="DEU 28:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51"/>Istti ne mehenne ne kath ubbaa pitti mizayta gidida gishshas neni hayqqana gakkanaas koshan waayana; istti ne dhayana gakkanaas ne kaththaafe issi ayfe, ne meheppe guuththa mari, ne dorsafe guuththa laaqqa, woyneppenne wogara miththa ayfeppe qii palakka ashshettenna. <verse eid="DEU 28:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52"/>Ne biittan de7iza neni isttan ammanettiza adussanne mino dirsati ubbasora laalettana gakkanaas ne katamata ubbaa yuushon dooddidi nena un7eththana. GODAA ne Xoossay nees immida biitta ubbaa yuushon dooddi ne miixata dippi histti dhayssana.<verse eid="DEU 28:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53"/>Ne morkketi ne katamata dooddidi nena un7eththiin nees mizaazi dhayiin ne metotiza wode GODAA ne Xoossay nees immida ne uloppe yelettida macca naytanne attuma nayta asho dosay baynda ne maana. <verse eid="DEU 28:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54"/>Ne giddon haray atto kase kiyanne injje duussi dees geetettiza asikka ba ishaas, ba siiqiza machcheyssinne ba yelida naytas qadhettenna. <verse eid="DEU 28:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55"/>Guyen katama dooddidi un7eththida gaason maana miishshi haray baynda gishshas ba miza ba nayta ashoppe haras oonaska immenna. <verse eid="DEU 28:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56"/>Ne giddon kase injjen de7awus geetettidaara ba injje duussafe dendoyssan sa7a yedhdhanaas shaatettiza maccassayakka ba siiqiza azinaassinne ba naytas qadhettuku. <verse eid="DEU 28:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57"/>Morkkey iza de7iza katamaa dooddidi izo un7eththida gishshassinne tuggasida gishshas izis miza miishshi haray aykkoyka deenna; Hessa gishshas iza ba yelida yidhanne do7aa ba siiqiza azinaanne ba nayta gaththontta uuzettada geeman barkka maana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:28-29">2Kawo 6:28-29</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:10">Er Zila 4:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 28:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58"/>Hayssa ha maxaafan xaafettida Xoossa wogaa intte lo7eththi naagontta aggiko qasse malalisizanne yashissiza GODAA intte Xoossa sunththaa intte bonchchontta aggiko, <verse eid="DEU 28:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59"/>GODAY intte bollanne intte nayta bolla babisiza bosha, simmontta bashshinne paxontta deexo harge intte bolla yeggana. <verse eid="DEU 28:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60"/>Neni Gibxe biitta bolla wodhdhiin beyada hirgida he iita hargeza ubbaa izi ne bolla yeddana; nekka he hargezappe paxakka. <verse eid="DEU 28:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61"/>GODAA wogati xaafettida ha maxaafan xaafettontta hara boshata inttena ubbaa wursana gakkanaas intte bolla yeddana. <verse eid="DEU 28:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62"/>GODAA intte Xoossaas intte azazettontta ixxida gishshas salo xoolintte mala darida inttefe guuththati xalla attana. <verse eid="DEU 28:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63"/>GODAY inttena duresanaassinne intte qooda darsanaas dosida mala qasseka inttena guuththishenne biittafe dhayssishe izi ufayettana; intteka laattanaas biza biittayfe shodettana.<verse eid="DEU 28:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64"/>GODAY nena kumeththa alamen diza asaa giddon biittas gaxappe gaxa gakkanaas laallana; heen neninne ne aawati kase goynni erontta miththafenne shuchchafe oosettida eeqa xoossatas intte goynnana. <verse eid="DEU 28:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65"/>He kawoteththata giddon intte woppa demmeketa; intte toho caammay yedhdhiza soho keena gadeykka inttes deenna; hessan GODAY inttes meto qofan xalla kumida hu7e, amon xalla daaburda ayfenne hidota qanxxiza wozina immana. <verse eid="DEU 28:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66"/>Inttes duussay ubba wode waaye xalla gidana; duussay ammanththontta gishshas intte qammanne gallas hirgishe daana. <verse eid="DEU 28:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67"/>Intte wozinan kumida hirgafenne intte ayfen be7iza palappe dendidayssan gadey wontishin intte, «Ayde qammaneesha!» qasse gadey qammishin, «Ayde wonttaneesha!» gaana. <verse eid="DEU 28:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68"/>Tani inttena, «Nam7anththo ha ogezara beekketa» gida ogezara GODAY inttena zaaridi markaben guye Gibxe yeddana. Heen intte aylle gidanaas intte morkketas inttena bayzanaas koyana; gido attiin inttena ayllesanaas shammiza as demmeketa.<verse eid="DEU 28:68"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Goday Isra7eele Asaara Mo7aabe Deren Gelida Caaqo Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1"/>GODAY Koreben Isra7eele asaara caaqettida caaqo qaalappe hara Mo7aabe deren nam7anththo caaqettanaas Muse azazida caaqo qaalati hayssafe kaallizayta.<verse eid="DEU 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2"/>Musey Isra7eele asaa ubbaa xeygidi, GODAY Gibxe kawo bolla, iza shuumeta bollanne ubba deraa bolla izi ooththidayssa, <verse eid="DEU 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3"/>he iita metota, gita malaatatanne malalisiza miishshata intte intte ayfera be7ideta. <verse eid="DEU 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4"/>Gido attiin hach gakkanaas GODAY inttes akeekiza wozina, xeelliza ayfenne siyiza hayth immibeenna. <verse eid="DEU 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5"/>Tani inttena oyddu tammu layth kumeth bazzon kaaleththishin intte may7oy ceeggibeenna; intte tohon aaththida caammayka wuribeenna. <verse eid="DEU 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6"/>Intte uketh mibeekketa; woyne ushshu gidiin woykko maththosiza ushshu uyibeekketa. Tani hessaththo ooththiday tani GODAA intte Xoossay intte Xoossa gididayssa intte eranaassa.<verse eid="DEU 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7"/>Intte hayssa haa gakkida mala Haseboone kawo Sihooneynne Baasaane kawo Aagey nuna olanaas yiin nuni istta xoonidos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Tay 21:21-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8"/>Nuni istta biittaa nuus ekkidos; Oroobeele qommotas Gaade qommotassinne Minaase qommotappe baggaytas shaakki shaakki isttas xinxxo gidana mala immidos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Tay 32:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9"/>Hessa gishshas intte ooththiza ooso ubbay inttes anjjettana mala hayta caaqo qaalata ubbaa minni kaallite. <verse eid="DEU 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10"/>Intte ubbati, inttena kaaleththizaytinne intte halaqati, intte cimatinne intte shuumeti, hessaththoka hankko Isra7eele asay ubbayka intte hach GODAA intte Xoossaa sunththan eqqideta. <verse eid="DEU 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11"/>Intte naytinne intte machcheti inttes mith qanxxishenne haaththe duuqqishe inttenara diza bete asatara issife eqqideta. <verse eid="DEU 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12"/>GODAA intte Xoossaara intte caaqettida qaalaza minththanaas hach hayssan shiiqideta. <verse eid="DEU 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13"/>Xoossi inttena hach ba dere histti minththana; inttessinne beni intte aawatas, Abrahaames, Yisaaqassinne Yaaqoobes gelida caaqo qaalaa mala izi inttes Xoos gidana. <verse eid="DEU 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14"/>Tani hayssa caaqo qaala geliday inttenara xalla gidenna. <verse eid="DEU 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15"/>GODAA nu Xoossay hayssa ha caaqo qaala gelizay iza sunththan eqqida nunara xalla gidontta hach hayssan dontta buro yaana yeleta ubbaassara caaqqees.<verse eid="DEU 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16"/>Nuni Gibxen waani de7idaakkonne nu hayssa haa yishe issi issi kawoteththara waani kanththi yidaakko intte ubbayka hessa ereeta. <verse eid="DEU 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17"/>Istta giddon diza harassiza miishshata miththafe, shuchchafe, birappenne worqqafe oosettida eeqa xoossata intte be7ideta. <verse eid="DEU 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18"/>Ha inttefe ooninne attuma gidiin woykko macca gidiin issi keeththa as gidiin woykko qommo gidiin GODAA nu Xoossaafe sher7i giidi hara kawoteththata xoossatas goynnontta mala naagettite; intte garsan hessa mala camonne marze gidida miish ooththiza asi doontta mala naagettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:15">Ib 12:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19"/>Ha caaqo qaalaa siyidi ba wozinan, «Tani ta shene mala diikkoka taas saroy dees» giidi bana cimmiko hessa mala asi lo7ota bollanne iitata bolla bash ehana. <verse eid="DEU 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20"/>Hessa mala as GODAY mulekka maarenna; GODAA hanqoy izaade bolla tama mala eexxana; hayssa ha maxaafan xaafettida qanggeththi izaade bolla wodhdhana; salo garsafe iza sunththaa GODAY dhayssana. <verse eid="DEU 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21"/>Hayssa wogaa maxaafan xaafettida qanggeththa qaalaa mala GODAY izaade Isra7eele asaa ubbaa garsafe dumma shaakki dhayssana.<verse eid="DEU 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22"/>Sinththafe yaana yeletay, intte zareynne haaho dereppe yaana hara biitta asay GODAY intte bolla ehida boshaanne metoza be7ana. <verse eid="DEU 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23"/>He Biittaya mulera xuugettida maxinenne diine geetettiza Bidinth gidana; issi miishshika izin tokettenna; ay miishshika izin mokkenna; izin pude dicciza miishshi beettenna; izi bolla gakkana kundeththi GODAY keehi shenetidi mulera dhayssida Sodoome malanne Gamoora mala, Adaama malanne Xaboyme mala gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-25">Medhe 19:24-25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24"/>Kawoteththati ubbay, «GODAY ha biitta bolla hayssa aazas gaththidee? Ha wolqqama hanqozas gaaso gididay aazee?» gi oychchana.<verse eid="DEU 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25"/>Asay izas zaaridi, «Kase istta aawata Xoossay istta Gibxe dereppe kessida wode isttara paacetti caaqoza asay aggida gishshassa. <verse eid="DEU 29:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26"/>Qasse istti biidi kase ba erontta xoossatassinne izi isttas goynnofte gida eeqa xoossatas goynnida. <verse eid="DEU 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27"/>Hessa gishshas GODAY hanqettidi ha maxaafan xaafettida qanggeth ubbaa istta bolla ehides. <verse eid="DEU 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28"/>GODAY wolqqama hanqoninne iita boshan istta istta dereppe shoddides; hessa gishshas istti hach gakkanaas heen deettes» gaana. <verse eid="DEU 29:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29"/>Xuura yo7oti GODAA nu Xoossassa; gido attiin nuni ha woga qaalaa naagana mala qonccida yo7oti mernaas nuussinne nu naytassa.<verse eid="DEU 29:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossako Simon Beettiza Anjjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1"/>Nam7atappe issaa intte doorana mala hach ta intte sinththan anjjonne qanggeth woththadis; GODAA intte Xoossay inttena kawoteththata giddon dishe intte iza yuushshi qoppiza wode, <verse eid="DEU 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2"/>Intteninne intte nayti GODAA intte Xoossako simmidi kumeththa wozinappenne kumeththa shemppofe tani hach inttena azazida qaalaas azazettiko, <verse eid="DEU 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttes qadhettananne inttefe di7ettida intte miishshaa inttes zaarana; intte kase laaletti diza dereppe zaari ehidi qasseka duresana. <verse eid="DEU 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4"/>Intte biitta gaxa gakkanaas laalettikokka heeppe GODAA intte Xoossay inttena issi bolla shiishshidi zaari ehana. <verse eid="DEU 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5"/>Hessaththo hanidi kase intte aawata biittaa intte zaari laattana; izikka inttena kase intte aawatappe aaththi duresananne intte qooda darsana. <verse eid="DEU 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6"/>Intte de7on daana malanne GODAA intte Xoossaa intte kumeththa wozinappenne kumeththa shemppofe siiqana mala izi inttessinne intte naytas azazettiza wozina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:6 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Azazettiza wozina: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Azazettiza wozina gizayssa issi issi Geeshsha maxaafati qaxxarettida wozina geettes.</char></note> immana. <verse eid="DEU 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7"/>GODAA intte Xoossay hayta ha qanggeththata ubbaa intte morkketa bollanne inttena ixxizayta bolla zaarana. <verse eid="DEU 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8"/>Intteka zaaridi intte GODAAS azazettana; ta inttes hach immiza iza azazota intte naagandeta. <verse eid="DEU 30:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9"/>Hessafe guye intte ooththiza ooso ubbaan GODAA intte Xoossay inttena duresana; izi inttes nayta, mehe, kaththinne miththa ayfe darsana; GODAA intte Xoossay kase intte aawata duresidi ufayettida mala inttenakka duresidi ufayettana. <verse eid="DEU 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10"/>Izi hessaththo ooththanaykka hayssa woga maxaafaan xaafettida azazotanne wogata intte kumeththa wozinappenne kumeththa shemppofe naagidi GODAA intte Xoossaako intte simmikonna.<verse eid="DEU 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hayqoppenne De7oppe Issaa Dooro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11"/>Tani hach inttes immiza azazoy keehi deexo woykko inttefe haakkidaaz gidenna. <verse eid="DEU 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12"/>«Nuni iza siyidi azazettana mala pude salo bi ehidi nuus yootanay oonee?» giidi intte oychchontta mala hayssi wogazi bolla saloppe beettenna. <verse eid="DEU 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13"/>«Nuni iza siyidi azazettana mala abba pinni bi ehidi nuus yootanay oonee?» giidi intte oychchontta mala izi abba pinththafe beettenna. <verse eid="DEU 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14"/>Iza qaalay intte matan dees; intte iza naagana mala izi intte doonaninne intte wozinan dees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:12-14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:6-8">Oro 10:6-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15"/>Neni doorana mala tani hach nees de7onne lo7eteth, woykko hayqonne bash ne sinththan woththadis. <verse eid="DEU 30:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16"/>GODAA intte Xoossaa siiqana mala, iza ogen hemettana malanne iza azazota, maaratanne iza wogata naagana mala, tani hach inttes immiza GODAA intte Xoossaa azazota intte naagikko intte shemppora paxa de7ananne corattana; qasse intte laattanaas geliza biittan GODAA intte Xoossay inttena anjjana.<verse eid="DEU 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17"/>Gido attiin intte intte wozina Xoossafe haassidi iza qaala siyontta ixxiko, hara eeqa xoossatas goynnikonne isttas ooththiko, <verse eid="DEU 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18"/>intte mulera dhayanayssa hach ta inttes yootays; intte Yordaanoose shaafa pinnidi laattana biittayn daro layth gam7eketa.<verse eid="DEU 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19"/>Tani intte sinththan de7onne hayqo, anjjonne qanggeth woththidayssas hach salonne sa7aa intte bolla markkasays; hessa gishshas intteninne intte zareti de7on de7ana mala de7o doorite. <verse eid="DEU 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20"/>GODAA intte Xoossaa siiqite; iza qaala siyite; izakko shiphi giite; hessaththo hanikko GODAY kase intte aawatas, Abrahaames, Yisaaqassinne Yaaqoobes immanaas caaqqida biittan intteninne intte nayti adussa layth de7ana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Medhe 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:13">28:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 30:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyaasoy Muse Sohon Doorettides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1"/>Musey hayssa qaala ubbaa Isra7eele asaas yootidaappe guye, <verse eid="DEU 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2"/>isttas, «Hekko ha7i taas 120 layth gidida gishshas hayssafe guyen ta inttena kaaleththanaas dandaykke; hessafekka bollara tani Yordaanoose shaafaa pinnontta mala GODAY taas yooti woththides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:12">Tay 20:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3"/>GODAA intte Xoossay inttefe sinththara bishe inttena kaaleththana; heen diza kawoteththata ubbaa izi dhayssiin intte istta biitta laattana; GODAY yootida mala Iyaasoy inttena kaaleththana. <verse eid="DEU 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4"/>GODAY Amoore dere kawota Sihoonenne Aage xoonidi istta biittaa dhayssida mala istta bollaka hessaththo ooththana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Tay 21:21-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5"/>GODAY istta inttes aaththi immana; inttenikka ta inttena azazida mala istta bolla ooththana. <verse eid="DEU 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6"/>Inttes murttateththinne xalateththi de7o; isttas mulekka babboftenne dagammofte; GODAA intte Xoossay inttenara dees; izi inttena yeggi aggenna» gides.<verse eid="DEU 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7"/>Hessafe guye Musey Iyaaso baakko xeygidi kumeththa Isra7eele asaa sinththan, «Minna; babbofa; GODAY kase istta aawata laatissana giidi caaqqida biittayo laattana mala dereza kaaleththa gelththada laatisanay nena. <verse eid="DEU 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8"/>GODAY nenara gididi izi nena kaaleththana; izi nena yeggenna; mulekka aggenna; hessa gishshas babbofa; hidotakka qanxxofa» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:5">Iya 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:5">Ib 13:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wogay Nababettanaas Bessiza Layththata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9"/>Hessafe guye Musey woga xaafidi Caaqo Qaala Taabotaa tookkiza qeese gidida Lewe naytassinne Isra7eele cimata ubbaas immides. <verse eid="DEU 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10"/>Museykka isttas, «Aco ubbaa maariza laappunththa layththan wurseththa bolla bonchchettiza daase ba7aalezan,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:1">Zaare 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13-15">16:13-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11"/>GODAA intte Xoossaa sinththan izi kase dooridason izas goynnanaas Isra7eele asay ubbay shiiqiza wode hayssa wogaza istta sinththan nababite. <verse eid="DEU 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12"/>Istti ubbayka hessa siyidi GODAA intte Xoossaas yashshateth taamarana malanne hayssa wogaa qaalata ubbaa lo7eththi naagana mala maccassata, addeta, naytanne intte deren diza bete asata ubbaa issi bolla shiishshite. <verse eid="DEU 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13"/>Hessa malan GODAA intte Xoossaa woga kase siyi erontta intte zereththati ubbayka siyetto; qasse intte Yordaanoose shaafa pinnidi laattana biittan diza wode ubbaan istti Xoossas azazeteth tamaaretto» gi azazides.<verse eid="DEU 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musessinne Iyaasos Immida Wogata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14"/>Hessafe guye Xoossay Muses, «Nees hayqo wodey gakkides; izi kaallana wogata izas ta immana mala Iyaaso xeygada izara gede Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezakko shiiqite» gides. Museynne Iyaasoy issife gede Gaytoteththa dunkaanezakko shiiqida.<verse eid="DEU 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15"/>GODAYKKA isttas Dunkaaneza pengen tuussa mala eqqida shaaran qonccides. <verse eid="DEU 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16"/>GODAY Muses, «Neni mata wode hayqqada ne aawatan gayttana; hessafe guye hayssi asazi ta izara caaqettida qaalaa laallana; istti tana aggaagidi layma maccassa mala he istti laattana biittaan diza eeqa xoossatas goynnana. <verse eid="DEU 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17"/>Hessaththo haniza wode tani istta bolla hanqettada isttafe shaakettana; ta isttas zokko zaarana; isttika ubbay dhayana; istta bolla iita metoynne boshay yaana; he wode isttas, ‹Hayssi metozi nu bolla gakkiday nu Xoossay nu giddon dontta aggiin gidennee?› gaana. <verse eid="DEU 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18"/>Istti eeqa xoossatas goynnidi istti ooththida nagara gishshas tani he wode isttas zokko zaarana.<verse eid="DEU 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19"/>«Hayssa yeththaa xaafada Isra7eele asaa tamaarsada isttika yexxana mala ooththa; hayssi yeththazi istta bolla taas markka gidana. <verse eid="DEU 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20"/>Tani beni istta aawatas caaqqida caaqo qaalaa mala eessinne maaththi kumida biittayo ta istta gelththana; istti heen miidinne uyidi kallidaappenne durettidaappe guye tana yeggi aggana; ta caaqo qaalaakka yeggi aggidi eeqa xoossatas goynnana. <verse eid="DEU 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21"/>Daro metoynne bashshi istta bolla gakkiza wode ha yeththay istta nayta doonappe kichchenna gishshas istta bolla markka gidana. Gaasoykka tani caaqqida biittaa istta buro gelththontta dashe haarakka istti qoppiza qofaa eraychchadis» gides.<verse eid="DEU 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22"/>Musey he gallas yeththaza xaafidi Isra7eele asaa tamaarsides.<verse eid="DEU 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23"/>Hessafe guye Xoossay Nawe naa Iyaaso, «Minna; xala gida; neni Isra7eele asaa kaaleththada ta kase isttas immana ga caaqqida biittayo gelththana; tanikka nenara gidana» gi azazides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:23">Tay 27:23</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:6">Iya 1:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24"/>Museykka hayssa wogaa qaalata koyroppe biidi wurseth gakkanaas ubbaa xaafidaappe guyen; <verse eid="DEU 31:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25"/>GODAA Caaqo Qaala Taabotaa tookkiza Lewe qommota hizgi azazides; <verse eid="DEU 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26"/>«GODAA wogay izan xaafettida maxaafaa ekkidi GODAA intte Xoossaa Caaqo Qaala Taabotaza achchan woththite; heen izi ba dizason dishe dereza bolla markka gidana. <verse eid="DEU 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27"/>Isra7eele asay ay mala makkallanchchakonne wozina muumekko ta erays; tani shemppora paxa isttara dishin istti GODAA bolla makkallizayti tani hayqqidaappe guye keehi makkallanchchata gidana. <verse eid="DEU 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28"/>Hessa gishshas ta isttas hayssa ubbaa yootana mala korapinnetanne dere halaqata taas shiishshite; tani istta bolla salonne sa7a markka gidana mala xeygana. <verse eid="DEU 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29"/>Tani hayqqidaappe guye ta inttena azazida azazoppe kare kezidi tuna ooso intte ooththanayssa ta erays; GODAA sinththan iita ooso ooththidi intte iza hanqeththiko izi intte bolla bosha yeddana.»<verse eid="DEU 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muse Yeththa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30"/>Hessafe guye Musey kumeththa Isra7eele asaa sinththan hayta mazamure qaalata koyroppe biidi wurseth gakkanaas yootides.<verse eid="DEU 31:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1"/>Salotoo! Tani yootizayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:1">ezgi siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:1">Sa7azoo ta doonappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:1">keziza qaala siya.<verse eid="DEU 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2"/>Ta immiza timirtey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">ira mala bukko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">ta haasayaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">xaaza mala xoketto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">maata bolla loddi gi bukkiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">ira mala bukko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">kaththa caarechcha bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">puuse mala wodhdho.<verse eid="DEU 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3"/>Tani GODAA sunth awajjays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:3">nu Xoossaa gitateth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:3">intte yootite.<verse eid="DEU 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4"/>«Izi nuus miixa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">iza oosotikka kumeththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">Iza ogeti wurikka suure;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">izi balettontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">ammanettida Xoossa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">izi suurenne xillo Xoossa.<verse eid="DEU 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5"/>«Istti iza sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">iita ooththida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">istti bantta iitateththaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">dendidayssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">hayssafe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">iza nayta gidettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">istti bokkanne geella yeletata.<verse eid="DEU 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6"/>«Intteno eeyatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">Qasseka wozinay bayndaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">Intte GODAAS</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">immiza zaaroy hayssee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">Inttena medhdhida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">intte aaway iza gidennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">Inttena medhdhidi hayssas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">gaththiday iza gidennee?<verse eid="DEU 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7"/>«Kase beni wodeza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">yuushshi qoppite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">daro yeletata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">layththaaka akeekite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">Intte aawata oychchite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">istti inttes yootana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">kase cimatakka oychchite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">istti inttes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">qonccisi yootana.<verse eid="DEU 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8"/>«Ubbaafe Dhoqqa Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">kawoteththatas biitta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">gishechchida wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">asa nayta istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">zaren zaren shaakkida wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">Isra7eele asaa qooda keena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">kawoteththatas dhas woththides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:26">Hawa 17:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9"/>«Isra7eeley GODAAS gisha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:9">Yaaqoobeykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:9">izas buzo miishsha.<verse eid="DEU 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10"/>«Aykkoyka baynda bazzon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">carkoy punniza biittaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">iza demmides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">izas gondalle gidides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">ba ayfe ciro mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">iza naagides.<verse eid="DEU 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11"/>Golle kafoy ba ciyeta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">piradho tamaarsiza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">ba qefe miccada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">gakka oykka ashshiza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">GODAY ba qefen haphphidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">istta ashshides.<verse eid="DEU 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12"/>Hara eeqa xoossati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:12">izara baynda GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:12">iza barkka kaaleththides.<verse eid="DEU 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13"/>«Dhoqqa sohon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">iza woththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">biittafe mokkida kaththa ayfe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">iza mizides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">zaallafe beettida ees ushshides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">shuchcha biittan mokkida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">wogara zayte mizides.<verse eid="DEU 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14"/>Miizappe dorsafenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">deysha wudeppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">beettiza maaththaninne oys</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">Baasaane dereppe beettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">ohala laaqqata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">modhdho dharshota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">wofanotanne deyshata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">lo7o gistte daabbora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">istta mizides.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Intte iza dereti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">zo7o woyne miththa ayfeppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">giigida woyne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">ushshu uyideta.<verse eid="DEU 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15"/>«Isra7eele asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">ordidessinne makkallides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">Daro miidi modhdhidessinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">moollattides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">bana medhdhida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">Xoossaa aggides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">bana ashshidayssaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">kawushshides.<verse eid="DEU 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16"/>Istti eeqa xoossatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:16">goynnidi Xoossaa mishisida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:16">bantta iita oosonkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:16">iza hanqeththida.<verse eid="DEU 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17"/>Hayssafe kase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">ba eronttaytas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">Xoos gidontta daydanththatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">mata wode yida xoossatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">beni istta aawati isttas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">goynnontta eeqatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">istti yarsho shiishshida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:20">1Qoro 10:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18"/>Istti baas de7o immida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:18">zaallaa dogida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:18">bana medhdhida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:18">Xoossaaka balida.<verse eid="DEU 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19"/>«GODAY hessa be7idi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:19">istta bolla hanqettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:19">istta macca naytanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:19">istta attuma nayta diggides.<verse eid="DEU 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20"/>‹Tani ta ayfeso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">isttafe genththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">istti geellanne ammanettontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">dere gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">istta wurseththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">ay gidanaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">ta co7u ga beyana.›<verse eid="DEU 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21"/>Tumu gidontta xoossatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">tana mishisida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">go7ay baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">ba eeqa xoossatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">tana hanqeththida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Tanikka istta kadhettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">istti miigettana mala ooththana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">Ta istta akeekontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">deretan hanqeththana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:22">1Qoro 10:22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:19">Oro 10:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22"/>Ta hanqoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">tama mala eexxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">biittanne biitta bolla diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">ubbaa xuuggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">he tamay si7oole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">ciimmaa gakkanaas eexxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">tamazi zumaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">yoch gakkanaas maana.<verse eid="DEU 32:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23"/>Tani istta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:23">zaareththa zaareththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:23">bosha ehana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:23">Taas diza wondafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:23">ta istta bolla wursana.<verse eid="DEU 32:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24"/>Ta ubbaa wursiza kosha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">istta bolla yeddana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">issaafe issaan aadhdhiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">iita hargeninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">boshan istti wurana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">meto gaththiza iita do7atanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">dukkiza marzera diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">shooshshata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">ta istta bolla yeddana.<verse eid="DEU 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25"/>Oge ubbaan istta nayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">olay wursana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">keeththa giddonkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">hirgay kumana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">panththatinne geela7oti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">guuththa naytinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">cimati ubbay wurana.<verse eid="DEU 32:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26"/>Tani istta ubbaa laallana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:26">Hessafe guye istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:26">hassa7ana asi deenna.<verse eid="DEU 32:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27"/>Gido attiin istta morkketi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">‹Nuni nu wolqqan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">istta xoonidos attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">Xoos gidenna› giidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">otoreteththan ceeqettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">tana hanqeththanaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">gaada qoppays.<verse eid="DEU 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28"/>Isra7eele asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:28">yuushshi qoppontta kawoteth;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:28">isttas akeekay deenna.<verse eid="DEU 32:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29"/>Istti erata gididaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:29">hayssa istti kasetidi qoppana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:29">bantta wurseththankka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:29">hananayssa yuushshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:29">qoppanashin!<verse eid="DEU 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30"/>Istta medhdhidayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">istta aaththi immonttaako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">GODAY istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">yeggi aggonttaako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">Issaadey 1,000 as</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">wostti gooddandee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">Woykko nam7ati 10,000 as wostti gooddanee?<verse eid="DEU 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31"/>Haray attoshin nu morkketi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:31">istta xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:31">laafa gididayssanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:31">Isra7eele Xoossaa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:31">gidonttayssa ereettes.<verse eid="DEU 32:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32"/>Nu morkketi Sodoomenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">Gamoora dere asaa mala tuna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">isttika camonne marzera diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">ayfe ayfiza woyne miththa mala.<verse eid="DEU 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33"/>Istta woyne ushshay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:33">shooshsha marze mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:33">qasseka haso shooshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:33">marze mala.<verse eid="DEU 32:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34"/>«Hayssa tani dogadinaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:34">Ta mazgaban xaafetti uttides.<verse eid="DEU 32:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35"/>Istta morkketa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">halo kessanay tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">ubbaasikka ta istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">ooso ooso mala immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">isttas dhayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">gallassi gakkida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">istti dhuphettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">eesonkka dhayana.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:19">Oro 12:19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:30">Ib 10:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36"/>Isttas wolqqay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">daaburdayssanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">isttaka maaddizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">bayndayssa be7idi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">GODAY ba asaas pirdana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">ba aylletaskka qadhettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 135:14">Maza 135:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37"/>GODAY ba asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">«Istti ammanettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">istta xoossati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">awan dizoo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">Istti baqati attiza zaallati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">awan dizoo?» gi oychchana.<verse eid="DEU 32:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38"/>Istti yarshos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">shiishshiza tolthoza midayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">istta woyne ushsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">yarshoza uyida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">istta eeqa xoossati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">ane ha7i inttena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">dendi maaddetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">qasseka inttes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">duussaso immetto.<verse eid="DEU 32:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39"/>«Tani xalla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">Xoos gididayssa erite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">taappe hara Xoossi deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">wodhizaykka paxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">woththizaykka tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">tani madunththayssinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">paththays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">ta kusheppe oonikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">inttena ashshenna.<verse eid="DEU 32:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40"/>Tani ta kushe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:40">pude salo denththada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:40">‹Ta mernaas de7ays.<verse eid="DEU 32:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41"/>Wawaci giza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">ta giththa mashshaa leefana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">ta kushey pirdas oykkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">ta morkketa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">halo kessana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">tana ixxizaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">ta istta ooso mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">isttas immana.<verse eid="DEU 32:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42"/>Morkketa halaqata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">madunxidaytanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">di7ettidayta suuththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">ta wondafeta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">ta maththosana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">ta giththa mashshatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">ta morkketa asho maana›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">ga caaqqana.<verse eid="DEU 32:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43"/>«Intteno kawoteththatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">GODAY ba oosanchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">suuth accana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">morkketa bolla halo kessana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">bana ixxizayta qaxxayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">ba dereza nagara wursana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">biittayokka tunateththafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">geeshshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">hessa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">intte iza asaara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">issife ufayettite» giidi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:10">Oro 15:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:2">Ajju 19:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44"/>Museynne Nawe naa Iyaasoy derezi siyishin ha mazamureza yootida.<verse eid="DEU 32:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurseththan Musey Immida Zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45"/>Musey hayta ha qaalata kumeththa Isra7eele asaa sissidaappe guye, <verse eid="DEU 32:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46"/>izi, «Hayssa woga qaala ubbaa intte nayti lo7eththi naagana mala, istti ooththana malanne intte nayta intte azazana mala hach ta inttes markkattiza qaala ubbaa intte wozinan woththite. <verse eid="DEU 32:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47"/>Ha qaalay inttes de7oppe attiin coo mela qaalaa gidenna; ha qaala naagikko intte Yordaanoose pinnidi laattana biittankka adussa layth intte de7ana» gides.<verse eid="DEU 32:47"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muse Hayqo Gishshas Yootettida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48"/>He gallas GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="DEU 32:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49"/>«Mo7aabe deren Iyarkko katama ginara diza Abaarime zumata giddofe Nebo zuma bolla keza; histtada tani Isra7eele asaas immana gida Kanaane biitta he pinththan xeella. <verse eid="DEU 32:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50"/>Ne isha Aarooney Hoore zumaa bolla hayqqidi kase hayqqida ba asatan gayttida mala nekka he zumaa bolla hayqqada ne asatan gayttana. <verse eid="DEU 32:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51"/>Intte nam7ayka Isra7eele asaa sinththan taas ammanettibeekketa; Xiine bazzon Qaadeese katamaa matan diza Mariiba haaththa achchan ta geeshshateththaa Isra7eele asaa bessibeekketa. <verse eid="DEU 32:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52"/>Hessa gishshas neni he biittayo haahon dashe be7ana attiin tani Isra7eele asaa laatissana biittayo neni gelakka.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:48-52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:12-14">Tay 27:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:23-27">Zaare 3:23-27</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Musey Isra7eele Asaa Bazida Bassa Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1"/>Xoossa as Musey hayqqanaappe kasetidi Isra7eele asaas woththida basse qaalay hayssafe kaalli dizayssa; <verse eid="DEU 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2"/>Musey,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">«GODAY Siina zumaappe yides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">Eedoomeppe awa arshey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">nu bolla poo7ides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">Paaraane zuma bollafekka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">nuus xolqides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">izas ushachcha baggara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">tama lacoy dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">qooday baynda kiitanchchati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">izara issife deettes.<verse eid="DEU 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3"/>GODAWU! Neni deraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">keeha siiqaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">geeshshati ubbayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">ne kushen deettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">ne toho garsan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">gulbati goynneettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">histtidi neeppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">azazo ekkeettes.<verse eid="DEU 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4"/>Musey immida wogay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:4">Isra7eele asaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:4">laata xinxxo.<verse eid="DEU 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5"/>Isra7eele qommoti ubbaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">deraa halaqati shiiqiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">GODAY ba dere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">Isra7eele asaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">kawotides» gides.<verse eid="DEU 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6"/>Oroobeele qommota gishshas Musey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">«Oroobeele qommoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">detto attiin hayqqofetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">istta qoodaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">paccofo» gides.<verse eid="DEU 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7"/>Yuhuda qommota gishshas Musey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">«GODAWU, Yuhuda qommota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">waaso siya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">istti ba dabbotara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">issifeteththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">daana mala ooththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">isttas gita</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">wolqqa imma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">istti ba morkketara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">olettishin neni istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">maadda» gides.<verse eid="DEU 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8"/>Lewe qommota gishshas Musey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">«Godawu! Neni istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">Maasan paaccadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">Mariiba haaththa achchan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">isttara palamettadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">hessa gishshas Tumimeynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">Urimey ne dosida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">ne oosanchchatas gido.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:7">Kessa 17:7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:13">Tay 20:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9"/>Ne gishshas giidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">istti bana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">yelidayta balida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">ba dabbotappe shaakettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">ba ishatappe shaakettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">ba nayta aggida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">ne qaalaa bonchchida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">ne immida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">caaqo qaalaakka naagida.<verse eid="DEU 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10"/>Istti ne woththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">maaraa Yaaqoobe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">ne wogaakka Isra7eele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">asaa tamaarseettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">istti ne sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">exaane cuwaseettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">xuugettiza yarshoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">yarsho yarshizasoza bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">shiishsheettes.<verse eid="DEU 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11"/>GODAWU! Ne istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">de7o anjja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">istti ooththiza ooso ubbaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">ne ufayetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">istta morkketa shaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">ne duuththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">istta ixxizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">nam7anththo dendontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">digga!» gides.<verse eid="DEU 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12"/>Biniyaame qommota gishshas Musey,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">«GODAY siiqida asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">izan ammanetti dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">ubba gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">istta izi naagees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">ba hashen tookkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">shempisees» gides.<verse eid="DEU 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13"/>Yooseefe qommota gishshas Musey,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">«GODAY saloppe bukkiza iran,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">biittafe pude keziza pultton</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">intte biittaa anjjo.<verse eid="DEU 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14"/>Awa wode kaxxiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:14">lo7o ayfe immo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:14">woden woden kaxxiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:14">kaththa ayfen kumo.<verse eid="DEU 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15"/>Beniisofe diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:15">istta zumatinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:15">zumbullati coranne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:15">lo7o ayfen anjjettetto.<verse eid="DEU 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16"/>Istta biittay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">lo7o miishshan kumo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">Xuugettiza tusha giddofe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">qonccida GODAA</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">kiyateththi daro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">Yooseefey ba ishata giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">halaqa gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">ha anjjoti ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">iza gakketto.<verse eid="DEU 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17"/>Yooseefe teemay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">korma boora mala yashiso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">iza kaceti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">menththa kace mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">mino gidetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">iza kaceti shiyan qoodettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">Minaase zaretanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">tammu shiyan qoodettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">Efreeme zareta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">he kacetan izi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">kawoteththata qaycana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">biitta gaxa gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">istta izi gooddana» gides.<verse eid="DEU 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18"/>Zaabiloone qommota gishshassinne Yisakoore qommota gishshas Musey,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">«Zaabiloone!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:18">Neni ne kessan ufayetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:18">Yisakoore! Nenikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:18">ne dunkaane giddon ufayetta.<verse eid="DEU 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19"/>Istti dereza pude</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">zuma bolla xeygidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">heen xilloteththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">yarsho yarshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">banttas aqotanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">dureteth abbafenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">shaaminttafe demmana» gides.<verse eid="DEU 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20"/>Gaade qommota gishshas Musey,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">«Gaade qommota zawa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">aassida Xoossay galatetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">Gaadey morkketa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">menththereththanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">gaammo mala shankkatees.<verse eid="DEU 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21"/>Halaqatas bessiza biittazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">iza naagees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">izikka lo7o biitta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">baas doorides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">deraa kaaleththizayti shiiqida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">wode izi GODAA shenenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">xillo pirda pirdides» gides.<verse eid="DEU 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22"/>Daane qommota gishshas Musey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">«Daaney Baasaaneppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">guppi ke7iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">wodalla gaammo mala» gides.<verse eid="DEU 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23"/>Niftaaleme qommota gishshas Musey,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">«Niftaalemey GODAA</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">matan dosettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">GODAA anjjonka kumides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">iza zaway abbaafe aadhdhidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">dugeha bagga gakkides» gides.<verse eid="DEU 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24"/>Aaseere qommota gishshas Musey,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">«Aaseere qommoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">hara qommotappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">aadhdhi anjjettidayta gidetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">istti ba ishata giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">dosettidayta gidetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">istta biittay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">zayten kumo.<verse eid="DEU 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25"/>Istta katamata pengeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">birataninne xarqimalan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">minni gordetetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">ba diza layth ubbaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">istti wolqqama gidetto» gides.<verse eid="DEU 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26"/>Isra7eele asawu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">Saloppe inttena maaddanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">ba teemara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">shaara bolla hemettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">intte Xoossa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">hara Xoossi deenna.<verse eid="DEU 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27"/>Mernaa Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">inttes duussaso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">Mernaas diza iza qeseti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">inttefe garsara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">diidi kaafeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">intte morkketa izi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">intte sinththafe gooddana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">intte istta dhayssana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">izi inttena maaddana.<verse eid="DEU 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28"/>Hessa gishshas Isra7eele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">asay Saloppe iray</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">izin bukkiza biittayn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">kaththinne woyne ushshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">izin kumida biittayn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">hirgay baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">saron de7ana.<verse eid="DEU 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29"/>Isra7eele asawu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">Intte ay mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">anjjettida deree!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">GODAY ashshida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">intte malay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">Izi inttes gondallenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">inttena maaddizayssa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">izan intte xooniza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">giththa mashsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">intte morkketi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">intte sinththan gufannana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">intteka istti goynnizasota laallana.<verse eid="DEU 33:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Muse Hayqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1"/>Musey Mo7aabeppe dendi pude Nebo zumaa bolla kezides; Iyarkkofe arshey mokkiza baggara diza pude Pizga zuma xeera gakkides; izi heen dishin GODAY Gala7aadeppe biidi Daane gakkanaas diza biitta ubbaa bessides. <verse eid="DEU 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2"/>Niftaaleme biitta, Efreemenne Minaase biittaa ubbaa arshey wulliza baggara diza wogga gita abbaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arshey wulliza baggara diza wogga gita abba gizayssi Mediteraane abba bessees.</char></note> gaxa gakkanaas diza Yuhuda biitta, <verse eid="DEU 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3"/>Negebenne zambay diza Iyarkko shoobbafe biidi Zo7aare gakkanaas dizaso ubbaa bessides. <verse eid="DEU 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4"/>GODAY Muses, «Abraames, Yisaaqassinne Yaaqoobes, ‹Ta intte zereththata laatissana› ga caaqqida biittaya hannoko! Hekko neni ne ayfera be7ana mala ooththadis; gido attiin ne gelakka» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Medhe 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:13">28:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5"/>Hessa gishshas GODAA oosanchcha Musey Mo7aabe biittan dishe GODAY izas yootida mala heen hayqqides. <verse eid="DEU 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6"/>GODAY Muse ahaa Mo7aabe deren diza Beeti-Pe7oore katamappe sinththan diza shoobbaan moogides; gido attiin izi moogettidaso shaakki eriza asi hach gakkanaas beettibeenna. <verse eid="DEU 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7"/>Musey hayqqishin izas layththay 120; gido attiin iza ayfey doljumibeenna; iza wolqqayka daaburbeenna. <verse eid="DEU 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8"/>Isra7eele asay Muses michay aadhdhana gakkanaas heedzdzu tammu gallas gakkanaas Mo7aabe demban kayottishe yeekkides.<verse eid="DEU 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9"/>Ba ollan izi ooththana mala Musey Nawe naa Iyaaso bolla ba kushe woththidi shuumida gishshas Iyaasoy aadho erateththaninne ayanan kumides; Isra7eele asay Iyaasos azazettides; GODAY Muse baggara isttas immida azazozakka naagida.<verse eid="DEU 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10"/>Asi asara haasayza mala GODAARA haasayda Muse mala nabey Isra7eele biittan dendibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:11">Kessa 33:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11"/>GODAY Gibxe kawozaakko, izara ooththiza halaqataakkonne kumeththa asaakko yeddidi iza baggara ooraththinne malalisiza miish ubbaa ooththida Muse mala hara nabey oonikka deenna. <verse eid="DEU 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12"/>Musey Isra7eele asaa ubbaa sinththan ooththidayssa mala wolqqamanne babisiza malaatata ooththida hara nabey mulekka deenna.<verse eid="DEU 34:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34"/>
</usx>
